  ('Fragrance Mist - 250ml', 'fragrance-mist-250ml', 'Spray yourself in sweetness. This lightweight mist smells like clouds of spun sugar and bubblegum-pink daydreams. It’s airy, joyful, and absolutely addicting—like wearing a candy carnival all day long. FEATURES Cotton candy fragrance with airy lightness Ideal for layering or solo wear Non-sticky, fast-drying mist Perfect for everyday spritzing Leaves a sweet, nostalgic trail', 'Spray yourself in sweetness. This lightweight mist smells like clouds of spun sugar and bubblegum-pink daydreams.', 2.3, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z9B8382AECB0DC3F7A619Z/45/1766911335/15dcb7e7-0bd6-42d4-8253-210cc3956265.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'body-mists-sprays'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'cosmo'), 4.5, 13, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['fragrance', 'body', 'mists', 'sprays']::text[]),
