  ('Moroccan Sidr Sugar Scrub - 600 Gram', 'moroccan-sidr-sugar-scrub-600-gram', 'Discover the purity of nature with the Sugar Scrub infused with Moroccan Sidr Herb by Jardin D Oléane – 600g A natural formula inspired by traditional Moroccan care rituals, offering your skin deep cleansing and lasting radiance. Features and Benefits: Contains natural sugar that gently exfoliates, removing impurities and dead skin cells to renew the skin. Enriched with Moroccan Sidr herb , known for its purifying and cleansing properties that deeply detoxify the skin. Helps soothe the skin and reduce inflammation, making it ideal for sensitive or stressed skin. 100% natural formula , free from harsh chemicals, and safe for regular use. Leaves the skin soft, smooth, and visibly radiant from the first use. Make Jardin D Oléane Moroccan Sidr Scrub your daily skincare companion and enjoy deeply cleansed, naturally soft, and beautifully balanced skin.', 'Discover the purity of nature with the Sugar Scrub infused with Moroccan Sidr Herb by Jardin D Oléane – 600g A natural formula inspired by t…', 2.979, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N70261409V/45/_/1763969800/f8ad99be-5562-409b-9802-474421634ead.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'skin-cleansers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'jardin-d-oleane'), 5, 5, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'cleansers', 'body', 'scrubs', 'polishes']::text[]),
  ('Gentle Exfoliating Face Scrub With Mandelic Acid And Walnuts | Removes Dead Skin And Blackheads | Detans |Gives Instant Glow| Face Scrub For Women And Men | 100Ml', 'gentle-exfoliating-face-scrub-with-mandelic-acid-and-walnuts-removes-d', 'Gently Exfoliates for Smooth Skin: Gently remove impurities for a smooth, revitalized complexion with Walnut Shell Powder. Experience softer skin with every use.. Clears Blackheads & Dead Skin: Effectively unclogs pores and sloughs away dead skin cells with Lactobionic and Mandelic Acids. Say goodbye to dullness and hello to clarity.. Brightens & Evens Tone: Enhances your skin''s natural radiance and balances pigmentation with Acai Berry. Achieve a more luminous, even-toned complexion.. Hydrates & Softens: Locks in essential moisture, leaving skin supple and soft with Shea Butter. Ensures lasting hydration and comfort.. Instant Glow: Delivers a noticeable glow after just one use with Pink Lemon Extracts. Get ready to shine bright and feel confident instantly.', 'Gently Exfoliates for Smooth Skin: Gently remove impurities for a smooth, revitalized complexion with Walnut Shell Powder.', 3.599, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/7f94360644cd4a7b954b3c02af52effb|pzsku/Z6E2F16B029E905B8FEAEZ/45/1769076242/18150293-992a-4ae0-831f-aa64d913b6d0.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/7f94360644cd4a7b954b3c02af52effb|pzsku/Z6E2F16B029E905B8FEAEZ/45/1769076242/200769b0-72f2-4528-a70d-317d86f4cb54.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/7f94360644cd4a7b954b3c02af52effb|pzsku/Z6E2F16B029E905B8FEAEZ/45/1769076242/8851bbff-6a92-4a05-b980-182468f76682.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/7f94360644cd4a7b954b3c02af52effb|pzsku/Z6E2F16B029E905B8FEAEZ/45/1769076242/f6ae7022-c50d-4c8f-8f3b-321cbd9a76a1.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'skin-cleansers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'chemist-at-play'), 0, 0, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'cleansers', 'face', 'scrubs']::text[]),
  ('Snail Truecica Miracle Repair Starter Kit Clear', 'snail-truecica-miracle-repair-starter-kit-clear', 'About the product: The ultimate Snail Truecica Scar healing set is here! Latest bestselling range by Some by Mi to promote skin rejuvenation & scar healing. If you want to get rid of your acne scar & acne spots, this is the best solution kit. 1. Miracle Repair Gel Cleanser is a slightly acidic cleanser that leaves skin moisturised after cleansing. Strengthens skin barrier with 5 kinds of Ceramide, Amino Complex & Peptides. 2. Miracle Repair Toner comes with Niacinamide to brighten up skin with White Flower Complex to even out skin tone. Patented Botaniceutical Plus-10 protects and nourishes skin. 3. Miracle Repair Serum contains Sage Extract to soothe skin barrier. Contains Allantoin to moisturise and protect skin with Wallow Bark Extract to remove dead skin cells. 4. Miracle Repair Cream soothes irritated skin quickly with 420,000ppm of Snail Truecica Ceramide and botanical Peptide strengthens skin barrier. Nourishes skin with Marine Collagen and brightens skin with Niacinamide. Some By Mi is a Korean skincare brand focused on reducing blemishes on your skin. How to use: Miracle Repair Gel Cleanser 30ml 1. Take an appropriate amount and foam enough on your face then wash off with water. Miracle Repair Toner 30ml 2. Take an appropriate amount and spread evenly onto the skin. Miracle Repair Serum 10ml 3. After the toner, apply a proper amount of serum on the entire face and pat gently for optimum absorption. Miracle Repair Cream 20g 4. Apply an appropriate amount over face and gently smooth for better absorption.', 'The ultimate Snail Truecica Scar healing set is here! Latest bestselling range by Some by Mi to promote skin rejuvenation & scar healing.', 6.495, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z904E33B7202C4C84D4C4Z/45/_/1779179181/be88578f-f191-4121-bc5a-d94396d5baf4.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z904E33B7202C4C84D4C4Z/45/_/177917918