  ('Double Chin Reducer Vibration Massager, 3 in 1 Portable Firming Wrinkle Removal Device for Neck Face ,Effective Face Appearance Wrinkles Removal', 'double-chin-reducer-vibration-massager-3-in-1-portable-firming-wrinkle', '4-in-1 Beauty and Personal Care Tool Anti Wrinkles Face Neck Massager, Creates the ultimate at-home facial: this neck and face massager is not only applied to the neck, but also to other parts of the body such as face, forehead. Massaging the forehead can reduce lift lines, massaging the jawline of the face, can tighten the facial skin. Suitable for men and women, suitable for all skin types. Skin Care: used at the same time with skin care products, it makes skin care products penetrate deeper into the skin faster and doubles the effect of skin care. Do Skin Treatment At Home As Salon: Face massager for women will get skin smooth and soften, de-puff, improve skin elasticity and retain glowing skin. Electric Face Massage Kit in gift box which is good for Christmas Day, New Year, Valentine''s Day, Mother''s Day and lady''s night. Intelligent reminder function: 4min sound remind to help you adjust massage time easily. 1st Gear (Low gear mode) Green Light, Low Speed Vibration Deep cleaning, make the skin more translucent Reduce edema calm the skin to a stable condition 2nd Gear (Medium gear mode) Red Light, Medium Speed Vibration Reduce fine lines and wrinkles relax the skin,help skin care products moisten the deep skin 3rd Gear (High gear mode) Blue Light, High Speed Vibration 45°C temperature heat therapy Rejuvenates skin, tighten sagging skin,refine skin pores', '4-in-1 Beauty and Personal Care Tool Anti Wrinkles Face Neck Massager, Creates the ultimate at-home facial: this neck and face massager is n…', 6.995, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z21459C4531C0CA9907EFZ/45/_/1678378190/07675314-5dea-4354-ba57-10876ccfe921.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z21459C4531C0CA9907EFZ/45/_/1678378192/6e0ce2fc-543d-406c-8399-3efb90