  ('Amazing Sudanese Dalka for Exfoliating Face And Body - 250g', 'amazing-sudanese-dalka-for-exfoliating-face-and-body-250g', 'Benefits of the amazing lightening massage: 1- Lightening the skin: The mixture of starch, orange and turmeric works to lighten the skin tone and reduce the appearance of dark spots. Removing dead hair: The massage helps gently remove dead skin cells and unwanted hair, giving the skin a smooth appearance. 2- Moisturizing the skin: It contains moisturizing ingredients that prevent dry skin and maintain its softness. Soothing the skin: Free of harsh chemicals, which reduces the risk of redness or sensitivity. Safe for pregnant women and postpartum: Natural ingredients and safe for use during pregnancy and after childbirth, making it ideal for women during these periods. Improving skin elasticity: Helps enhance skin elasticity and a healthy appearance. 3-Cleansing pores: It works to deeply cleanse the pores, which reduces the appearance of acne and pimples. Antioxidants: Oranges contain antioxidants that help fight free radicals, which maintains healthy skin. 4-Increase skin radiance: Helps to give the skin a natural glow.', 'Benefits of the amazing lightening massage: 1- Lightening the skin: The mixture of starch, orange and turmeric works to lighten the skin ton…', 3.615, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBF8A4AFC20DED918E4F8Z/45/_/1733073032/a8c7da10-7e12-4bda-a8ca-c27c0faafb61.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'skin-cleansers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'clenz'), 5, 2, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'cleansers', 'body', 'scrubs', 'polishes']::text[]),
