  ('Eye Contour Serum Anti Puffiness And Dark Circles 16ml', 'eye-contour-serum-anti-puffiness-and-dark-circles-16ml', 'Pamper your eyes with the luxurious Caffeine Eye Serum from Jardin Olean, specially designed to address puffiness and dark circles around the eye area. With its advanced, nourishing formula, this serum combines caffeine and Vitamin B3 to give you a bright, refreshed look, free from fatigue. Key Ingredients: Caffeine: Helps reduce puffiness under the eyes and stimulates blood circulation to enhance skin radiance. Vitamin B3 (Niacinamide): Helps lighten dark circles, even out skin tone, and improve skin elasticity around the eyes. Arabica Coffee Extract: Rich in antioxidants, it combats signs of fatigue and soothes the skin. Features & Benefits: Reduces Puffiness & Dark Circles: Caffeine and Vitamin B3 work effectively to minimize the appearance of puffiness and dark circles under the eyes. Brightens & Lightens the Skin: Helps brighten the delicate skin around the eyes, giving you a refreshed, radiant appearance. Deep Hydration: Deeply hydrates the skin, reducing dryness around the eyes and improving skin elasticity. Anti-Wrinkle & Fine Lines: Enhances skin elasticity and softens the appearance of fine lines under the eyes. Suitable for All Skin Types: Its gentle, paraben-free formula makes it suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin. Improves Skin Texture: Enhances the texture of the skin around the eyes, making it softer and healthier. Instant & Long-Lasting Results: Provides an instantly refreshed look with long-term results with regular use. How to Use: Apply a few drops of the serum under the eyes in the morning and evening. Gently massage in circular motions until the serum is fully absorbed. For best results, use it daily as part of your skincare routine. Note: Do not rinse the serum after application. Allow it to fully absorb into the skin. Make Jardin Olean''s Caffeine Eye Serum a part of your daily routine for brighter, more refreshed eyes. With regular use, you''ll enjoy smoother, rejuvenated skin free from fatigue.', 'Pamper your eyes with the luxurious Caffeine Eye Serum from Jardin Olean, specially designed to address puffiness and dark circles around th…', 4.037, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N70169278V/45/_/1745222047/60598d6e-a871-4e22-aa23-8f46d5e5902d.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'eye-treatments'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'jardin-d-oleane'), 4.6, 16, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'eye', 'treatments', 'serums']::text[]),
  ('Portable 4 in 1 Cavitation Vacuum RF Machine 40K Cavitation Slimming RF Body Tripolar RF Head for Spa/Home Facial Machine', 'portable-4-in-1-cavitation-vacuum-rf-machine-40k-cavitation-slimming-r', '【RF Application】The cavitation 40k cellulite weight loss machine concentrates the radio frequency energy in the right place to achieve the effect of skin rejuvenation and body sculpting. Can effectively burn calories, so as to achieve the effect of eliminating fat. At the same time promote metabolism, restore skin elasticity, calm and moisturize. 【Wrinkle Removal】The body beauty probe machine removes facial wrinkles and tightens the skin. Using positive and negative micro-currents to activate skin cells that release energy, prompt fibroblasts to rapidly synthesize collagen, thereby shrinking pores, reducing wrinkles, and restoring skin elasticity, health and luster. 【4 Replaceable Heads】The body grooming tool is equipped with 4 replaceable functional grooming heads, suitable for different body parts, ensuring its high efficiency. Adjustable intensity to suit your needs. It works better with gel or serum. 【Scope of application】Low energy and high frequency, safe and effective; equipped with 4 functional beauty heads, which can treat different parts of the body to ensure high efficiency; suitable for face, neck, abdomen, waist, thighs, calves, buttocks. Product description Feature: 1. 40K ultrasonic beauty head, endowed with super energy, can effectively reduce subcutaneous fat, so as to achieve the purpose of firming. 2. Use the principle of electric wave lifting to effectively stimulate cells, promote the regeneration of loose skin cells, and tighten and lift. 3. Red LED light: whitening, relieving stress, eliminating wrinkles, repairing damaged skin, promoting collagen production. 4. 40K body slimming + 5MRF radio frequency, body shaping classic function combination, this machine is the smallest size that the combination can achieve, and the price is very high. Specification: Product Name: Cellulite Massager Main device material: ABS Product color: white Touch screen size: 4.3 inches Frequency: 40kHZ Power input: 100V-240V Output power: 24V-5A Packing list: Host*1 Handle tray*1 Handle bracket*1 Power plug*1 Cavitation 40K*1 Tripolar RF*1 Multipolar RF*1 Vacuum RF*1 Manual*1 Notes: 1. Due to manual measurement, please allow 2-3cm deviation. Thank you for your understanding. 2. Different monitors are calibrated differently, the color of the item shown in the photo may be slightly different from the actual item. Please refer to the actual product.', '【RF Application】The cavitation 40k cellulite weight loss machine concentrates the radio frequency energy in the right place to achieve the e…', 48.599, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/d28483b8d41c510487c67dae970869d0|pzsku/Z71C39CCB6B42DF0BF528Z/45/1771036378/b3cd510f-72c0-4b55-ab43-167aa8e9fb35.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/d28483b8d41c510487c67dae970869d0|pzsku/Z71C39CCB6B42DF0BF528Z/45/1771036378/595f1ec1-9443-4688-86cd-5e45c6389d14.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z71C39CCB6B42DF0BF528Z/45/1755759718/db411d26-d04b-4520-be2d-cb102affdab7.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z71C39CCB6B42DF0BF528Z/45/1755759719/2d442f71-384c-43bc-ab30-858690b9188a.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'facial-machines'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'evereen'), 4.4, 24, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'facial', 'machines']::text[]),
  ('Vc Toner Refreshing Hydrating Rejuvenating Wet Compre 500ML', 'vc-toner-refreshing-hydrating-rejuvenating-wet-compre-500ml', 'Online shopping for KNIYEA. Trusted Shipping to Riyadh, Jeddah and all KSA ✓ Great Prices ✓ Secure Shopping ✓ 100% Contactless ✓ Easy Free Returns ✓ Cash on Delivery. Shop Now', 'Online shopping for KNIYEA. Trusted Shipping to Riyadh, Jeddah and all KSA ✓ Great Prices ✓ Secure Shopping ✓ 100% Contactless ✓ Easy Free R…', 3.7, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE202D87F52319BF24B78Z/45/1748977516/5d837fad-7c98-4572-a11b-7394b7e512d0.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE202D87F52319BF24B78Z/45/1748792510/00bd7f20-b91b-48b8-9ee7-f7075760f202.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE202D87F52319BF24B78Z/45/1748977584/a3c4a97c-7ad9-4c91-8292-587a1818bafb.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE202D87F52319BF24B78Z/45/1748977634/80d82f5c-ae7a-468a-9879-b8c428306399.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'skin-cleansers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'kniyea'), 4.6, 50, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'cleansers', 'toner']::text[]),
  ('Dusting Body Powder 200grams', 'dusting-body-powder-200grams', 'Treat skin infections in an effective manner with the Franck Olivier 200g Dusting Powder. The scent is especially captured from the freesia flower that is known for its soothing fragrance and aroma. It is incredibly soft and safe to use. Spread it on the affected area to stop bacterial growth. The delicate fragrance and its aroma stays with you throughout the day without fading. The Franck Olivier anti-fungal powder very effectively fights germs in the affected area. This skin-friendly powder is suitable for all skin types. The lasting formula keeps the skin dry and fresh all day long.', 'Treat skin infections in an effective manner with the Franck Olivier 200g Dusting Powder.', 10.865, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N32606100A/45/_/1697450117/5fe5d0b8-7c94-438e-9217-ed0f7c01a776.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N32606100A/45/_/1697450116/92eb60b5-81fb-48b3-9d68-2a51db14e46c.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N32606100A/45/_/1697450116/f315cacc-6b95-443d-86c8-a72f2b246c06.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N32606100A/45/_/1697450117/b2cd4d1f-db49-4796-aa2b-b9ef98c125ad.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'body-talcum-powders'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'franck-olivier'), 4.3, 2492, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'body', 'talcum', 'powders']::text[]),
  ('Gentle Skin Cleanser, Face And Body Wash For Dry To Normal, Sensitive Skin, Unscented clear 236ml', 'gentle-skin-cleanser-face-and-body-wash-for-dry-to-normal-sensitive-sk', 'About the brand: Cetaphil is a skincare brand that has been recommended by dermatologists for over 70 years, and is used today by millions with sensitive skin from all over the world. About the Product: This creamy formula is clinically proven to provide very good hydration to protect from dryness, all while leaving the skin hydrated after cleansing. Formulated to gently yet effectively remove dirt, makeup and impurities, plus a dermatologist-backed blend of niacinamide (essential vitamin B3), panthenol (pro-vitamin B5) and hydrating glycerin to preserve the skin''s natural moisture barrier. Defends against 5 signs of skin sensitivity including dryness, irritation, roughness, tightness and a weakened skin barrier. How to Use: Directions for use with water: For use on face and body. Apply cleanser and gently massage into skin. Rinse. Directions for use without water: Apply a liberal amount of cleanser and gently massage into skin. Remove excess with a soft cloth, leaving a thin transparent film on the skin. Ingredients: AQUA, GLYCERIN, CETEARYL ALCOHOL, PANTHENOL, NIACINAMIDE, PANTOLACTONE, XANTHAN GUM, SODIUM COCOYL ISETHIONATE, SODIUM BENZOATE, CITRIC ACID. FIL.1747.V00', 'About the brand: Cetaphil is a skincare brand that has been recommended by dermatologists for over 70 years, and is used today by millions w…', 6.61, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z676D8E8C482E9B6F9E26Z/45/_/1779179013/e6375f86-1a11-400e-9049-4ff1313aa046.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z676D8E8C482E9B6F9E26Z/45/_/1779179013/6fb672d4-ab69-491d-a1f2-0d6220cbc27a.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z676D8E8C482E9B6F9E26Z/45/_/1779179013/5d5f4040-aa80-4272-b3d5-528622f1629a.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z676D8E8C482E9B6F9E26Z/45/_/1779179013/ed6f109c-8533-4d8d-8c23-