  ('Heartleaf Quercetinol Pore Deep Cleansing Foam White 150ml', 'heartleaf-quercetinol-pore-deep-cleansing-foam-white-150ml', 'The cleansing foam contains Houttuynia Cordata Powder to remove dead skin and waste in pores. Contains Houttuynia Cordata Extract and Quercetin to calm the irritation caused by cleansing. Includes patented Anti-Sebum P to remove excess sebum. Suitable for acne-prone skin', 'The cleansing foam contains Houttuynia Cordata Powder to remove dead skin and waste in pores.', 6, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZD19D8D06A58FE5F48B37Z/45/_/1779791557/44b49cf1-2fb1-43dc-b493-3aeba3c37388.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZD19D8D06A58FE5F48B37Z/45/_/1779791557/418c43fa-b7cf-4e81-b501-b76f661a9984.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZD19D8D06A58FE5F48B37Z/45/_/1779791557/3c16dd87-89f3-486e-b511-1c6d5508cc0e.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZD19D8D06A58FE5F48B37Z/45/_/1779791557/f444918f-2911-44bf-aab3-d986eee2f934.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'skin-cleansers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'anua'), 4.2, 183, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'cleansers', 'face', 'wash']::text[]),
  ('Glycolic Bright Glowing Day Cream with SPF30 and Glycolic Acid 50ML', 'glycolic-bright-glowing-day-cream-with-spf30-and-glycolic-acid-50ml', 'L’ORÉAL PARIS GLYCOLIC-BRIGHT GLOWING FACE CREAM DAY WITH SPF 17 is clinically proven to increase skin’s protective shield against harmful UV rays. Formulated with Glycolic Acid, it visibly reduces the appearance of dullness and dark spots, for visibly even, smooth and glowing skin .THE SCIENCE BEHIND BRIGHTENING GLYCOLIC ACID With the smallest molecular weight amongst all brightening Alpha Hydroxy Acids, it is absorbed deeply to help with skin rejuvenation. GLYCOLIC-BRIGHT GLOWING CREAM DAY WITH SPF 17 formulated with glycolic acid instantly acts on the 4 dimensions of glow: (1) Visibly reduces dark spots; (2) Smooths skin texture; (3) Evens tone; (4) Improves radiance. VISIBLE RESULTS: Immediately: Skin feels moisturized and looks more radiant. Day after day: Dark spots are visibly reduced. Skin looks more even and brighter. How to use: Smooth over face and neck every morning. Layers well under makeup', 'L’ORÉAL PARIS GLYCOLIC-BRIGHT GLOWING FACE CREAM DAY WITH SPF 17 is clinically proven to increase skin’s protective shield against harmful U…', 4.5, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z362CABB78B0769A8CCD2Z/45/1754836722/c752b0a2-642e-4611-bd73-2240a971bc9c.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z362CABB78B0769A8CCD2Z/45/1754836748/ebf175c9-3611-485f-b4f1-119c0ed0d370.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z362CABB78B0769A8CCD2Z/45/1754836748/7fd8b9ab-607a-4d1e-9903-a17a00029bed.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z362CABB78B0769A8CCD2Z/45/1754836748/8d110362-1853-479c-9b44-582e79fd40f7.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'l-oreal-paris'), 4.4, 1737, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Moisturizing Cream For Dry Skin With Hyaluronic Acid 454grams', 'moisturizing-cream-for-dry-skin-with-hyaluronic-acid-454grams', 'CeraVe Moisturizing Cream includes three essential ceramides and hyaluronic acid to effectively hydrate the skin and restore the skin’s protective barrier. Developed with dermatologists and suitable for dry and very dry skin on the face and body, this rich, non-greasy, fast-absorbing moisturizing cream features our patented MVE Delivery Technology to release a steady stream of moisturizing ingredients throughout the day and night. While a compromised skin barrier can lead to dryness and itching, a moisturizing cream with hyaluronic acid and ceramides can help. By hydrating the skin and restoring its natural barrier, a cream with these ingredients can help those with even dry to very dry skin improve the look and feel of their skin. CeraVe Moisturizing Cream with ceramides is fragrance free. Usage for Men and Women. Safe for babies 2 months and older.', 'CeraVe Moisturizing Cream includes three essential ceramides and hyaluronic acid to effectively hydrate the skin and restore the skin’s prot…', 14.385, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z35013FF4846F7406876CZ/45/_/1779179162/f7487522-e4d1-41d0-be68-658276068f21.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z35013FF4846F7406876CZ/45/_/1779179162/0120e202-d051-40ec-84fc-42d0a3cf8041.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z35013FF4846F7406876CZ/45/_/1779179162/d6802472-c0dc-483d-bba9-4b022acff531.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z35013FF4846F7406876CZ/45/_/1779179163/26bb6690-c670-4382-8f96-63bc954919be.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'cerave'), 4.4, 5882, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Sun Liposomal Lotion Spf 50+, Face And Body Moisturizer Sunscreen For Sensitive Skin, Very High Protection And Extra Water Resistant. Contains Essential Vitamin E And Aloe Vera, Unscented 50ml', 'sun-liposomal-lotion-spf-50-face-and-body-moisturizer-sunscreen-for-se', 'For dry and sensitive skin The moisturizing sunscreen lotion provides instant waterproof sunscreen for dry and sensitive skin. Very high SPF 50+ reliably protects against UVA and UVB rays Contains aloe vera and vitamin E Fast-absorbing liposomal formula makes it easy to spread over the skin without stickiness Provides the skin with valuable moisture Extra water resistant, in both fresh and salt water', 'For dry and sensitive skin The moisturizing sunscreen lotion provides instant waterproof sunscreen for dry and sensitive skin.', 6.75, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z547D9CCB7F7DA3D57040Z/45/_/1779179031/9920f7be-bcd2-40b2-99ea-6f85070b7a2f.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z547D9CCB7F7DA3D57040Z/45/_/1779179030/9b23b265-85fc-4ec6-95ed-47d11cec1458.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z547D9CCB7F7DA3D57040Z/45/_/1779179031/350a46f9-e55c-408a-8e83-aec78b6a7124.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z547D9CCB7F7DA3D57040Z/45/_/1779179030/ec0b9bc6-139c-4d7a-ac09-5fe8a4cef6ee.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'sun-care'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'cetaphil'), 4.4, 126, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'sun', 'sunscreen']::text[]),
  ('Exfoliating Body Scrub For Removing Tan And Dead Skin Cells | Rough And Bumpy Skin, Tanned And Pigmented Skin | For Smooth, Soft And Bright Skin | Natural Ahas | Coffee | For Men And Women | 75', 'exfoliating-body-scrub-for-removing-tan-and-dead-skin-cells-rough-and', 'EXFOLIATION: This exfoliating body scrub is filled with chemical and physical exfoliants like Coffee, Sugar & natural AHAs, which help to remove accumulated dirt and dead skin cells from your body. It also helps remove sun tan to give even toned skin.. NOURISHED SKIN: The gentle scrub helps to soothe skin inflammation and nourish the skin, leaving you with a smooth, velvety effect on your skin. This non-drying formula also helps maintain the skin barrier of the skin.. HOW TO USE: Hey you, it''s time to shed off that rough and bumpy dead skin and stubborn tan! Take a generous amount of the exfoliating scrub and work it into your skin in circular motions. Spend a little time on those uneven tone areas, we know they need some extra lovin''. Rinse it off and get ready to say goodbye to that sun-slapped, dull & dry skin. We recommend doing a patch test for the sensitive skin types. Note: Only to be used on the body, not your face.. WHY OUR EXFOLIATING BODY SCRUB: This gentle and safe formula is formulated with only the right ingredients. Hence, the scrub is free of Silicones, Parabens, Sulphate, Phthalate, Alcohol and Mineral Oil.. SPECIALLY FORMULATED FOR YOU: This gentle, easy to use Exfoliating Body Scrub is good for all skin types and whoever wishes to remove all the gunk (dead skin, rough bumps, and tan) while smelling like a fresh cup of coffee.', 'EXFOLIATION: This exfoliating body scrub is filled with chemical and physical exfoliants like Coffee, Sugar & natural AHAs, which help to re…', 3.009, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/7f94360644cd4a7b954b3c02af52effb|pzsku/Z009EADC7EFB961BB0821Z/45/1769076242/b6df5ecf-1d7c-4810-9091-ab5c9b4f8e8a.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/7f9436064