  ('Original Sudanese Dalka Natural, Unique Skin Moisturizing and Exfoliating Recipe Musk -100 g', 'original-sudanese-dalka-natural-unique-skin-moisturizing-and-exfoliati', 'Sudanese Dalka is one of the traditional skin care treatments that has many benefits. Here is a summary of the benefits and the method you can follow to get the best results: How to use: 1-Take a sufficient amount of the Dalka and mix it with water until you get a suitable consistency. Applying the Dalka : Put the Dalka on the body. 2-Massage: Massage your body in a gentle circular motion. 3-Wait: Leave the Dalka on the body for 3 to 5 minutes. 4-Removing the Dalka : Use a small amount of oil and rub the body to remove the Dalka and exfoliate the skin. Wash the body with water only, then moisturize it. Additional notes: To get rid of the smell of the Dalka , wash the body well with a shower gel and use a scented lotion.', 'Sudanese Dalka is one of the traditional skin care treatments that has many benefits.', 2.795, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZF3BE16F953C78EB3F22BZ/45/_/1739030943/fa3c0ca7-ec77-4b45-9995-00252a0b6397.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZF3BE16F953C78EB3F22BZ/45/_/1739118551/d05fcde4-8307-4c0c-9d1d-17f786a8f387.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZF3BE16F953C78EB3F22BZ/45/_/1739118553/423d8fb2-a1a7-451e-8c6a-956b8e661f0f.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZF3BE16F953C78EB3F22BZ/45/_/1739118554/5e2310e1-7571-4ce4-a955-4e83c7cc1937.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'skin-cleansers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'clenz'), 4.1, 18, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'cleansers', 'body', 'scrubs', 'polishes']::text[]),
  ('Adjustable Microneedling Stamp Professional Microneedle Skin Stamp Skin Care Tools for Face', 'adjustable-microneedling-stamp-professional-microneedle-skin-stamp-ski', '140 medical-grade titanium alloy microneedles: With sharp, smooth tips that are hypoallergenic and safe, they create clean, fine channels that significantly enhance serum absorption. Each set can be used reliably for 40–50 treatments. 0.25–3.0 mm adjustable needle length: Precisely adapts to different scenarios, suitable for both beginners and advanced users: 0.25–0.5 mm: Daily care, promotes absorption of moisturizing and anti-aging serums 1.0–1.5 mm: Improves fine lines and rough skin texture; reduces hair loss when used for scalp care 2.0–3.0 mm: Provides deep repair for acne scars, scars, and stubborn hyperpigmentation Ergonomic, non-slip handle: Comfortable grip and easy to control; suitable for the face, neck, body, scalp, and beard area without pulling hair. 💎 Visible skincare results Anti-aging and firming, wrinkle reduction and revitalization: Activates skin fibroblasts to promote collagen production, reducing fine lines, dry lines, and acne scars for smoother, plumper skin. Pore minimization and skin texture refinement: Improves enlarged pores, blackheads, whiteheads, and residual acne marks; say goodbye to roughness and achieve clear, smooth, and radiant skin. Fades Dark Spots, Brightens Complexion: Addresses pigmentation issues such as sunspots, acne scars, and melasma, resulting in a more even, luminous complexion with a natural soft-focus glow. Scalp Care, Strengthens Hair Roots: Promotes scalp blood circulation, revitalizes hair follicles, reduces hair loss, and helps create thicker, fuller hair. Improves Stretch Marks/Cellulite: Fades stretch marks and cellulite on the abdomen and thighs, enhances skin elasticity, and provides comprehensive body care.', '140 medical-grade titanium alloy microneedles: With sharp, smooth tips that are hypoallergenic and safe, they create clean, fine channels th…', 2.5, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZFB657E00D3C2F25AE125Z/45/_/1779860197/79b99323-874c-4c25-b6df-973dfc4d8360.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZFB657E00D3C2F25AE125Z/45/_/1779860194/13146a55-ea92-4f72-a391-5c3233773db5.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZFB657E00D3C2F25AE125Z/45/_/1779860194/5664e072-bdb5-47c0-977e-fba92d31aebd.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZFB657E00D3C2F25AE125Z/45/_/1779860194/3f60e9e1-97c6-4287-8978-8a8ecd242728.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'tools-accessories'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'lo-baby-ve'), 4.5, 74, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'tools', 'accessories', 'face', 'massagers']::text[]),
