  ('SkinActive Fast Bright Night Cream With Vitamin C Clear 50ml', 'skinactive-fast-bright-night-cream-with-vitamin-c-clear-50ml', 'About the product: Night time is the ideal time for skin to revive itself. Discover the new Garnier Fast Fairness Vitamin C Yoghurt Night Cream, a unique brightening yoghurt care that acts like a mask for a spotless, even and visibly fairer skin. Wake up to renewed, fairer skin! From the first night, skin is visibly fairer and dark spots are less visible. Your skin blooms with a renewed radiance. *Consumer test, self-assessment, 410 women. About the brand: Since 1904, Garniers&rsquo; mission has been to offer efficient, innovative haircare and skin care products inspired by nature and enhanced by our expertise for healthly-looking beauty that makes it easy to connect with others. How to use: 1. Apply every night on a perfectly cleansed face and neck. 2. For best results, complete the routine with Fast Fairness Day Cream. 3. Do not apply to delicate eye contour area or irritated skin. No need to rinse.', 'Night time is the ideal time for skin to revive itself.', 2.71, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N33650081A/45/_/1767607781/051b36d4-257f-4973-80f7-1b0ee24cd187.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N33650081A/45/_/1764242106/a63e1b96-2a20-48ec-85ba-8dd02f874710.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N33650081A/45/_/1764242117/9d84b4d2-c281-498b-80f0-1634e59d2203.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N33650081A/45/_/1764242095/7790f894-ee95-4a73-a5a4-75da9705753c.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'garnier'), 4.3, 1719, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'night', 'cream']::text[]),
