  ('kojic Acid Skin Care set include Moisturizing And Anti Aging And Lighten Spots (5 Pieces )', 'kojic-acid-skin-care-set-include-moisturizing-and-anti-aging-and-light', 'This set is enriched with kojic acid and a variety of plant extracts to rapidly brighten skin, keep moisturised and well hydrated and effectively fix dark spots and uneven skin tone, leaving the skin fair, soft and smooth all day. This Kojic Acid Skin Care Series 5 Piece Set Comes in a Gift Box that Includes the Following Products. Kojic Acid Face Wash - 100g Kojic Acid Face Cream - 50g Kojic Acid Sunscreen Cream 80g Kojic Acid Essence Toner - 100ml Kojic Acid Face Serum - 40ml', 'This set is enriched with kojic acid and a variety of plant extracts to rapidly brighten skin, keep moisturised and well hydrated and effect…', 4.75, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBC3983E68714791E6849Z/45/_/1776846372/0f2fea9e-1931-47ac-8cdf-ee52b0e2743e.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBC3983E68714791E6849Z/45/_/1777221343/23de9b00-4b25-4c5e-a75a-52a5b8952af7.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBC3983E68714791E6849Z/45/_/1777221401/796623c1-7297-45a1-989c-a1102085aabb.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBC3983E68714791E6849Z/45/_/1777221545/0424bd05-217e-4ef2-800b-e9e3dd77e529.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'finura'), 4.2, 109, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Mela B3 Niacinamide Face Serum; Dark Spot Corrector with Melasyl Anti-Aging Technology; Treats Pigmentation; Sun Spots, and Acne Marks for All Skin Types 30ML', 'mela-b3-niacinamide-face-serum-dark-spot-corrector-with-melasyl-anti-a', 'Clinically proven to correct dark spots, even persistent ones. Clinically proven on all skin tones and all types of dark spots, including age spots, sun spots, pigmented marks (post-acne, post-scarring) Evens out skin tone, acne marks and reduces hyperpigmentation Achieves the optimal efficacy while ensuring non comedogenicity and very good tolerance even for sensitive skin Melasyl has a new and unique mechanism of action. It intercepts excess Melanin before it marks the skin.', 'Clinically proven to correct dark spots, even persistent ones.', 14.695, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBF226D956B38D07FA9C8Z/45/_/1778155577/31ec99b8-e7cb-4772-af8c-12b0a0be5a85.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBF226D956B38D07FA9C8Z/45/_/1778155577/65c49ede-a8dc-4fad-ac2f-1fe559f69aed.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBF226D956B38D07FA9C8Z/45/_/1778155578/ee1da55e-8f86-4e06-88f5-56c6c03b528b.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBF226D956B38D07FA9C8Z/45/_/1778155577/502533cf-b6a1-4874-a6ba-db843f7f7f8c.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'treatment-serums'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'la-roche-posay'), 4.4, 2228, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'treatment', 'serums', 'face']::text[]),
  ('A6 PRO Derma Pen, Professional Microneedling Pen, Ultima 2*12 Pin, 2*24 Pin, 2*36 Pin', 'a6-pro-derma-pen-professional-microneedling-pen-ultima-2-12-pin-2-24-p', '①KinseiBeauty A6 PRO has a powerful motor of up to 15,000RPM.. ②Built-in LED screen with a 5-speed control. Meet your different needs.. ③The A6 PRO has a built-in rechargeable battery and USB Type-C charging interface that has four hours of battery life.. ④Allowing you to target every skincare concern.. ⑥Improve wrinkle and fine lines, anti-hair removal. Treatment of acne scars and healing wounds.', '①KinseiBeauty A6 PRO has a powerful motor of up to 15,000RPM.. ②Built-in LED screen with a 5-speed control. Meet your different needs..', 14.5, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z02E5D5BB2B42D91331A3Z/45/1745975331/a53cb59d-67c5-4137-8914-86b2d01dca5d.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z02E5D5BB2B42D91331A3Z/45/1745975341/ef097100-58b7-49ab-9805-fcd4322b9a48.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z02E5D5BB2B42D91331A3Z/45/1745975346/f2585240-01ed-48db-aa3f-d9e226ecab75.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z02E5D5BB2B42D91331A3Z/45/1745975352/002bcdd5-d9f1-42f9-9357-a26a6aa81811.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'tools-accessories'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'kinseibeauty'), 4.6, 229, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'tools', 'accessories', 'blackhead', 'acne']::text[]),
