  ('Oily Skin Cleanser, Face And Body Wash For Men And Women, Combination To Oily And Sensitive Skin, Unscented 236ml', 'oily-skin-cleanser-face-and-body-wash-for-men-and-women-combination-to', 'Skin type: For combination to oily skin, sensitive skin Specially formulated, low lather gel deep cleanses and minimizes the appearance of pores without stripping skin of natural moisture. • Designed with a dermatologist-backed blend of niacinamide (vitamin B3) and panthenol (pro-vitamin B5) to preserve the natural skin barrier • Clinically proven to deep clean while effectively removing dirt, excess oils and makeup without leaving skin dry or tight • Dermatologist tested and clinically proven to be gentle on sensitive skin', 'Skin type: For combination to oily skin, sensitive skin Specially formulated, low lather gel deep cleanses and minimizes the appearance of p…', 6.475, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZD2181BCD0F7A6D7A847DZ/45/_/1779178956/d625f8d8-dacd-4ccb-819b-741d083bb98b.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZD2181BCD0F7A6D7A847DZ/45/_/1779178954/deaa054b-3547-49f5-b090-17a24ee45464.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZD2181BCD0F7A6D7A847DZ/45/_/1779178954/b1f1f818-8f46-4529-90f7-d4a038d4e8fe.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZD2181BCD0F7A6D7A847DZ/45/_/1779178956/ed5b04a7-2898-47bd-a130-c289b20475c6.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'skin-cleansers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'cetaphil'), 4.2, 136, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'cleansers', 'face', 'wash']::text[]),
  ('Sun Spf 50+ Light Gel, Moisturizer Sunscreen Face And Body For Men And Women, Sensitive Skin, Very High Protection And Very Water Resistent, Unscented 50ml', 'sun-spf-50-light-gel-moisturizer-sunscreen-face-and-body-for-men-and-w', 'A light & oil-free sunscreen gel with a very high protection SPF 50+ against UVB, UVA & IR. Easy to spread with fast absorption & non-sticky results leaving the skin feeling great. It is extra water-resistant (in both freshwater and saltwater), sweat-proof, and offers long-lasting protection from the sun. Extremely gentle on the skin. How to use: Apply liberally 15 minutes before sun exposure, reapply at least every 2 hours, reapply after 80 minutes of swimming or sweating, reapply immediately after towel drying. Ingredients: AQUA, ETHYLHEXYL METHOXYCINNAMATE, ALCOHOL, C12-15 ALKYL BENZOATE. DIETHYLAMINO HYDROXYBENZOYL HEXYL BENZOATE, BIS-ETHYLHEXYLOXYPHENOL METHOXYPHENYL TRIAZINE, DIBUTYL ADIPATE, TITANIUM DIOXIDE (NANO), DIMETHICONE, VP/EICOSENE COPOLYMER, CYCLODEXTRIN, ETHYLHEXYL TRIAZONE. METHYLENE BIS-BENZOTRIAZOLYL TETRAMETHYLBUTYL- PHENOL (NANO), TOCOPHEROL, POLYGLYCERYL-2 DIPOLYHYDROXYSTEARATE, SILICA, DECYL GLUCOSIDE, TRIETHANOLAMINE, XANTHAN GUM, ACRYLATES/C10-30 ALKYL ACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER, TRISODIUM ETHYLENEDIAMINE DISUCCINATE, LAURYL GLUCOSIDE, BHT, PROPYLENE GLYCOL. FI.L 0898', 'A light & oil-free sunscreen gel with a very high protection SPF 50+ against UVB, UVA & IR.', 7.657, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z8545AADD1DF764445EB2Z/45/_/1779179147/a4b1791c-69a9-48f7-84c7-a76a31e15526.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z8545AADD1DF764445EB2Z/45/_/1779179147/cea62947-6a76-4869-a0c6-190ce2979bd7.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z8545AADD1DF764445EB2Z/45/_/1779179147/8ab21394-d6bc-46be-8186-fdb9bccaeca6.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z8545AADD1DF764445EB2Z/45/_/1779179147/c9648b93-fe8e-4c9c-be89-ec7740b8049b.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories w