  ('24K Gold And Collagen Youthful Brightening Whitening Cream 30ml', '24k-gold-and-collagen-youthful-brightening-whitening-cream-30ml', 'Aids in repairing and protecting skin while reducing wrinkles and fine lines. Collagen formulation reduces the signs of aging by maintaining the elasticity of the skin. Enriched in ingredients that help to tighten skin, rendering a firm and youthful look. Cream helps in whitening of the skin', 'Aids in repairing and protecting skin while reducing wrinkles and fine lines.', 1.65, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z073B07FF70D5FDEA4411Z/45/_/1779179307/38ebd36d-4d9e-481d-9da9-35f6bc93ea11.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z073B07FF70D5FDEA4411Z/45/_/1779179307/a5b34fb2-e19e-4fa2-a4e9-ee2f0214cef7.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z073B07FF70D5FDEA4411Z/45/_/1779179307/f3e5fe3d-a4a9-4760-94ba-47b19aae9a0e.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z073B07FF70D5FDEA4411Z/45/_/1779179307/67d14332-5a5a-4619-9001-afaf922ae94e.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'treatment-serums'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'dr-rashel'), 4.2, 222, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'treatment', 'serums', 'whitening', 'lightening']::text[]),
  ('Collagen Anti Aging Face Cream for All Skin Types, Daily Facial Skin Care Cream Boosts Skin Elasticity & Smooth Texture, 100g', 'collagen-anti-aging-face-cream-for-all-skin-types-daily-facial-skin-ca', 'Deep nourishment: Rich in collagen and a variety of natural plant extracts, it deeply nourishes the skin, enhances elasticity, improves skin texture, and gives you a tighter and smoother skin feel.. Anti-wrinkle and firming: It effectively reduces fine lines and wrinkles, promotes the production of skin collagen, and helps restore the skin''s youthful and firm state.. Whitening and brightening: Contains whitening ingredients, can even out skin tone, fade dullness, enhance skin radiance, and make the skin look brighter and more vibrant.. Strong moisturizing: The unique moisturizing formula quickly penetrates the skin, provides long-lasting moisture lock, keeps the skin hydrated, and resists skin problems caused by dryness.. Quick absorption: Light texture, quickly absorbed by the skin, non-greasy, suitable for all skin types, and feel the comfort and softness of the skin immediately after use.', 'Deep nourishment: Rich in collagen and a variety of natural plant extracts, it deeply nourishes the skin, enhances elasticity, improves skin…', 3.9, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZB864145988A9E530B381Z/45/1742783156/f39cd82c-4d3a-40c7-b0b1-f65911f93c79.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZB864145988A9E530B381Z/45/1742783252/6f210735-57f9-4923-b6eb-42a6d30472c1.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZB864145988A9E530B381Z/45/1742783263/d44e36d6-7ab3-467a-82c7-e30e986371f3.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZB864145988A9E530B381Z/45/1742783273/11c8835e-2722-47c0-976d-41dc14e8de86.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'sadoer'), 4.4, 15, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'anti', 'ageing']::tex