  ('Hyaluron Filler Anti-Aging Face Day Cream With Hyaluronic Acid Spf 15 50ml', 'hyaluron-filler-anti-aging-face-day-cream-with-hyaluronic-acid-spf-15', 'Different aspects of our lifestyles, including sun exposure, pollution, and smoking, can trigger the formation of free radicals, which can expedite premature skin aging and leave skin looking dull. The Hyaluron Filler range is developed to address these concerns. Eucerin Hyaluron Filler Anti-Aging Face Day Cream for Dry Skin with 3x Effect contains Hyaluronic Acid that helps you achieve younger looking skin by plumping up even the deepest wrinkles for a rejuvenated look. It also provides protection against premature signs of aging. Its advanced formula also contains Glycine Saponin to help stimulate production of hyaluronic acid in the dermal layer of the skin, while Enoxolone helps improve skin texture to minimize signs of aging. Together, the formula delivers 200% more hyaluron for a youthful looking skin. Additionally, this anti-aging day cream has been enriched with SPF 15 to help skin defend against UVA and UVB rays that can further skin aging. The face cream also works as a great makeup base. It’s clinically and dermatologically proven to show very good results on dry skin and is suitable for all skin types.', 'Different aspects of our lifestyles, including sun exposure, pollution, and smoking, can trigger the formation of free radicals, which can e…', 20.76, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z3EA4CC80EBF2535C515CZ/45/_/1779178985/0aad8990-3cd7-4a96-8e11-496b172d5d37.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z3EA4CC80EBF2535C515CZ/45/_/1779178985/f31f831a-bfdb-4c41-832d-63a6b1320e83.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z3EA4CC80EBF2535C515CZ/45/_/1779178986/42d44ace-9e43-4754-805c-32844a20d9cd.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z3EA4CC80EBF2535C515CZ/45/_/1779178985/12065689-a379-4ef4-9498-62b3bdb72fdc.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where sl