  ('Revolutionize Your Skincare Routine with the Latest Dr.pen M8S Cordless Microneedling MTS Derma Pen - Includes 10 Original Cartridges', 'revolutionize-your-skincare-routine-with-the-latest-dr-pen-m8s-cordles', 'Product Feature: 1. This pen is made of high quality aviation aluminum alloy, very beautiful in appearance. And it is light weight, very easy to operate. 2. This pen adopts the latest mute technology, which is the lowest noise model in the industry, with a noise level of less than 15 decibels. 3. This derma pen adopts a disposable aseptic design, which effectively isolates germs and prevents cross-infection of bacteria. 4. The needle depth can be adjusted, you can adjust it for different skin problems. 5. This derma pen has 6 levels speed, with high-speed internal motor, you can adjust the speed accordingly. 6. Function: Scar removal, large pores removal, high absorption of active ingredients, Lip, eyebrow, eyeliner tattoo. Package Includes: 1*Wireless Derma Pen M8S 2*12pins Cartridges in box 2*18pins Cartridges in box 4*36pins Cartridges in box 2*Nano R Cartridges in box 1*Power Adapter 1*User Manual in English 1 * USB Charger Cable', 'Product Feature: 1. This pen is made of high quality aviation aluminum alloy, very beautiful in appearance.', 23.4, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z7B4F5C2FE6D6380E0FE1Z/45/_/1676536446/66dcc299-b315-42ea-9b67-1bb6cf8a225e.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z7B4F5C2FE6D6380E0FE1Z/45/_/1676536445/bc4a2e5d-0d44-49a0-bc53-30ca9a7d0d9f.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z7B4F5C2FE6D6380E0FE1Z/45/_/1676536445/764a4042-da1b-44f8-bcc5-17bf61e6e883.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z7B4F5C2FE6D6380E0FE1Z/45/_/1676536445/32d3ba56-853d-4d17-831b-4f4e8a76e769.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'tools-accessories'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'dr-pen'), 0, 0, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'tools', 'accessories', 'fac