  ('Matcha Japanese Green Tea - 30g', 'matcha-japanese-green-tea-30g', '⭐ Benefits of Matcha Tea for the Skin 1) Reduces the appearance of pimples and blemishes Matcha is very rich in anti-inflammatory and antibacterial properties. It helps reduce acne-causing bacteria and soothe redness. 2) Firms the skin and slows down signs of aging It contains a high percentage of chlorophyll and antioxidants (catechins). It fights free radicals, reduces fine lines, and gives a firmer appearance. 3) Evens skin tone and reduces pigmentation It helps lighten dark spots and reduce the effects of sun damage thanks to its antioxidant properties. 4) Deeply cleanses the skin Matcha absorbs excess oil and cleanses pores without drying out the skin. 5) Soothes sensitive skin The anti-inflammatory properties help reduce redness, irritation, and sensitivity. 6) Hydrates the skin and gives it a healthy glow It contains elements that reduce dryness and maintain the skin''s natural moisture balance. ✨ How to Use Matcha for Skin Matcha Mask (for radiance and brightening) Ingredients: 1 teaspoon matcha 1 teaspoon honey Water or yogurt as desired Method: Mix the ingredients and apply for 15–20 minutes, then rinse with lukewarm water. Repeat twice a week. Matcha Toner Place a spoonful of matcha in a cup of warm water, let it cool, then use it as a toner with a cotton pad.', '⭐ Benefits of Matcha Tea for the Skin 1) Reduces the appearance of pimples and blemishes Matcha is very rich in anti-inflammatory and antiba…', 3.475, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z4C35C0078199C68F6454Z/45/_/1776526354/ac5f292e-a6c0-4977-84eb-540dd1e7bf7d.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'treatment-serums'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'clenz'), 4.3, 4, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'treatment', 'serums', 'masks']::text[]),
  ('No.9 NAD+ Retinol Eye Cream, Depuffing & Firming Eye Serum for Dark Circles, Wrinkles & Fine Lines, Peptides & Niacinamide for Glow & Undereye Radiance, Stocking Stuffers 0.33 fl oz', 'no-9-nad-retinol-eye-cream-depuffing-firming-eye-serum-for-dark-circle', '[NAD+ & Retinol Eye Cream for a Smoother, Firmer Look] Lightweight eye cream-serum hybrid that helps visibly firm the eye area and reduce the look of fine lines and wrinkles. Leaves under-eyes looking smoother and more refreshed.. [Depuffing Formula for Dark Circles & Tired Eyes] Targets the appearance of puffiness, dark circles and tired-looking under-eyes to create a brighter, more well-rested look.. [Peptides & Niacinamide for Radiance & Glow] Infused with 50 types of peptides, niacinamide and ceramides that help boost visible radiance while supporting a hydrated, glowy finish around the delicate eye area.. [Hydrating Cream Texture That Layers Well Under Makeup] Rich yet fast-absorbing texture that nourishes without greasiness. Works well under concealer and helps makeup apply more smoothly.. [Suitable for All Skin Types] Gentle, fragrance-free formula designed for everyday use. Ideal for concerns like fine lines, dark circles, puffiness, and loss of firmness around the eyes.', '[NAD+ & Retinol Eye Cream for a Smoother, Firmer Look] Lightweight eye cream-serum hybrid that helps visibly firm the eye area and reduce th…', 3.9, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZF70169D25F79A9355F6AZ/45/_/1778813202/f3e54d22-371d-4ab0-9da4-1569be500f4d.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZF70169D25F79A9355F6AZ/45/_/1778813202/0fe138f0-bffa-40d9-ab5a-eaa3b909caeb.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZF70169D25F79A9355F6AZ/45/_/1778813202/c66a0334-44ed-4b8d-aa90-7ff0aebe39f4.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZF70169D25F79A9355F6AZ/45/_/1778813202/6c3e9d7b-38b2-4ac9-896d-1c67984e6842.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'eye-treatments'), (select 