  ('SEOUL 1988 Serum : Retinal Liposome 2% + Black Ginseng, 30ml', 'seoul-1988-serum-retinal-liposome-2-black-ginseng-30ml', 'RETINAL LIPOSOME 2% - helps to prevent signs of aging, such as fine lines, wrinkles, and uneven skin tone & texture. - helps to reduce oil production thus reducing acne breakouts.. BLACK GINSENG (PANAX GINSENG ROOT) EXTRACT 58% offers antioxidant benefits for skin protection.. BAKUCHIOL, VITAMIN C & 3 PEPTIDES - powerful collagen production support to retinal, increasing skin elasticity for real anti-wrinkle effect.. TOCOPHEROL helps to retain moisture to keep skin hydrated, radiant and healthy', 'RETINAL LIPOSOME 2% - helps to prevent signs of aging, such as fine lines, wrinkles, and uneven skin tone & texture.', 4, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z95A76869CB06B7754DDFZ/45/1751770161/2f878e4f-1aef-41ed-81ec-d02e6bc5ba6b.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z95A76869CB06B7754DDFZ/45/1751770210/641c0afb-edf0-4a1c-8371-80e9b4f5fb3a.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z95A76869CB06B7754DDFZ/45/1751770213/ad48b112-00de-4661-a3c2-0512ea2e7de5.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z95A76869CB06B7754DDFZ/45/1751770225/5f5154a9-fdb8-421f-8f26-3390936b37a7.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'treatment-serums'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'k-secret'), 0, 0, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'treatment', 'serums', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Original Sudanese Dalka Natural, Unique Skin Moisturizing and Exfoliating Recipe - 500 g', 'original-sudanese-dalka-natural-unique-skin-moisturizing-and-exfoliati-ze1ba5', 'Sudanese Dalka is one of the traditional skin care treatments that has many benefits. Here is a summary of the benefits and the method you can follow to get the best results: Benefits of Sudanese Dalka : 1-Moisturizing and glowing the body: Enhances skin hydration and gives it a shiny touch from the first use. Increases body shine: Gives the skin a natural shine and beauty. 2-Cleansing the skin and body: Deeply cleanses the skin and removes dirt and dead cells. 3-Lightening dark areas: Helps lighten dark areas of the body. 4-Reducing hair growth: It can help reduce hair growth on the body. 5-Lightening sensitive areas: Contributes to lightening sensitive areas of the body. 6-Removing chicken skin and ingrown hair: Removes dry skin and reduces the appearance of ingrown hair. Removing black knees and elbows: Contributes to lightening and softening the knees and elbows. 7-Removing pigmentation, laser and sun burns: Helps unify skin tone and remove pigmentation. Unifying body color: Gives the body a uniform and beautiful color. How to use: 1-Take a sufficient amount of the Dalka and mix it with water until you get a suitable consistency. Applying the Dalka : Put the Dalka on the body. 2-Massage: Massage your body in a gentle circular motion. 3-Wait: Leave the Dalka on the body for 3 to 5 minutes. 4-Removing the Dalka : Use a small amount of oil and rub the body to remove the Dalka and exfoliate the skin. Wash the body with water only, then moisturize it. Additional notes: To get rid of the smell of the Dalka , wash the body well with a shower gel and use a scented lotion.', 'Sudanese Dalka is one of the traditional skin care treatments that has many benefits.', 6.9, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE1BA5BE1DFB0EE8A456CZ/45/_/1730573286/ec939c23-aeac-4ce3-ba0e-5b3fc191f7cf.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE1BA5BE1DFB0EE8A456CZ/45/_/1730817538/78ac3a31-d0bc-4c59-a891-734c87a5185e.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE1BA5BE1DFB0EE8A456CZ/45/_/1733075996/aabfcd29-d81b-44d5-bbd1-965addc69e98.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE1BA5BE1DFB0EE8A456CZ/45/_/1737879157/20a41246-0d17-4497-82df-6a7ebe201eb7.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'skin-cleansers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'clenz'), 4.4, 139, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'cleansers', 'body', 'scrubs', 'polishes']::text[]),
  ('Infinite Makeup Cotton Pads Regular Size - 80 PCS Pack', 'infinite-makeup-cotton-pads-regular-size-80-pcs-pack', 'Infinite Cotton Pads are designed for daily beauty and personal care needs. Made from soft and absorbent cotton, these pads are ideal for makeup removal, facial cleansing, skincare application, and everyday hygiene routines. Their compact size provides precision and convenience, making them suitable for delicate areas around the face and eyes.', 'Infinite Cotton Pads are designed for daily beauty and personal care needs.', 0.995, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z15D02BBE78A0679DB158Z/45/_/1781538974/dcd1ea18-178f-4891-8484-dce823c0896f.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z15D02BBE78A0679DB158Z/45/_/1781560399/e1cb91e1-ba8e-4f97-8416-076da4fa0c0d.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z15D02BBE78A0679DB158Z/45/_/1783375697/71735313-46fe-4ce0-bac0-7e7cbed9aed2.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z15D02BBE78A0679DB158Z/45/_/1781560615/34e53c27-882d-4a33-8b32-d3f409bd779d.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'tools-accessories'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'infinite'), 0, 0, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'tools', 'accessories', 'cotton', 'balls']::text[]),
  ('Exfoliating and cleansing loofah, viscose bath glove for a Moroccan bath at home - Pink', 'exfoliating-and-cleansing-loofah-viscose-bath-glove-for-a-moroccan-bat', 'Trenz Korean Loofah - The Secret to Radiant and Youthful Skin For maintaining radiant and youthful skin, continuous cleansing and dead skin removal are essential. The Trenz Korean Loofah, made from viscose (natural plant fibers), is the perfect solution to achieve this without the need to visit beauty salons or Moroccan baths. This effective loofah gently exfoliates the skin, removes dead skin cells, and maintains the body''s skin glow and youthfulness. Additionally, it deeply cleanses the body, removing dirt, scars, and unwanted marks. How to Use the Korean Loofah: Start by washing your body with warm water for at least 10 minutes. Rinse the loofah with warm water and begin scrubbing in circular motions. Pre-Use Tips: Avoid using the loofah on inflamed wounds or acne. Moisturize your body after exfoliation for the best results. It is recommended to exfoliate the body once or twice a week. Replace the loofah every 8 to 10 weeks to ensure optimal results. Frequently Asked Questions: How often should this glove be used? It is recommended to use it once or twice a week. What skin types are suitable for this loofah? It is suitable for normal and rough skin types. For sensitive skin, it is recommended to use it gently or avoid it if the skin is very sensitive. How can the exfoliating glove be used correctly? For the best results, soak your body in a bathtub for 10 minutes to soften the skin before using the glove. Use the glove in circular motions, focusing on rough areas. Rinse the glove thoroughly and hang it to dry after each use. Trenz: Your Beauty, Your Health, Your Elegance In a world full of options, "Trenz" stands out as a distinguished Saudi brand, dedicated to offering products that focus on beauty and health, catering to the needs of the modern woman. "Trenz" was founded with a clear vision and a noble goal: to empower women to feel confident and beautiful every day through innovative and high-quality products. We have curated a diverse range of products including makeup brushes, makeup sponges, mirrors, nail files, and more. Each product is the result of meticulous research and attention to detail to ensure we provide you with the best. "Trenz" is not just a brand; it is your companion in beauty and health. We are here to be part of your daily journey towards beauty and self-care. Join us and discover how our products can add a touch of elegance and comfort to your life. Trenz - Your Beauty Deserves the Best. Keywords: bath sponge, body scrub, body scrubber, exfoliating gloves, shower gloves, bathing sponge, moroccan scrub, scrub body, loofah for body, sponge bath shower', 'Trenz Korean Loofah - The Secret to Radiant and Youthful Skin For maintaining radiant and youthful skin, continuous cleansing and dead skin…', 2.09, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z00ACEF5601B7059377D8Z/45/1767376063/192f462f-3f29-4aeb-b266-0627827b7b4b.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z00ACEF5601B7059377D8Z/45/1767376119/da5c1772-2cac-4b3b-949f-de1b0722b56c.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z00ACEF5601B7059377D8Z/45/1767376223/67caddeb-8f16-4a6a-9f51-1d6bde4eddc8.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z00ACEF5601B7059377D8Z/45/1767376994/c34b1b8f-6680-4600-87fd-d4cc50ce6575.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'skin-cleansers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'trenz'), 4.3, 1530, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'cleansers', 'body', 'scrubs', 'polishes']::text[]),
