sion and a noble goal: to empower women to feel confident and beautiful every day through innovative and high-quality products. We have curated a diverse range of products including makeup brushes, makeup sponges, mirrors, nail files, and more. Each product is the result of meticulous research and attention to detail to ensure we provide you with the best. "Trenz" is not just a brand; it is your companion in beauty and health. We are here to be part of your daily journey towards beauty and self-care. Join us and discover how our products can add a touch of elegance and comfort to your life. Trenz - Your Beauty Deserves the Best. Keywords: exfoliating gloves, shower gloves, silicone scrubber, bathing gloves, bathing sponge, korean loofah, loofah for body, sponge bath shower', 'Trenz Korean Loofah - The Secret to Radiant and Youthful Skin For maintaining radiant and youthful skin, continuous cleansing and dead skin…', 2.09, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZEFA158F3D5059B4502BBZ/45/_/1781224781/5730f13f-2141-4c74-9f09-c7155c436c28.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZEFA158F3D5059B4502BBZ/45/1767379225/6186afb3-4c6e-438f-80f2-285a1bc5292c.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZEFA158F3D5059B4502BBZ/45/1767379225/5828dc86-6ea0-4f6d-896c-dd54618c1faa.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZEFA158F3D5059B4502BBZ/45/1767380163/d463df8c-354e-4596-b41b-bea5bec5bb7f.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'skin-cleansers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'trenz'), 4.3, 1530, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'cleansers', 'body', 'scrubs', 'polishes']::text[]),
  ('Magic Waves Renew & Define 2in1 Conditioning Treatment Cream - 1000ml', 'magic-waves-renew-define-2in1-conditioning-treatment-cream-1000ml', '✨ Perfect wave magic! Designed for wavy hair to highlight its natural beauty without weight. 🌊 Provides a balance of hydration and light hold, making waves smooth and attractive. 🧜‍♀️', '✨ Perfect wave magic! Designed for wavy hair to highlight its natural beauty without weight.', 2.314, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZF9B11ECD0CA87074FCC4Z/45/_/1775138161/62813f41-7097-4ae7-93f3-82c09a9874c0.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'hair-scalp-treatments'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'cosmo-bounz'), 5, 2, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'scalp', 'treatments', 'leave', 'treatment']::text[]),
  ('Rosmary Essential Oil Scalp Scrub with Argan Oil Vitamine E And Proteins Rosemary 250grams', 'rosmary-essential-oil-scalp-scrub-with-argan-oil-vitamine-e-and-protei', 'Some believe that hair and scalp care stops when washing hair with shampoo when taking a shower, or making hair mixtures only, but the health of the scalp requires other care. making a scalp scrub plays an important role in the steps of hair care, because scalp exfoliation improves blood circulation and has many other benefits. Add shine to hair Helps promote hair growth Nourishes the hair Gently exfoliates the scalp Rich in proteins, vitamin E and sea salt Helps restore balance and provide comfort to the scalp while cleaning it from excess of sebum and impurities', 'Some believe that hair and scalp care stops when washing hair with shampoo when taking a shower, or making hair mixtures only, but the healt…', 1.944, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/v1683869641/N53405398A_1.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/v1683869641/N53405398A_2.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'hair-scalp-treatments'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'jardin-d-oleane'), 4.4, 1008, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'scalp', 'treatments', 'treatment']::text[]),
  ('Vara Solution To Eliminate Lice And Nits With Spray 50.0ml', 'vara-solution-to-eliminate-lice-and-nits-with-spray-50-0ml', 'Kills head lice and their eggs. Extended protection against reinfestation. It is a single application use. Not suitable for babies below 2 years old. Effective, safe and gentle on hair. Not suitable during pregnancy and lactation', 'Kills head lice and their eggs. Extended protection against reinfestation. It is a single application use.', 1.9, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZDF9B266A6EAEA2509D2AZ/45/_/1777375936/5a1f2f0a-7a19-4cd4-8a54-d6898ea2c57b.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZDF9B266A6EAEA2509D2AZ/45/_/1777375936/45402b63-9ff3-46ed-96b2-78763c666bf0.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'hair-scalp-treatments'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'avalon-pharma'), 4.7, 956, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'scalp', 'treatments', 'treatment']::text[]),
  ('Sri Shivashakthi Hair Oil Original India 108 Natural Herbs - 250 ml', 'sri-shivashakthi-hair-oil-original-india-108-natural-herbs-250-ml', 'Provides deep nourishment and strengthens hair roots', 'Provides deep nourishment and strengthens hair roots', 4.895, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z591CA80BB199A479BD7CZ/45/_/1783452083/66980c8e-bb53-4b58-aaf0-0c8cb0f339a6.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z591CA80BB199A479BD7CZ/45/_/1783452083/2a7bb412-67b3-4be6-a677-b8a1d7d50076.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z591CA80BB199A479BD7CZ/45/_/1783452082/c716efe4-7f1a-47e1-8562-aee4137ecc36.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'hair-scalp-treatments'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'sri-shivashakthi'), 4.3, 13, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'scalp', 'treatments', 'loss', 'products']::text[]),
  ('Raspberry vinegar against dandruff hair tonic 250ML', 'raspberry-vinegar-against-dandruff-hair-tonic-250ml', 'Restore your hair’s vitality and natural shine with Agiva Fruit Vinegar Hair Tonic. A professional formula designed to care for the scalp, gently cleanse it, help reduce dandruff, and leave your hair looking stronger and shinier.', 'Restore your hair’s vitality and natural shine with Agiva Fruit Vinegar Hair Tonic.', 1.446, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z4AD67F8CB01F3A6BD358Z/45/_/1772325173/e480c967-ab2e-49e8-ae59-13b725a913ef.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'hair-scalp-treatments'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'agiva'), 4.3, 18, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'scalp', 'treatments', 'treatment']::text[]),
  ('SKALA Mais Cachos for hair type 3ABC - 2 IN 1 Conditioning Treatment Cream & Cream To Comb 35.2oz, BLUE', 'skala-mais-cachos-for-hair-type-3abc-2-in-1-conditioning-treatment-cre', 'Deep Nourishment: Scala''s Miss Cacchus 2-in-1 Conditioning Treatment Cream is enriched with a powerful blend of natural ingredients that deeply nourish and revitalize curls. It infuses your hair with essential nutrients, promoting healthier, stronger strands.. 2-in-1 Formula: This unique product combines two essential hair care steps in one convenient package. It acts as a moisturizing treatment cream and a styling cream, making it easy to achieve beautifully defined, healthy waves.. Locking in moisture: Dryness can be a common challenge for curly hair, but Scala has you covered. This hair cream creates a protective barrier that locks in moisture and prevents it from losing throughout the day. Say hello to long-lasting hydration!. Lightweight and Non-Greasy: Scala Miss Cacique 2-in-1 Moisturizing Treatment Cream is designed to be lightweight and non-greasy, ensuring your hair is light and free while providing optimal nourishment. It leaves no heavy residue or buildup!. Versatile: Whether you have wavy, curly, or coily hair with a 3ABC curl pattern, this hair cream is suitable for all curl types. It can be used as a leave-in conditioner, styling cream, or curl refresher between washes.', 'Deep Nourishment: Scala''s Miss Cacchus 2-in-1 Conditioning Treatment Cream is enriched with a powerful blend of natural ingredients that dee…', 4.6, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/34561b4384cc58218550b6c663fa1dcf|pzsku/ZB95E650E6CEF3BA1201AZ/45/1768731701/3f1fd215-ec0f-4b16-9a3f-7e0779738a6c.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/34561b4384cc58218550b6c663fa1dcf|pzsku/ZB95E650E6CEF3BA1201AZ/45/1768731701/2cdb0fd8-4f6b-4078-8482-1a2fbe896dd7.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/34561b4384cc58218550b6c663fa1dcf|pzsku/ZB95E650E6CEF3BA1201AZ/45/1768731701/5b5a8861-899e-4465-b35e-9a9959b81