  ('BARONY Super Brush Hair Styler 1200W 3-in-1 for Drying and Styling, Ceramic Bristles for Even Heat Distribution, Ionic Anti-Frizz Technology, Lightweight Ergonomic Design, Suitable for All Hair Types', 'barony-super-brush-hair-styler-1200w-3-in-1-for-drying-and-styling-cer', 'Barony Super Brush 1200W combines drying and styling in one tool, featuring ionic technology to reduce frizz and ceramic bristles for even heat distribution. Suitable for all hair types, delivering smooth, shiny, salon-quality results quickly and easily.', 'Barony Super Brush 1200W combines drying and styling in one tool, featuring ionic technology to reduce frizz and ceramic bristles for even h…', 10.9, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z0E48826FBCCC765771FEZ/45/_/1775981785/1158f15c-8f8a-4283-bdf0-c292057803f8.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z0E48826FBCCC765771FEZ/45/_/1775981785/f14fd514-0596-4679-ad24-49493e3263c4.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z0E48826FBCCC765771FEZ/45/_/1775981785/8dad0dfa-4e68-4552-80b8-f4f256483811.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z0E48826FBCCC765771FEZ/45/_/1775981785/5db9f2ce-adfc-43f5-8e09-89f0e154e6de.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'styling-tools'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'barony'), 4.8, 1333, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'styling', 'tools', 'straightening', 'brushes']::text[]),
  ('Regaine Foam 73 ml', 'regaine-foam-73-ml', 'Promotes hair regrowth in men .. Helps to thicken and strengthen existing hair.. Increases the duration of the hair growth cycle.. Stimulates hair follicles and promotes hair regrowth', 'Promotes hair regrowth in men .. Helps to thicken and strengthen existing hair.. Increases the duration of the hair growth cycle..', 8.89, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z4148474A6DFCF7FC43ECZ/45/_/1730632686/9acd85c7-3dfb-41a6-abb6-e60ffdf62816.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z4148474A6DFCF7FC43ECZ/45/_/1730632689/01698d49-60e0-4437-bb37-3ac7c78d31e0.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z4148474A6DFCF7FC43ECZ/45/_/1730632696/4e1f99a8-3281-44cc-8c69-a9642c11d5b7.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z4148474A6DFCF7FC43ECZ/45/_/1730632692/33c022f7-b082-462d-9266-b77787d13856.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'hair-scalp-treatments'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'regaine'), 4.3, 245, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'scalp', 'treatments', 'loss', 'products']::text[]),
  ('Botox & Collagen Hair Shampoo, 4.2L', 'botox-collagen-hair-shampoo-4-2l', 'The Botox and Collagen Shampoo by Spa System is the perfect solution to revive your hair. Its rich formula provides deep nourishment, restoring vitality and softness to damaged and stressed hair.Features and Benefits:Deep Nourishment: Restores hydration and softness to dry and damaged hair, thanks to the collagen and botox ingredients.Improves Hair Elasticity: Collagen helps enhance hair elasticity, making hair stronger and more flexible.Repairs Damaged Hair: Rebuilds damaged hair and improves its appearance.Healthy and Shiny Hair: Gives hair a natural shine and noticeable health.Suitable for All Hair Types: Suitable for dry, colored, and damaged hair, delivering stunning results.Effective Ingredients: Contains a blend of collagen and botox to repair and protect hair from harmful environmental factors.Uses:For daily use at home or in salons to achieve the best results.Results: Soft, shiny, and strong hair with a healthy, voluminous appearance.Try the Botox and Collagen Shampoo by Spa System now for beautiful, healthy hair!', 'The Botox and Collagen Shampoo by Spa System is the perfect solution to revive your hair.', 2.96, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z5C2B08BE52B2507440B3Z/45/1758370834/8fdb0c91-23fe-4304-b087-42b626dfc121.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'shampoos-conditioners'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'spa-system'), 0, 0, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'shampoos', 'conditioners']::text[]),
  ('Kativa Post Brazilian Straightening Extends And Maintains', 'kativa-post-brazilian-straightening-extends-and-maintains', 'A complete care set specially formulated for post-Brazilian treatments. Enriched with Keraliss Complex (plant-based keratin + hyaluronic acid), this trio restores, nourishes, and protects the hair while sealing the fiber against environmental humidity. It helps prolong smoothing results, reduces frizz, and leaves hair visibly healthier and shinier. Deeply hydrates and restores damaged hair. Strengthens and smooths hair fibers. Provides anti-frizz protection. Enhances shine and softness. Helps prolong the effects of smoothing treatments.', 'A complete care set specially formulated for post-Brazilian treatments.', 6.5, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z1D33F4238A29D61E0E38Z/45/1767808145/a6b1b820-ea90-41b7-9a67-40497ca446a6.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'shampoos-conditioners'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'kativa'), 4.4, 78, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'shampoos', 'conditioners', 'shampoo', 'conditioner']::text[]),
  ('Karisma Collection No Frizz Liss Hair Treatment Protein - 150g', 'karisma-collection-no-frizz-liss-hair-treatment-protein-150g', 'Karisma Collection No Frizz Liss Protein Treatment - 150g Karisma Collection No Frizz Liss Protein is an effective treatment for repairing and smoothing damaged hair. It is designed to eliminate frizz and add perfect softness and shine from the first use. Its unique formula contains nourishing ingredients that rebuild hair fibers, creating a healthy, vibrant appearance.', 'Karisma Collection No Frizz Liss Protein Treatment - 150g Karisma Collection No Frizz Liss Protein is an effective treatment for repairing a…', 6.778, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z4B8CAEA570143788BFD6Z/45/_/1778403172/0559b35d-455f-40c2-86c8-7680ecacc24a.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z4B8CAEA570143788BFD6Z/45/_/1778403172/8f9ac6bc-9d59-4305-8e7b-2db851499983.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'hair-scalp-treatments'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'karizma-collection'), 4.9, 11, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'scalp', 'treatments', 'curls', 'straightening']::text[]),
  ('Neo Hair Lotion for Hair Loss Treatment | Hair Regrowth | Thinning, Bald Spots & Hair Fall | Trusted Formula with Ginseng, Saw Palmetto & Horsetail | 120ml', 'neo-hair-lotion-for-hair-loss-treatment-hair-regrowth-thinning-bald-sp', 'When hair starts feeling thinner or bald spots begin to show, it can feel frustrating, especially when nothing seems to work. Greenwealth Neo Hair Lotion offers a natural, proven path to regrowth. It is a tried-and-true solution to help regrow your hair. Made thoughtfully in Thailand, Neo Hair Lotion is a simple spray designed to support your scalp and help your hair feel like itself again. This lightweight spray is formulated with plant-based actives like Cantaloupe extract, Ginseng, Horsetail, and Saw Palmetto, thoughtfully chosen to nourish the scalp and support your hair’s natural growth. With consistent use, most users begin to notice less hair fall in 4 weeks, and visible baby hair within 2–3 months. Many people say they start noticing small changes after a few weeks, fewer strands falling, their scalp feeling healthier & new baby hairs beginning to grow. Easy Routine. Visible Results. Consistency is key, let the results speak for themselves Wash the scalp with shampoo Comb gently for 4–5 mins or use a derma roller for best results Spray directly on scalp, including bald spots Massage with fingertips in circular motion for 15–20 mins Do not rinse, leave the lotion to absorb Apply lotion twice daily, morning & evening Follow consistently for 4 months for visible results.', 'When hair starts feeling thinner or bald spots begin to show, it can feel frustrating, especially when nothing seems to work.', 8.995, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z9388ACA781D8BB3571A2Z/45/_/1779179124/28280ac4-7d78-40de-bcd7-4b0bbc1b4027.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'hair-scalp-treatments'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'green-wealth'), 3.8, 11706, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'scalp', 'treatments', 'loss', 'products']::text[]),
  ('Barony Triple Barrel Hair Waver – Black', 'barony-triple-barrel-hair-waver-black', 'The BARONY Triple Barrel Hair Waver delivers trendy, voluminous beach waves with ease at home. Featuring three barrels for even heat distribution, it creates smooth, uniform waves quickly. With fast heating up to 480°F and adjustable temperature settings, it suits all hair types while reducing frizz and enhancing smoothness. Its ergonomic design and 360° swivel cord ensure easy handling, giving you salon-like results in minutes.', 'The BARONY Triple Barrel Hair Waver delivers trendy, voluminous beach waves with ease at home.', 31.4, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZD829CE5ED1D05C48CE81Z/45/_/1774201722/b8df3357-59ee-40b0-bf72-0f6e0adcc705.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZD829CE5ED1D05C48CE81Z/45/_/1774201764/6b939cd6-152f-4e56-9973-84bf25bea665.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'styling-tools'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'barony'), 4.1, 12, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'styling', 'tools', 'curling', 'irons']::text[]),
  ('Fair Juicy Hair Curler Pink/Black 25mm', 'fair-juicy-hair-curler-pink-black-25mm', 'The Jose Eber 25mm Clipless Curling Iron creates larger, bouncier long lasting curls and voluptuous waves that are smoother, shiner, and frizz-free. Create incredible volume and texture while reducing the amount of damage caused by traditional curling irons. The innovative clipless design provides consistent and even heat for faster styling without causing creased or crimped ends. Create a more natural look by curling hair from root to tip, reducing heat at hair’s weakest point the tips and save your locks from unnecessary damage.', 'The Jose Eber 25mm Clipless Curling Iron creates larger, bouncier long lasting curls and voluptuous waves that are smoother, shiner, and fri…', 3.8, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N14150064A/45/_/1764173360/24123e5c-4fba-4222-9cd9-e58b6becda17.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N14150064A/45/_/1764242361/cf7fbe6d-db1b-4314-a31c-f75bfddea98b.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N14150064A/45/_/1764242361/2e2fffa9-0dae-477f-acf4-45aeac4fab1e.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N14150064A/45/_/1764242361/1353466e-ed42-481a-8262-f74ad9fb379a.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'styling-tools'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'jose-eber'), 4.2, 4705, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'styling', 'tools', 'curling', 'irons']::text[]),
  ('Regaine Foam for Men – 5% Minoxidil (73 ml)', 'regaine-foam-for-men-5-minoxidil-73-ml', 'Enjoy daily hair care designed to give your hair a healthier, fuller, and more vibrant appearance with regular use. Designed for easy and comfortable daily use, featuring a lightweight feel that does not leave any unpleasant residue on the hair or scalp. Helps improve the overall look of the hair, making it appear thicker and healthier, making it a suitable choice for men as part of their daily hair care routine.', 'Enjoy daily hair care designed to give your hair a healthier, fuller, and more vibrant appearance with regular use.', 9.5, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZDF715922FE9E2355F764Z/45/_/1779476758/74a357d2-cd57-42e3-8484-dd263b5b97e5.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZDF715922FE9E2355F764Z/45/_/1779476758/42ab276c-0863-486c-814f-de49b40961a1.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZDF715922FE9E2355F764Z/45/_/1779476700/5e6119c7-7040-4cb7-bbb5-4b782660e4af.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZDF715922FE9E2355F764Z/45/_/1779475607/a2c1486d-2833-49a6-a4e1-46712e9c61a1.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'hair-scalp-treatments'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'regaine'), 5, 1, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'scalp', 'treatments', 'oil', 'serums']::text[]),
  ('Pack Of 2 Avogain 5% Minoxidil Solution Clear 50ml', 'pack-of-2-avogain-5-minoxidil-solution-clear-50ml', 'Avogain 5% spray contains Minoxidil as an active ingredient, and it is used for men and women to treat baldness and hair loss.. Effective in cases of genetic baldness. Avogain 5% spray is specially designed for men because of its 5% concentration, it helps to treat male baldness. Avogain 5% spray , effective in treating beard hair loss and increasing its growth', 'Avogain 5% spray contains Minoxidil as an active ingredient, and it is used for men and women to treat baldness and hair loss..', 4.828, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBDC707B0918ECA2730C1Z/45/_/1777375941/4684f240-6fde-4dd3-866b-bc4613ee3af7.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBDC707B0918ECA2730C1Z/45/_/1777375941/8fae84a5-35fb-4fca-b384-d7f220478a26.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBDC707B0918ECA2730C1Z/45/_/1777375941/5e01f242-fcba-4be3-b06d-d7499e38e902.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'hair-scalp-treatments'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'avalon-pharma'), 4.2, 609, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'scalp', 'treatments', 'loss', 'products']::text[]),
  ('Hair Styler, Volumizer, Hair Dryer & Hot Air Brush – Pink', 'hair-styler-volumizer-hair-dryer-hot-air-brush-pink', 'BARONY Pink Brush Paddle Hair Brush for Detangling Without Pulling, Anti-Breakage and Split End Reduction, Natural Oil Distribution for Healthy Shine, Professional Smooth Frizz-Free Hair Brush, Lightweight Ergonomic Design, Suitable for All Hair Types Daily Use', 'BARONY Pink Brush Paddle Hair Brush for Detangling Without Pulling, Anti-Breakage and Split End Reduction, Natural Oil Distribution for Heal…', 11.9, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z11808F4AE27397719B90Z/45/_/1775122571/392eeb81-4da7-4413-90ff-cc171af0e0eb.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z11808F4AE27397719B90Z/45/_/1775122571/961118fd-7c9e-44ee-b0cf-c9c42cac9ccd.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z11808F4AE27397719B90Z/45/_/1775122571/7fe0584c-0e92-4428-9c5a-af8f5f5113af.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z11808F4AE27397719B90Z/45/_/1775122570/09ced0b9-8bdf-4c86-9e44-52b1646d34c5.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'styling-tools'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'barony'), 0, 0, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'styling', 'tools', 'straightening', 'brushes']::text[]),
  ('Seven Green Herbal Shampoo Bar with Isatis Indigotica Extract Cacumen Biotae', 'seven-green-herbal-shampoo-bar-with-isatis-indigotica-extract-cacumen', 'Discover the power of Seven Green Seven Green Natural Soap Shampoo specially formulated to address multiple hair problems. This shampoo has a unique formula that helps soothe the scalp and balance the secretion of natural oils. Strengthens hair roots from deep down, helping prevent hair loss and keep hair healthy. Ideal for people with oily hair, hair loss, and scalp problems. This product is designed in a distinctive green triangle shape for easy use. It helps in deep cleansing the scalp, removes excess oil buildup, leaving your hair clean and refreshed. Suitable for daily use, it improves the appearance and health of hair with regular use. Treats various hair loss problems whether genetic, hormonal or postpartum factors.', 'Discover the power of Seven Green Seven Green Natural Soap Shampoo specially formulated to address multiple hair problems.', 3.995, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZC3B2896F78C083F13194Z/45/_/1776017518/c0c58490-5da6-493f-90f5-c5ff9355d30c.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZC3B2896F78C083F13194Z/45/_/1776017518/e63e8320-a12b-4793-9b2b-288a900b127b.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'shampoos-conditioners'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'seven-green'), 4.5, 195, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'shampoos', 'conditioners']::text[]),
  ('Welloxon Colour Developer 6% White 60ml', 'welloxon-colour-developer-6-white-60ml', 'For coloring darker, same level of darkness and slight lightening. Black and brown colors', 'For coloring darker, same level of darkness and slight lightening.', 0.583, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z856CA3902F4CC073C6E4Z/45/_/1779094783/4e40d11d-9eff-42b1-81ab-7b2ca247e297.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z856CA3902F4CC073C6E4Z/45/_/1779094783/7ef40ebf-cb69-4ba9-99f8-7a27d4fe6269.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z856CA3902F4CC073C6E4Z/45/_/1779094784/0974343b-0116-497e-a8fb-8181edeb46f2.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z856CA3902F4CC073C6E4Z/45/_/1779094784/e3989d29-ba9b-45db-afcd-73c486c3dff4.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'hair-color'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'wella'), 4.6, 446, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'color', 'chemical', 'dyes']::text[]),
  ('New Wave Volume Hairspray 250ml', 'new-wave-volume-hairspray-250ml', 'New wave volume hairspray has a lightweight formula that locks in the lift with a dose of sheen for a long lasting hold. The formula also offers uv protection.', 'New wave volume hairspray has a lightweight formula that locks in the lift with a dose of sheen for a long lasting hold.', 2.675, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z663CF32FC615A028586DZ/45/_/1779094527/f6fdb139-cedc-4a7d-b566-1eb3c475d428.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z663CF32FC615A028586DZ/45/_/1779094527/c2ac65f3-a697-4236-8d23-928a2ba44f60.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z663CF32FC615A028586DZ/45/_/1779094527/d53c519e-7713-4488-ae58-fc04acf4314b.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z663CF32FC615A028586DZ/45/_/1779094527/3df12b16-3978-4824-9a71-6a76e9e44bdd.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'styling-products'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'wella'), 4.5, 442, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'styling', 'products', 'volume', 'texture']::text[]),
  ('Hair Building Fibers Black 27.5grams', 'hair-building-fibers-black-27-5grams', 'About the product : Toppik is a safe, natural, and undetectable way to improve the appearance of thinning hair without harmful drugs, chemicals, or surgery. Toppik hair building fibers are made from pure organic keratin protein; the same protein found in human hair. TOPPIK Hair Building Fibers instantly give you the look of thicker, fuller hair. Made of natural, colored Keratin protein that is naturally statically charged, TOPPIK Fibers intertwine with your existing hair for a completely natural look. TOPPIK resists wind, rain and perspiration but removes easily with shampoo. Toppik Hair Building Fibers, made of colored keratin protein, blend undetectably with existing hair strands to instantly create the appearance of naturally thick, full hair. Toppik Hair Fibers resist wind, rain, and perspiration for long-lasting results in all conditions. About the brand : Nutra Skyn Care takes pride in presenting ourselves as pioneers in opening in India the unique market segment of “Hair Building Fibers” and launching “TOPPIK” hair building fibers. TOPPIK” is the world’s leading brand of hair building fibers. “TOPPIK” manufacturer Spencer Forrest Inc. USA imposed tremendous faith and trust in appointing “Nutra Skyn Care” as legally authorised “Sole Distributors” for “TOPPIK” in India. How to use : 1. Dry and style hair as usual. 2. Shake or spray into thinning area. 3. Gently pat hair to disperse fibers. 4. If desired, lightly comb, brush or style your hair after applying Toppik Hair. 5. Building Fibers. 6. Strictly for external use only. 7. If irritation or rash appears, discontinue use. 8. Avoid inhalation and contact with an eyes.', ': Toppik is a safe, natural, and undetectable way to improve the appearance of thinning hair without harmful drugs, chemicals, or surgery.', 2.56, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N20615122A/45/_/1744882423/c0b57b47-7dd3-4200-a2a5-932f6263dad4.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/v1605185985/N20615122A_2.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/v1605185986/N20615122A_3.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/v1605185986/N20615122A_4.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'hair-scalp-treatments'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'toppik'), 4.1, 1911, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'scalp', 'treatments', 'loss', 'products']::text[]),
  ('118ml Wig Glue Remover Spray – Safe & Fast Dissolve For Lace, Weave, Tape & Front Hair Adhesive', '118ml-wig-glue-remover-spray-safe-fast-dissolve-for-lace-weave-tape-fr', 'Easily remove stubborn wig and hairpiece adhesives with this Wig Glue Remover Spray 118ml! Designed for front bonding, lace, weave, and tape applications. Formulated for safe, effective, and fast removal, it helps protect delicate hair and scalp while keeping your wigs and extensions clean and ready to use. Key Features: 1. Powerful Glue Removal Quickly dissolves strong adhesives from wigs, lace fronts, weaves, and tape without harsh scrubbing. Saves time and effort while protecting hair fibers. 2. Suitable for Multiple Hair Types Works on front bonding wigs, lace wigs, weave extensions, and tape adhesives. Ideal for both synthetic and human hair pieces. 3. Easy-to-Use Spray Formula Convenient spray bottle allows precise application directly on adhesive areas. Ensures even coverage and fast removal without mess. 4. Safe & Gentle on Hair and Scalp Formulated to minimize irritation and prevent damage to hair or scalp, keeping your hair healthy while effectively removing glue. 5. Meltblown Active Formula Advanced meltblown formula penetrates adhesives for faster and more efficient removal. Perfect for professional salons or home use. 6. Compact 118ml Bottle Portable and easy to store, perfect for travel, salon use, or home hair care routines. Keeps your wig and hair maintenance simple and efficient. Clean and Care for Your Wigs Easily — this Wig Glue Remover Spray 118ml is the ultimate solution for removing adhesives safely and effectively, keeping your wigs, lace fronts, and weaves in perfect condition.', 'Easily remove stubborn wig and hairpiece adhesives with this Wig Glue Remover Spray 118ml! Designed for front bonding, lace, weave, and tape…', 2.7, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z65D02B4680E7FBD91487Z/45/1767063050/aae2d9a1-95d8-46ef-99f2-d21b320bcd8a.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z65D02B4680E7FBD91487Z/45/1767063050/e42c43cf-c09b-4126-b089-fd09d41269a6.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z65D02B4680E7FBD91487Z/45/1767063050/cbe3613f-fe27-45bd-92f3-7467226709fc.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z65D02B4680E7FBD91487Z/45/1767063050/e20988b3-005a-4dca-aaca-da16b95318ff.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'hair-extensions-wigs-accessories'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'walker-tape'), 4.6, 18, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'extensions', 'wigs', 'accessories', 'wig']::text[]),
  ('OBelo Ceramic Hair Straightener with Titanium Plates, Adjustable Temperature (300-450°F), 1-Inch Plate for All Hair Styles, 2-in-1 Hair Straightener & Curler (Pink)', 'obelo-ceramic-hair-straightener-with-titanium-plates-adjustable-temper', 'OBelo Ceramic Hair Straightener & Curler 2-in-1 delivers professional styling results with smooth, shiny hair that lasts all day. Designed with ceramic-coated titanium plates, it provides even heat distribution while helping reduce hair damage and frizz for a healthier look. The adjustable temperature range from 300°F to 450°F makes it suitable for different hair types, including fine, thick, and curly hair. It features fast heating technology and a digital LED display for easy temperature control during styling. The slim 1-inch plate design allows effortless straightening, curling, and creating natural waves with precision. A 360° swivel cord offers comfortable movement without tangling, making it perfect for daily use and travel with 100-240V worldwide voltage compatibility.', 'OBelo Ceramic Hair Straightener & Curler 2-in-1 delivers professional styling results with smooth, shiny hair that lasts all day.', 10.9, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z72975BF110D7E3994F54Z/45/_/1780272097/c601babc-f024-451b-998d-d4401328cb75.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z72975BF110D7E3994F54Z/45/_/1780272098/ab986b77-1ad2-4747-97f0-055ea78ab70f.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/82aa0fe4b62d52f799ee8a92ad87cffc|pzsku/Z72975BF110D7E3994F54Z/45/1768481521/123002b0-3531-4b7c-ad73-5b2f95a0d0aa.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/82aa0fe4b62d52f799ee8a92ad87cffc|pzsku/Z72975BF110D7E3994F54Z/45/1768481579/ea331319-17ac-46d9-876b-592c3c3819b5.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'styling-tools'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'obelo'), 4.4, 113, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'styling', 'tools', 'straighteners']::text[]),
  ('Menthol Fresh Anti Dandruff Shampoo Cools And Energizes Scalp 1Liters', 'menthol-fresh-anti-dandruff-shampoo-cools-and-energizes-scalp-1liters', 'Get rid of dandruff and stay worry free with Head & Shoulders Menthol Refresh Anti-Dandruff Shampoo. The anti-dandruff shampoo removes up to 100% of visible dandruff**. Its clinically proven formula contains Piroctone Olamine, the active ingredient that can fight Malassezia globose, the dandruff-causing microbe. This powerful shampoo controls flaking, scaling, and itching*** associated with dandruff and starts working from the first use. Infused with natural menthol, the pH-balanced formula delivers a cooling sensation that refreshes, revitalizes, and energizes the hair and scalp, leaving hair feeling clean and fresh after every wash Go out into the world with total confidence when you use the world’s #1 anti-dandruff shampoo**** that is dermatologically tested. *Helps provide relief from itch due to dandruff **Visible flakes with regular use ***Itch due to dandruff ****P&G calculation based on data reported by Nielsen. Duration July 2020-June 2021 time period.', 'Get rid of dandruff and stay worry free with Head & Shoulders Menthol Refresh Anti-Dandruff Shampoo.', 2.699, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N11265551A/45/_/1776348715/8754f4ae-28dd-40b1-8171-5c7f89510b4d.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N11265551A/45/_/1776348716/175e0bb2-b269-40ba-8863-1cb00e718676.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N11265551A/45/_/1776348712/e82b35d6-f5b7-40b5-9a33-97c8c9353049.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N11265551A/45/_/1776348713/094ae247-41f3-4b10-9da3-a1dcf6c0d46d.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'shampoos-conditioners'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'head-shoulders'), 4.6, 715, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'shampoos', 'conditioners']::text[]),
  ('Airwrap i.d.™ Multi-styler And Dryer - Straight+Wavy (Prussian Blue/Rich Copper) Prussian Blue Prussian Blue', 'airwrap-i-d-multi-styler-and-dryer-straight-wavy-prussian-blue-rich-co', 'With six attachments to style all hair types. In our Prussian blue/Rich copper colourway. Enhance natural curls and coils. Styling with Enhanced Coanda airflow. No heat damage. ¹ For use on dry and straight[ened] hair with flyaway mode to hide flyaways. ² vs. original Airwrap™ multi-styler and dryer barrels. ³ vs. original Dyson Airwrap™ multi-styler and dryer smoothing brushes. Latest technology Large round volumising brush Large brush with long, fine bristles for creating tension when styling. Engineered for longer hair, to shape and create more volume.¹ How it works: Long, fine bristles direct air deep into the hair to deliver volume and body, creating tension to shape the hair as it dries. Controlled airflow and bristle density create optimum control for smooth hair. Diffuser Helps to enhance and define natural waves, curls and coils by dispersing air evenly around your hair. Simulates natural drying by dispersing air evenly around your hair, banishing frizz How it works: Engineered to disperse air evenly, the Diffuser simulates natural drying, helping to reduce frizz and define natural waves, curls, and coils.', 'With six attachments to style all hair types. In our Prussian blue/Rich copper colourway. Enhance natural curls and coils.', 189.9, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZD4D462FFE3F0A7840AE8Z/45/_/1779873588/ed0c088d-9cd7-41ef-89da-4e198a70377f.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZD4D462FFE3F0A7840AE8Z/45/_/1779873588/5e1d6d44-72d8-4699-b8a9-449aeba38348.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZD4D462FFE3F0A7840AE8Z/45/_/1779873588/0a033aef-f75e-48f0-992a-549d5e84b460.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZD4D462FFE3F0A7840AE8Z/45/_/1779873588/b8f32179-165e-4a20-923e-3d16e2cd3f9e.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'styling-tools'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'dyson'), 4.6, 72943, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'styling', 'tools', 'curling', 'irons']::text[]),
  ('Avogain Minoxidil 5% For Hair Loss 6 Packs For 6 Months Multicolour 6None', 'avogain-minoxidil-5-for-hair-loss-6-packs-for-6-months-multicolour-6no', 'SFDA Approved, a topical solution that stimulates hair growth and prevents hair loss. Its formula provides an effective and safe way to treat hormonal baldness How to use: The hair and the alopecia area are dried before using Avogain solution. The dose of 1 ml is applied by pressing the sprayer in the direction of the area to be treated 8 to 10 times, then massaging and spreading the solution with the tips of the fingers. Leave to dry automatically. "It should be used twice daily" for four continuous months to notice the desired results. Caution & Warnings: For external use only Ingredients: Minoxidil 5%', 'SFDA Approved, a topical solution that stimulates hair growth and prevents hair loss.', 12.745, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z6FD0D49B089B965D2F99Z/45/_/1777376018/411c18fc-bba5-4bd4-ad4a-556447a60bca.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'hair-scalp-treatments'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'avalon-pharma'), 4.4, 623, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'scalp', 'treatments', 'loss', 'products']::text[]),
  ('Fino Premium Touch Hair Repair Set (2 Pieces) - Treatment Mask 230g - Moisturizing and Smoothing Oil 70ml', 'fino-premium-touch-hair-repair-set-2-pieces-treatment-mask-230g-moistu', 'Indulge in the luxurious hair care experience with the Fino Premium Touch Hair Repair Set. This comprehensive set includes a 230g treatment mask and a 70ml moisturizing and smoothing oil, providing superior nourishment and comprehensive repair for dry and damaged hair. With rich ingredients like royal jelly extract, Vitamin E, and Squalane, these products work together to restore hair’s moisture and shine. Advanced Lipidure EX technology ensures deep hydration and protection from external damage, while the lightweight oil with a floral scent leaves hair smooth and shiny without any sticky residue. Ideal for colored, chemically treated, and curly hair, this Japanese-made set offers noticeable improvements in the strength and beauty of your hair, making it the perfect choice for achieving permanently healthy and shiny hair.', 'Indulge in the luxurious hair care experience with the Fino Premium Touch Hair Repair Set.', 11.8, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZDE0D1C51C1E666842FB9Z/45/_/1720439427/362833ad-f156-42c5-b5d0-ee5d80cc2d9b.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZDE0D1C51C1E666842FB9Z/45/_/1720439438/3b354cbd-93cd-4c56-9bff-aac167f3ca8f.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZDE0D1C51C1E666842FB9Z/45/_/1720439431/bd18dfa2-e52d-4c79-b981-07a5a43265f8.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZDE0D1C51C1E666842FB9Z/45/_/1720439440/da99a612-8a75-4e74-8bef-6731c847ca98.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'hair-scalp-treatments'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'fino'), 3.7, 3, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'scalp', 'treatments', 'masks']::text[]),
  ('Barony hair brush 1200 watts, black', 'barony-hair-brush-1200-watts-black', 'BARONY Super Brush 1200W for Fast Hair Styling and Drying in One Step, Ionic Technology for Anti-Frizz and Natural Shine, Ceramic Bristles for Even Heat Distribution, Lightweight Ergonomic Design, Fast Professional Results, Suitable for All Hair Types', 'BARONY Super Brush 1200W for Fast Hair Styling and Drying in One Step, Ionic Technology for Anti-Frizz and Natural Shine, Ceramic Bristles f…', 11.9, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z9C0328939F67767F6426Z/45/_/1775381271/9e5eb1f8-f1e3-482e-ab0d-c48e9c88484d.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z9C0328939F67767F6426Z/45/_/1774874465/00ef43b3-237f-492a-aa78-fc57dc47856e.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z9C0328939F67767F6426Z/45/_/1774874465/636dfa7f-ed8c-47f7-8cb3-4716f13702fe.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z9C0328939F67767F6426Z/45/_/1774874206/4d0e4432-50e5-40ef-8fc0-3e85affbc810.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'styling-tools'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'barony'), 4.8, 1333, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'styling', 'tools', 'straightening', 'brushes']::text[]),
  ('5-in-1 Hair Dryer Brush , 1000W Ionic Multi-Functional Blow Dryer Brush for Frizz-Free Drying, Curling, Volumizing & Straightening', '5-in-1-hair-dryer-brush-1000w-ionic-multi-functional-blow-dryer-brush', 'Say goodbye to cluttered tools and styling frustration! This 5-in-1 Negative Ionic Styling Set integrates innovative technology to bring the salon-grade hair experience right into your daily routine. At its core, the system features 5 million high-concentration negative ions that are continuously released during styling. These ions effectively neutralize static electricity and smooth away frizz, allowing you to achieve your desired hairstyle while also enjoying smoother, shinier, and better-nourished hair. Built-in 32mm automatic curling barrels utilize Air-Powered Auto Wrap Technology—no manual winding needed. The left and right rotating barrels effortlessly create uniform, bouncy, and long-lasting symmetrical curls, making beginners feel like professional stylists instantly. Complete with multiple professional attachments like the 60mm oval volumizing brush and the 32mm round curling brush, this versatile hot air brush set functions as a powerful hair dryer, a straightening iron, a curling iron, and a volumizing tool for all-in-one styling. It also offers three precise temperature settings (High 135°C / Low 105°C / Cool Air 40°C), carefully calibrated for different hair types and styling steps to ensure gentle care for every strand. Whether you need a quick morning refresh or an elegant look before an evening out, this complete bow dryer and hair dryer brush kit empowers you to style with ease and confidence. One tool, endless possibilities—your personal styling salon, now ready to go wherever you are.', 'Say goodbye to cluttered tools and styling frustration! This 5-in-1 Negative Ionic Styling Set integrates innovative technology to bring the…', 21.9, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z9BAD77272F9042787642Z/45/_/1780283813/94faa43a-4704-4d65-a6