  ('Avogain 2% Spray Solution For Women 50ml', 'avogain-2-spray-solution-for-women-50ml', 'A topical solution that stimulateshair growth and prevents hair loss.. Its formula provides an effective and safeway to treat hormonal baldness in women.', 'A topical solution that stimulateshair growth and prevents hair loss..', 2.495, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZFAA05ACE77AE95907AE7Z/45/_/1777376114/db7df3c3-16e5-404f-9d42-a1ae79dfb0a6.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZFAA05ACE77AE95907AE7Z/45/_/1777376115/5a9bc958-cee5-4fb4-8ac6-974cdcfb7ad4.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZFAA05ACE77AE95907AE7Z/45/_/1777376115/2a1373ed-6011-41d7-837c-b0f77f59c45c.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZFAA05ACE77AE95907AE7Z/45/_/1777376115/b91e8d11-7a5d-4b52-93b9-3cb92199378f.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'hair-scalp-treatments'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'avalon-pharma'), 4.3, 1081, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'scalp', 'treatments', 'treatment']::text[]),
  ('Barony Slim Hair Straightening Brush - Pink', 'barony-slim-hair-straightening-brush-pink', 'Barony Slim Thermal Hair Styling Brush, Pink, Even Heat Distribution, Frizz Reduction, Slim Design for Root Access, Suitable for All Hair Types, Professional Results for Daily Use', 'Barony Slim Thermal Hair Styling Brush, Pink, Even Heat Distribution, Frizz Reduction, Slim Design for Root Access, Suitable for All Hair Ty…', 19.015, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z2FC1B6808562F3528F4DZ/45/_/1781178433/3ac718d6-7246-4ecc-b8ca-95b7544b2e05.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z2FC1B6808562F3528F4DZ/45/_/1781178433/879927c0-da64-4ba2-86fd-0e4485b0c194.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z2FC1B6808562F3528F4DZ/45/_/1781178432/b538ef88-53e3-44cd-819e-97596e40776c.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z2FC1B6808562F3528F4DZ/45/_/1781178433/ddb9465a-5e40-48fa-9aaa-47eb59cc1e91.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'styling-tools'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'barony'), 4.6, 649, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'styling', 'tools', 'straightening', 'brushes']::text[]),
  ('Ionic Hair Styler Brush and Hair Curler, 32mm Barrel Professional Curling Iron for All Hair Types, Fast Heated 60°C-220°C, for Curling & Straightening & Volumizing Perfect Gift for Women', 'ionic-hair-styler-brush-and-hair-curler-32mm-barrel-professional-curli', 'Achieve beautiful, healthy-looking hair at home with the 32mm Ionic Hair Styler Brush, suitable for a variety of hair types. While this version does not include infrared heating, negative ion technology ensures frizz-free, smooth, and shiny hair, ideal for Middle Eastern hair that can be thick or textured. The 32mm barrel creates defined curls, soft waves, and natural volume quickly, perfect for everyday styling or special occasions. With adjustable heat from 60°C to 220°C, you can safely tailor the temperature to your hair type for optimal results without damage. Important: This brush is designed for dry hair only and is not suitable for wet hair. Lightweight, ergonomic, and travel-friendly with global voltage, this styling brush combines convenience, safety, and effectiveness. The auto shut-off feature provides peace of mind, while high-quality construction ensures a durable styling tool that delivers healthy, shiny hair with ease every day.', 'Achieve beautiful, healthy-looking hair at home with the 32mm Ionic Hair Styler Brush, suitable for a variety of hair types.', 18.9, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZCFFEF918C3F975FCF968Z/45/1767923828/174c186e-b405-42c3-b9b4-ddf28428ba5e.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZCFFEF918C3F975FCF968Z/45/1767923892/347c809f-9711-4e73-91c3-e8fb3aae3a8e.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZCFFEF918C3F975FCF968Z/45/1767923892/cb852d7c-94e7-4c33-86ba-3e7a12b9f8e7.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZCFFEF918C3F975FCF968Z/45/1767923892/690ea326-d968-4d57-ae21-7ad38b937b32.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'styling-tools'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'doscher'), 4.2, 23, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['hair', 'care', 'styling', 'tools', 'curling', 'irons']::text[]),
  ('Nature X Science Rosemary Hibiscus Hair Growth Oil For Women And Men | Helps Hair Growth And Strengthens Hair | Nourishes Scalp And Controls Hair Fall | Suitable For All Hair Types-100Ml', 'nature-x-science-rosemary-hibiscus-hair-growth-oil-for-women-and-men-h', 'Nature x Science Rosemary Nourishment Oil: This Rosemary & Hibiscus Hair Growth Oil is expertly crafted with a powerful blend of nature''s ingredients known to sustain hair growth and control hair fall by nourishing the scalp. This treatment can be applied overnight, before shampoo, or as a leave-in option, depending on your hair needs.. Helps Hair Growth in 12 weeks*: The primary function of this oil is healthy hair which is supported by ingredients like Rosemary Leaf Oil, Hibiscus Flower Oil & Redensyl that are clinically proven to stimulate hair follicles and promote hair growth. Claims are based on consumer trials*. Hairfall Control in just 7 uses*: Enriched with Biotin and Bhringaj, this lightweight oil deeply nourishes the scalp, strengthens weak hair strands, and reduces hair breakage, leaving your hair visibly smoother, shinier, and more resilient. Claims are based on consumer trials*. Versatile Daily Hair Care: Lightweight formula perfect for daily hair care routines, especially for those who oil daily. Alternatively, if daily application isn''t your habit, use it twice a week before shampoo or leave it on overnight for best results.. Lightweight formula for All Hair Types: Formulated for all hair and scalp types, this relieves common scalp concerns like dryness and itchiness, while enhancing hair texture and leaving it soft, supple, and smooth.', 'Nature x Science Rosemary Nourishment Oil: This Rosemary & Hibiscus Hair Growth Oil is expertly crafted with a powerful blend of nature''s in…', 3.499, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/7f94360644cd4a7b954b3c02af52effb|pzsku/Z93339038ED9231179D48Z/45/1769076238/cbda9020-6898-4097-93f1-bae689891260.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/7f9436