  ('Universal Collapsible Hair Dryer Diffuser, Diffuser Hair Dryer Attachment, Blow Dryer Travel Portable for Curly Wave and Natural Hair, Travel Folding Design Fit Most of blow Dryers-Black', 'universal-collapsible-hair-dryer-diffuser-diffuser-hair-dryer-attachme', '【Fit Most Hair Dryers】Universal collapsible hair dryer diffuser size is sutiable for various of hair dryers(nozzle diameter:D-1.575 inches to 1.968 inches).. 【Function】Universal collapsible hair dryer diffuser help to diffuser the heat and air from the dryer evenly, expand the heat area,avoiding heat damage to hair and keeping your natural curls. Professional salon tool for fine thick curly frizzy and wavy hair, dry and gain volume without frizz.So you can do a perfect hair style faster and better.. 【Folding Structure】It is easier to put the universal collapsible hair dryer diffuser in a handbag or drawer, suitable for travel or home. Lightweight silicone hair dryer diffuser is helpfulness for you everywhere.. 【Heartwarming】The detachable filter net to let the universal collapsible hair dryer diffuser direct contact with the hair essential oil design, let the hair send out natural fragrance.. 【Perfect Gifts-Buy with Confidence】We believe in providing safe hair dryer diffuser to our valued customers; you will love our universal collapsible hair dryer diffuser.', '【Fit Most Hair Dryers】Universal collapsible hair dryer diffuser size is sutiable for various of hair dryers(nozzle diameter:D-1.575 inches t…', 2.99, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/9eeb73fccf375957a9fe0406a65fbfed|pzsku/ZF1E6022CCE95CCA77321Z/45/1768813144/dc29903f-fe76-4a12-90b8-49ef43ccef34.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZF1E6022CCE95CCA77321Z/45/_/1773711700/013a5436-0e0b-49b5-8ce0-266cba0f067c.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZF1E6022CCE95CCA77321Z/45/_/1773711700/cf3a3941-5c85-4db0-b9a5-30eb13c8abba.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZF1E6022CCE95CCA77321Z/45/_/1773711731/4a9ea286-2b29-4096