  ('Double Wear Stay In Place Makeup 2W2 Rattan', 'double-wear-stay-in-place-makeup-2w2-rattan', 'Looks flawless and natural. Feels lightweight and comfortable. Won''t change colour, smudge or come off on clothes. Lasts through heat and humidity', 'Looks flawless and natural. Feels lightweight and comfortable. Won''t change colour, smudge or come off on clothes.', 18.5, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z94292DC6B26224B28DCEZ/45/_/1779872521/87fa6730-95e3-4a82-81a6-523e7b7cdd5e.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'face-makeups'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'estee-lauder'), 3.5, 167, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'face', 'makeups', 'foundation']::text[]),
