  ('On ''Til Dawn Matte Setting Spray, Long-Lasting Waterproof Matte Finish, with Green Tea & Witch Hazel - Oil Control, 3.4 oz / 143 ml', 'on-til-dawn-matte-setting-spray-long-lasting-waterproof-matte-finish-w', 'LONG-LASTING PERFORMANCE: Ultra-light setting spray delivers 16 hours of waterproof, sweat-proof, and smudge-proof makeup protection with a matte finish.. MATTIFYING FORMULA: Features witch hazel to absorb excess oil and create a blurred, matte finish while keeping makeup transfer-proof.. SKIN-FRIENDLY INGREDIENTS: Contains green tea extract to help tighten pores in a non-comedogenic, dermatologist-tested formula.. BREATHABLE TECHNOLOGY: Utilizes a fine polymer film blend that locks in makeup while allowing skin to breathe throughout wear.. LIGHTWEIGHT APPLICATION: Non-sticky, ultra-fine mist applies evenly and dries quickly for comfortable all-day wear without clogging pores.', 'LONG-LASTING PERFORMANCE: Ultra-light setting spray delivers 16 hours of waterproof, sweat-proof, and smudge-proof makeup protection with a…', 6.9, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z4539B4BD5C7CB213DBF0Z/45/1747962947/e65e3b85-f408-42bd-ba78-ee3dad1d0983.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z4539B4BD5C7CB213DBF0Z/45/1747962947/9361aaa1-351c-463e-821d-c391ee42dc4b.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z4539B4BD5C7CB213DBF0Z/45/1747962947/c501b26e-203e-4c52-954f-302953bba2ab.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z4539B4BD5C7CB213DBF0Z/45/1747962953/866c5d8f-4676-4bda-ab9c-893fc6877eac.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'face-makeups'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'one-size'), 5, 2, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'face', 'makeups', 'foundation']::text[]),
  ('Long-Lasting Cushion Foundation | Semi-Matte Velvet Finish, Comfortable & Breathable | 72-Hour Extended Wear, Color-Lock & Non-Dimming | Hydrating, Lightweight, Buildable High Coverage | Creates a Smooth Second-Skin Base', 'long-lasting-cushion-foundation-semi-matte-velvet-finish-comfortable-b', '72-Hour Extended Wear: Utilizes advanced color-lock technology to strongly adhere to the skin, preventing makeup from fading, becoming patchy, or dulling, while maintaining a radiant, just-applied glow. Whether it''s a busy workday or a long date night, it handles it all with ease.. Semi-Matte Comfortable Finish: Features a unique semi-matte texture that strikes the perfect balance between soft blur and dewy radiance. It effectively controls excess oil for a fresh, clean look while preserving the skin''s natural translucency. The result is a sophisticated, comfortable finish with absolutely no caked-on feeling.. Second-Skin Smoothness: Its lightweight texture is easy to pat and blend, seamlessly fusing with the skin for a "smooth coating" experience. Even with multiple layers, it remains breathable and feels comfortably weightless.. Multiple Options to Meet Your Needs: Coverage: Ranges from light and natural to full and high-coverage. It can be layered according to need, easily concealing imperfections and evening out skin tone. Finish: Offers a variety of choices from Glow, Semi-Matte, to Full Matte, catering to different skin types and makeup preferences. Staying Power: Features strong long-wear technology to ensure your makeup stays fresh all day. Hydration: Contains a balanced amount of moisturizing ingredients, ranging from mild hydration to intense nourishment, keeping your skin''s oil-water balance in check at all times.', '72-Hour Extended Wear: Utilizes advanced color-lock technology to strongly adhere to the skin, preventing makeup from fading, becoming patch…', 3.928, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z9A9FAF5FA9FC96212312Z/45/_/1773222335/749b078