  ('HD Liquid Coverage Foundation 036 Hazelnut Beige', 'hd-liquid-coverage-foundation-036-hazelnut-beige', 'Online shopping for Catrice. Trusted Shipping to Riyadh, Jeddah and all KSA ✓ Great Prices ✓ Secure Shopping ✓ 100% Contactless ✓ Easy Free Returns ✓ Cash on Delivery. Shop Now', 'Online shopping for Catrice. Trusted Shipping to Riyadh, Jeddah and all KSA ✓ Great Prices ✓ Secure Shopping ✓ 100% Contactless ✓ Easy Free…', 3, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/v1649514390/N40716908A_1.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/v1604406054/N40716908A_2.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N40716908A/45/_/1700657556/a9308840-c2a0-4a4f-bd50-3d88c4de2ea6.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'face-makeups'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'catrice'), 4.3, 732, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'face', 'makeups', 'foundation']::text[]),
  ('Soft Glam Filter Fluid Foundation', 'soft-glam-filter-fluid-foundation', 'Creamy, ultra-light texture. With vitamin E and squalane. Vegan, oil-free, perfume, alcohol, parabens, microplastic particles, nanoparticles free, gluten-free, acetone-free. We say no to animal testing. Cosnova is internationally listed with essence and CATRICE at PETA Germany as well as PETA.. Nourishing, radiant fresh, radiant, natural, shimmering, shiny, for all skin types', 'Creamy, ultra-light texture. With vitamin E and squalane.', 2.833, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z598351E2B086FA805CC2Z/45/_/1739359050/3fe41724-0fd2-45fe-84e9-e9f11cc0e447.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z598351E2B086FA805CC2Z/45/_/1739359054/2fa44393-d106-45b9-ad44-0c5af2988997.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z598351E2B086FA805CC2Z/45/_/1739359052/0cde2c01-737d-4108-88ea-0a57a1eb57e3.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'face-makeups'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'catrice'), 4.3, 182, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'face', 'makeups', 'foundation']::text[]),
  ('Natural Radiant Longwear Liquid Foundation Barcelona Barcelona', 'natural-radiant-longwear-liquid-foundation-barcelona-barcelona', 'About the product: There&rsquo;s long wear. And then there&rsquo;s strong wear. Introducing NARS&rsquo; first 16-hour foundation. Untraceable. Unstoppable. Unlike anything else. Longwear is finally lightweight. High coverage is now supernatural. Its breathable, fade-resistant formula is infused with Raspberry, Apple, and Watermelon extracts to help smooth and improve the look of your skin instantly, and over time. Wears longer. Stays stronger. Looks better with each hour. Specialized skin-matching technology ensures your most natural match yet. About the brand: NARS Cosmetics is a French cosmetics and skincare company founded by make-up artist and photographer Fran&ccedil;ois Nars in 1994. The cosmetics line began with twelve lipsticks sold at Barneys New York. Since then, NARS has created various multi-use beauty products and is now a subsidiary of Shiseido. Ingredients: Dimethicone, Water, Phenyl Trimethicone, Glycerin, Polymethylsilsesquioxane, Peg-10 Dimethicone, Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Cyclopentasiloxane, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Ppg-3 Benzyl Ether Myristate, Boron Nitride, Bis-Butyldimethicone Polyglyceryl-3, Butylene Glycol, Sorbitan Sesquiisostearate, Rubus Idaeus (Raspberry) Fruit Extract, Citrullus Lanatus (Watermelon) Fruit Extract, Pyrus Malus (Apple) Fruit Extract, Lens Esculenta (Lentil) Fruit Extract, Tocopherol, Sodium Pca, Sodium Lactate, Disodium Stearoyl Glutamate, Hydrogenated Polydecene, Pentaerythrityl Tetraethylhexanoate, Peg/Ppg-14/7 Dimethyl Ether, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-Di-T-Butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Sodium Stearoyl Glutamate, Behenic Acid, Stearic Acid, Stearyl Alcohol, Behenyl Alcohol, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Barium Sulfate, Aluminum Dimyristate, Alumina, Tin Oxide, Polysilicone-2, Potassium Hydroxide, Phenoxyethanol, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate, [+/- (May Contain): Mica, Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491), Iron Oxides (Ci 77492), Iron Oxides (Ci 77499)]. How to use: 1. Dispense one pump or a pearl-sized amount of Natural Radiant Longwear Foundation and warm with fingertips 2. Too much formula accentuates lines and imperfections. Avoid excess application around the eyes or contours of the face. 3. Apply foundation starting at the center of the face and blend out with fingertips. Focus on one area at a time and blend well.', 'There&rsquo;s long wear. And then there&rsquo;s strong wear. Introducing NARS&rsquo; first 16-hour foundation. Untraceable. Unstoppable.', 12.74, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZEE816F7B5AB7E1533D38Z/45/_/1779179003/90b448bd-1e32-4f86-82a5-d13ed5d94f12.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZEE816F7B5AB7E1533D38Z/45/_/1779179003/3de85faf-85e4-4c2f-979b-9d77357ed77a.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZEE816F7B5AB7E1533D38Z/45/_/1779179003/87b05470-a449-4ae4-8403-9ec5d61f3218.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZEE816F7B5AB7E1533D38Z/45/_/1779179003/b652db64-9ce8-4842-8f0c-cac36f9775c2.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'face-makeups'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'nars'), 4.3, 956, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'face', 'makeups', 'foundation']::text[]),
  ('Natural Radiant Longwear Liquid Foundation Punjab Punjab', 'natural-radiant-longwear-liquid-foundation-punjab-punjab', 'Medium coverage applies using a flat foundation brush like an artisan brush, starting at the center and blending out and down. Repeat on the chin, followed by the forehead, blending into the hairline. For sheer coverage, apply with fingertips beginning at the center of your face and blending out and down. For extra coverage for added coverage on any areas, go back and gently tap more foundation onto the skin using your fingertips or your brush. Ingredients: cyclopentasiloxane, water, peg-10 dimethicone, neopentyl glycol diethylhexanoate, talc, mica, phenyl trimethicone, sodium chloride, lauroyl lysine, dimethicone crosspolymer, methylpropanediol, glyceryl caprylate, propanediol, disteardimonium hectorite, sucrose palmitate, phenoxyethanol, sodium myristoyl glutamate, alumina, cyclohexasiloxane, propylene carbonate, pentylene glycol, sorbitan sesquioleate, evodia rutaecarpa fruit extract, tocopheryl acetate, glyceryl linoleate, aluminum hydroxide, glycerin, fragrance', 'Medium coverage applies using a flat foundation brush like an artisan brush, starting at the center and blending out and down.', 14.595, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z76FDB081D58826AD5C2FZ/45/_/1779179166/4855b6d5-9296-4322-bd4a-e49a6674a83a.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z76FDB081D58826AD5C2FZ/45/_/1779179166/0943d004-5670-4462-ab3e-b0bd9bb40337.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z76FDB081D58826AD5C2FZ/45/_/1779179166/36be3124-0a0c-404d-96e8-cfa5b84f0b4c.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'face-makeups'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'nars'), 4.2, 57, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'face', 'makeups', 'foundation']::text[]),
