  ('Buttermelt Glaze Soft Glow Skin Tint + SPF/FPS 30 Foundation 12h Wear Almond Butta', 'buttermelt-glaze-soft-glow-skin-tint-spf-fps-30-foundation-12h-wear-al', 'This formula is butta than the rest! It melts right in for butta glazed skin. Go from skin that''s looking dull to skin that''s giving'' GLAZE! You’ll be looking’ butta than ever with this 93% skincare tint infused with Shea Butter, Mango Butter, & Niacinamide. This buttalicious formula has got you glowing'' with a glazed donut finish and SPF/FPS 30! With these benefits your skin is about to be soft like butta baby! You butta glow girl! This non greasy glaze leaves skin smooth and protected! You butta believe this formula has no white cast and even resists fading for a soft glow glazed lewk. We bring PRO to PROtect, helping to shield skin against harmful rays with SPF/FPS 30! Get glazed donut skin & SPF/FPS 30 protection in a skincare-based formula that wears for up to 12H! Butta glaze, butta care, butta shield; there is nothing’ butta than this triple threat. Now in ten sheer buttalicious shades, this glaze has got you butta’d down in benefits. Get ready to glaze it up! Shake well and apply onto skin with fingers, a makeup sponge or brush. Watch as the formula melts right in for healthy and even skin tone. This sheer buttery glaze brings the stretch to shades! Each shade works on up to three skin tones and blends in just like butta! Glue it all down with The Face Glue Setting Spray over the face.', 'This formula is butta than the rest! It melts right in for butta glazed skin.', 4.8, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z8DB6C215CAF7B980154FZ/45/_/1737529648/5729a358-b290-45bf-99af-2f7be8189bb1.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z8DB6C215CAF7B980154FZ/45/_/1737529603/5685fb0d-1640-46a1-b42b-4b38e577290c.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z8DB6C215CAF7B980154FZ/45/_/1737529596/56fcb76f-69ea-48dd-a197-f21a289fe51c.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z8DB6C215CAF7B