  ('Colour Changing Foundation for Different Skin Tone, Medium Spectrum 4in1 Foundation with SPF 50 Protection Sunscreen, Longwearing & Waterproof, Full Coverage Concealer, Moisturizing Deep Hydration and Skin Tone Perfecting Skincare', 'colour-changing-foundation-for-different-skin-tone-medium-spectrum-4in', 'Sunscreen Serum SPF 50, 4-in-1 Colour Changing Foundation, Hypoallergenic, Long-lasting & Waterproof, Lightweight with Neutral Finish, Hydrating & Even Skin Tone, Colour Mimicking Technology, Color Changing Foundation for Different Skin Tones, Liquid Face Makeup Base with Medium to Full Coverage.A liquid foundation that delivers superior comfort and blends seamlessly with your natural skin tone. This multi-tasking product acts as both a foundation and concealer, delivering instant hydration in just 30 seconds. It features long-lasting, water-resistant coverage that lasts up to 24 hours and SPF 50+ sun protection against harmful UV rays.', 'Sunscreen Serum SPF 50, 4-in-1 Colour Changing Foundation, Hypoallergenic, Long-lasting & Waterproof, Lightweight with Neutral Finish, Hydra…', 3.465, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBBD63126185D8A34BFB2Z/45/_/1784084913/14c33601-fd7a-456a-8a0d-c474689a87cf.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBBD63126185D8A34BFB2Z/45/1750211176/d2d03ab5-951b-4e4c-b55d-394ccfb088af.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBBD63126185D8A34BFB2Z/45/1750211176/f759c44e-8959-4f20-b334-7b30b10e72e9.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBBD63126185D8A34BFB2Z/45/1750211177/acf85939-b66d-4e82-a619-2fa4355a4870.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'face-makeups'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'foundation'), 4.3, 13, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'face', 'makeups', 'foundation']::text[]),
  ('Infaillible Fresh Wear Cushion Foundation, K-beauty Inspired, 140', 'infaillible-fresh-wear-cushion-foundation-k-beauty-inspired-140', 'For long-lasting, cushion foundation, flawless 24hr high coverage. Breathable texture Available in 17 shades. K-beauty Inspired for a flawless complexion this long-lasting cushion foundation offers a breathable formula with a lightweight BB cream like feel yet delivers flawless, undetectable coverage that lasts. 24hours with 17 diverse shades a perfect match is ensured. 24H Oil Control *Instrumental test on 32 women/subjects 24H No Color Change *Instrumental test on 32 women/subjects Longwear from day to night *24 instrumental test on 32 subjects', 'For long-lasting, cushion foundation, flawless 24hr high coverage. Breathable texture Available in 17 shades.', 6.575, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z5CE4CD47D33475318C0EZ/45/_/1773835294/25c610e5-6e9d-4774-a572-8b7abd813157.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z5CE4CD47D33475318C0EZ/45/_/1773835294/cfb06984-420f-48bf-b3a5-4969fbe07501.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z5CE4CD47D33475318C0EZ/45/_/1773835294/eb712a13-0517-4961-94a3-57a6d8fe168d.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z5CE4CD47D33475318C0EZ/45/_/1773835294/65e7df6a-a457-44fc-b753-dc2e5fbf5760.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'face-makeups'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'l-oreal-paris'), 4.8, 20, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'face', 'makeups', 'foundation']::text[]),
  ('STUDIO FIX POWDER PLUS FOUNDATION NC20 NC20', 'studio-fix-powder-plus-foundation-nc20-nc20', 'Give your skin a healthy and sun-kissed glow with this powder plus foundation. A one-step powder and foundation that gives skin a smooth, flawless, all-matte finish with medium to full coverage. Long-wearing, velvety texture allows skin to breathe, suitable for all skin types.', 'Give your skin a healthy and sun-kissed glow with this powder plus foundation.', 9.2, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZFD4FB9FDF984D868D532Z/45/_/1779343192/172c9052-1347-4c93-8418-6b049f2c9eec.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZFD4FB9FDF984D868D532Z/45/_/1779343192/0d519863-f031-4045-ac41-66b9837977db.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZFD4FB9FDF984D868D532Z/45/_/1779343192/2cfee633-f5c2-4d3e-82e0-01e83b121992.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZFD4FB9FDF984D868D532Z/45/_/1779343192/d393adcf-ed15-4c81-93f7-71715d7456f2.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'face-makeups'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'mac'), 3.3, 406, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'face', 'makeups', 'foundation']::text[]),
  ('Beauty FOREVER FOUNDATION HD FULL COVER (LONG LASTING FOUNDATION07', 'beauty-forever-foundation-hd-full-cover-long-lasting-foundation07', 'Online shopping for Beauty Forever. Trusted Shipping to Riyadh, Jeddah and all KSA ✓ Great Prices ✓ Secure Shopping ✓ 100% Contactless ✓ Easy Free Returns ✓ Cash on Delivery. Shop Now', 'Online shopping for Beauty Forever. Trusted Shipping to Riyadh, Jeddah and all KSA ✓ Great Prices ✓ Secure Shopping ✓ 100% Contactless ✓ Eas…', 5, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z27DAA23620171712BDA0Z/45/1767115294/a3f8813e-ebd7-45fc-9ac3-c284dd70ee00.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'face-makeups'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'beauty-forever'), 3.6, 12, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'face', 'makeups', 'foundation']::text[]),
  ('STUDIO FIX FLUID SPF 15 FOUNDATION NC 15 NC15', 'studio-fix-fluid-spf-15-foundation-nc-15-nc15', 'About the product: This Studio Fix Fluid SPF15 Foundation is formulated to offer a natural matte finish with medium to full coverage with a broad spectrum. Builds and blends easily and it''s long-wearing, it helps minimise the appearance of pores and imperfections, giving skin a smoother, more flawless look and finish. All-day Oil-free, Sweat- and humidity-resistant foundation suits all skin types. About the brand: MAC Cosmetics, stylized as M&middot;A&middot;C, is a Canadian cosmetics manufacturer founded in Toronto in 1984 by Frank Toskan and Frank Angelo. The company is headquartered in New York City after becoming a subsidiary of Est&eacute;e Lauder Companies in 1996. MAC is an acronym for Makeup Art Cosmetics. Ingredients: WaterAquaEau, Cyclopentasiloxane, Peg-10 Dimethicone, Butylene Glycol, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate, Dimethicone, Magnesium Sulfate, Titanium Dioxide, Laminaria Saccharina Extract, Algae Extract, Tocopheryl Acetate, Sodium Hyaluronate, Tocopherol, Lecithin, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Xanthan Gum, Sorbitan Sesquioleate, Methoxy Amodimethicone/Silsesquioxane Copolymer, Laureth-7, Dipropylene Glycol, Dimethicone/Peg-10/15 Crosspolymer, Dimethicone/Peg-10 Crosspolymer, Peg/Ppg-18/18 Dimethicone, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Silica, Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Propylene Carbonate, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-Di-T-Butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Sorbic Acid, Chloroxylenol, Phenoxyethanol, [+/- Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491), Iron Oxides (Ci 77492), Iron Oxides (Ci 77499), Chromium Oxide Greens (Ci 77288)]. How to use: Always apply to a well moisturized and prepped skin with the 132 Duo Fibre Foundation Brush for a studio ready flawless face! Apply product to the center of the face first (or where you want more coverage) then use the brush to blend to the outer regions of your face.', 'This Studio Fix Fluid SPF15 Foundation is formulated to offer a natural matte finish with medium to full coverage with a broad spectrum.', 9.2, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZDE0CC19E7427CDDA4A88Z/45/_/1779343790/c14d862c-9320-4e61-9ec0-1bb015b454ee.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZDE0CC19E7427CDDA4A88Z/45/_/1779343790/c46f0a33-5ad7-4f0a-b356-e87150f19b48.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZDE0CC19E7427CDDA4A88Z/45/_/1779343790/b9e95132-6b7b-4b14-9d64-4e96b51b74d4.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZDE0CC19E7427CDDA4A88Z/45/_/1779343790/8a42b3d1-b9c2-4616-b9f5-628090c7fa44.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'face-makeups'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'mac'), 3.6, 769, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'face', 'makeups', 'foundation']::text[]),
  ('Mask Fit Red Cushion Foundation | Full coverage, Weightless, Skin fit, Satin Glow Finish, Korean Makeup BB Foundation, beauty, Tattoo cover up, Buildable (#23N Sand, 0.63 Fl Oz)', 'mask-fit-red-cushion-foundation-full-coverage-weightless-skin-fit-sati', '[1st KOREAN CUSHION FOUNDATION with 40 SHADE RANGE] TIRTIR Mask Fit Red Cushion is the first Korean cushion foundation with a wide range of shades. From light to deep tones, this TIRTIR cushion foundation provides strong, comfortable coverage packed with nutrients for a flawless, all-day wear. Achieve the perfect "glass skin" look with this innovative Korean makeup solution.. [SKIN-FIT COVERAGE with SATIN GLOW] This Korean foundation makeup offers medium to full coverage that feels weightless on the skin. With high, breathable coverage and a satin glow finish, it ensures a naturally beautiful and radiant look. Experience the ultimate in Korean cushion foundation performance with a flawless finish that lasts all day.. [72-HOUR LONG-LASTING & WEIGHTLESS] Experience a foundation that feels as thin as water with a lightweight, non-greasy formula. The TIRTIR cushion’s 72-hour lasting power ensures enduring wear, proving that a little goes a long way. Perfect for K-beauty enthusiasts looking for a reliable base.. [NOURISHING ELASTICITY] Infused with hibiscus and red propolis extracts, our formula enhances skin elasticity, providing a lasting finish that radiates a satin glow. Enjoy makeup that not only lasts but also highlights your glass skin beauty all day long.. [EASY, QUICK APPLICATION] Goes on easily and sets quickly for a smooth, flawless finish—buildable yet light as a bb cream, embodying Korean cushion innovation.', '[1st KOREAN CUSHION FOUNDATION with 40 SHADE RANGE] TIRTIR Mask Fit Red Cushion is the first Korean cushion foundation with a wide range of…', 4.462, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z0A012874A1B648AC500DZ/45/_/1776796937/d99071ba-035f-45c8-bedd-7f609e590ee1.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z0A012874A1B648AC500DZ/45/_/1776796937/443fd54a-d831-4f61-a11e-db2860c88b4b.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z0A012874A1B648AC500DZ/45/_/1776796937/990cfbe0-8e1b-4e1d-84f2-c0290a3d9772.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z0A012874A1B648AC500DZ/45/_/1776796937/179bf2cb-254a-4bc5-bf48-65fd79686065.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'face-makeups'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'tirtir'), 3.5, 5, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'face', 'makeups', 'foundation']::text[]),
  ('Lasting Performance, Liquid Foundation 35 ml 102 Pastelle', 'lasting-performance-liquid-foundation-35-ml-102-pastelle', 'About the product: Max Factor Lasting Performance Liquid Foundation guarantees 8 hours of stay put perfection. With a film-forming technology, it covers perfectly giving the appearance of firmer skin. Specially designed lightweight silicones and a hard-wearing, touch proof system stand up to any amount of rubbing or touching - the foundation won''t even rub off on your clothes. The effective water-in-silicone emulsion guarantees high coverage, which lasts up to 8 hours, and provides the natural look without fading or streaking. Your natural look will stay in place from morning to evening. This Foundation is fragrance and oil free and is non-comedogenic, which means it won''t clog the pores. About the brand: In Hollywood''s Golden Age, when it came to make-up, only one name was on the lips of the silver screen stars - Mr Max Factor A visionary make-up artist, wig maker and inventor, Max Factor was known for creating the signature looks of the era&rsquo;s most famous icons and believed that glamour should be within reach of all women. From mascara to foundation, eye shadow to lip gloss &ndash; Max Factor put the transformative tools for make-up artistry into the hands of every woman, enabling her to create her own personal glamour statement every day. Ingredients: Aqua, Cyclopentasiloxane, Propylene Glycol, Dimethicone, Talc, Aluminum Starch Octenylsuccinate, PEG/PPG-18/18 Dimethicone, Sodium Chloride, PVP, Laureth-7, Trihydroxystearin, Methicone, Arachidyl Behenate, Titanium Dioxide (Nano), Silica, Polyglyceryl-4 Isostearate, Cetyl PEG/PPG-10/1 Dimethicone, Hexyl Laurate, Ethylene/Methacrylate Copolymer, Synthetic Wax, Ethylene Brassylate, Behenic Acid, Polyethylene, Aluminum Hydroxide, Stearic Acid, Isopropyl Titanium Triisostearate, Sodium Dehydroacetate, Methylparaben, Propylparaben [+/- CI 77891, CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499]. How to use: Apply with your fingertips or a foundation brush to deliver a perfect flawless base to your skin.', 'Max Factor Lasting Performance Liquid Foundation guarantees 8 hours of stay put perfection.', 0, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N11034112A/45/_/1767607602/349d4ec7-ecce-4cab-aaf4-c275c0ea70e2.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/v1622718545/N11034112A_2.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/v1622718545/N11034112A_3.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/v1622718545/N11034112A_4.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'face-makeups'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'max-factor'), 4.3, 126, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'face', 'makeups', 'foundation']::text[]),
  ('Lasting Performance, Liquid Foundation 35 ml 105 Soft Beige', 'lasting-performance-liquid-foundation-35-ml-105-soft-beige', 'About the product: Max Factor Lasting Performance Liquid Foundation guarantees 8 hours of stay put perfection. With a film-forming technology, it covers perfectly giving the appearance of firmer skin. Specially designed lightweight silicones and a hard-wearing, touch proof system stand up to any amount of rubbing or touching - the foundation won''t even rub off on your clothes. The effective water-in-silicone emulsion guarantees high coverage, which lasts up to 8 hours, and provides the natural look without fading or streaking. Your natural look will stay in place from morning to evening. This Foundation is fragrance and oil free and is non-comedogenic, which means it won''t clog the pores. About the brand: In Hollywood''s Golden Age, when it came to make-up, only one name was on the lips of the silver screen stars - Mr Max Factor A visionary make-up artist, wig maker and inventor, Max Factor was known for creating the signature looks of the era&rsquo;s most famous icons and believed that glamour should be within reach of all women. From mascara to foundation, eye shadow to lip gloss &ndash; Max Factor put the transformative tools for make-up artistry into the hands of every woman, enabling her to create her own personal glamour statement every day. Ingredients: Aqua, Cyclopentasiloxane, Propylene Glycol, Dimethicone, Talc, Aluminum Starch Octenylsuccinate, PEG/PPG-18/18 Dimethicone, Sodium Chloride, PVP, Laureth-7, Trihydroxystearin, Methicone, Arachidyl Behenate, Titanium Dioxide (Nano), Silica, Polyglyceryl-4 Isostearate, Cetyl PEG/PPG-10/1 Dimethicone, Hexyl Laurate, Ethylene/Methacrylate Copolymer, Synthetic Wax, Ethylene Brassylate, Behenic Acid, Polyethylene, Aluminum Hydroxide, Stearic Acid, Isopropyl Titanium Triisostearate, Sodium Dehydroacetate, Methylparaben, Propylparaben [+/- CI 77891, CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499]. How to us