  ('Professional Warm Ultimate Eyeshadow Palette, 25 High-Pigmented Nude Colors, Matte, Shimmer, Satin Finishes, Vegan & Cruelty-Free (01#)', 'professional-warm-ultimate-eyeshadow-palette-25-high-pigmented-nude-co', '【Professional Nude Eyeshadow Palette for Glamorous Looks】: Ultimate shadow palette offers 25 captivating shades. Seamlessly transition from understated elegance to radiant glamour with versatile warm and neutral tones. 【Product Features】: This highly pigmented shadow accurately delivers vibrant colors while ensuring long-lasting wear without fading. Its crease-resistant formula keeps your makeup flawlessly intact from day to night. 【Blendable and Buildable Formula】: Each shade delivers rich, nuanced color payoff, achieving a soft, natural look or layer effortlessly to create bold, dramatic intensity. The tonal harmony allows limitless customization of your signature makeup style. 【Multi-Purpose Use】: Designed for all skin tones, this eyeshadow palette empowers both makeup beginners and professionals. Its rich spectrum of shades effortlessly transitions from daily outings to glamorous evening events. 【Exquisite Gift】: This eyeshadow palette makes a thoughtful present for your loved ones during special festive occasions, perfectly conveying your heartfelt sentiments', '【Professional Nude Eyeshadow Palette for Glamorous Looks】: Ultimate shadow palette offers 25 captivating shades.', 4.462, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z473CE590F2B1CAEB3195Z/45/_/1772726682/6ed01a46-5053-4cd0-943b-8230f49a2f06.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z473CE590F2B1CAEB3195Z/45/_/1772726676/b5d7e389-e67f-4d70-9697-44a11ebe8c85.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z473CE590F2B1CAEB3195Z/45/_/1772726679/c7b49332-f000-4e30-88e3-11b43e655c37.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z473CE590F2B1CAEB3195Z/45/_/1772726679/f30c1bf3-46bd-4a4e-87db-470b20a2e124.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'eyes'), (sel