  ('BEAUTY BAY Bright Matte 42 Colour Palette Original', 'beauty-bay-bright-matte-42-colour-palette-original', 'Unleash your creativity with the BEAUTY BAY Bright Matte 42 Colour Palette , a professional palette featuring 42 bright matte shades inspired by the full colour spectrum. Each shade delivers intense pigment and long-lasting performance, allowing you to create endless bold or soft looks. The smooth, blendable formula ensures easy application for both beginners and professionals. From pinks and oranges to greens, blues, and purples, this palette offers a full range of vibrant colours for versatile makeup looks. ✨ 42 bright matte shades ✨ High pigment payoff ✨ Smooth and blendable texture How to use: Apply using a brush or fingertips and blend to achieve your desired look, from soft everyday makeup to bold creative styles.', 'Unleash your creativity with the BEAUTY BAY Bright Matte 42 Colour Palette , a professional palette featuring 42 bright matte shades inspire…', 19.1, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZB995A986B578CD5240E3Z/45/_/1779621367/3cdb1fe3-8d90-4f8f-a70f-d7cb880ea12b.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZB995A986B578CD5240E3Z/45/_/1779621387/6114743e-7f5f-43d5-ad57-b27b5df7f75e.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZB995A986B578CD5240E3Z/45/_/1779621387/a7dd188d-0d4e-40f1-a8ec-dea69687d388.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZB995A986B578CD5240E3Z/45/_/1779621387/0b677b34-1122-4e5d-8bc8-d92be5498c5a.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'eyes'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'beauty-bay'), 5, 1, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'eyes', 'eye', 'shadow']::text[]),
