astel'), 4.1, 69, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('Unlimited Double Touch Liquid Lip Colour 103 Natural Rose', 'unlimited-double-touch-liquid-lip-colour-103-natural-rose', 'Long-lasting two-step liquid lipstick: an extraordinary combination of base colours and lip gloss with an intense and radiant finish. The colour is set onto the lips for a result that lasts up to 12 hours*. Base colour: the formula, enriched with a combination of film-like polymers, ensures maximum comfort, optimum adherence to the lips and even colour. Smudge proof, with a very quick drying time. Lip gloss: the softening action formula gives the lips a bright and radiant finish. Even and smooth-gliding application. The packaging comes with two applicators suited to different textures: the flocked base colour applicator ensures high precision coverage, while the fibre lip gloss applicator guarantees that the right amount of product is used. The design is functional, elegant and easily distinguishable thanks to the KK monogram positioned in the centre of the metal grip.', 'Long-lasting two-step liquid lipstick: an extraordinary combination of base colours and lip gloss with an intense and radiant finish.', 4.733, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N46554630A/45/_/1764236037/55bf581c-212a-40c1-b0ab-400308cee994.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N46554630A/45/_/1764236038/2dac226d-bee3-487a-9191-1d97747525ec.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N46554630A/45/_/1764236043/381a5926-0f50-499a-843f-2a63e920e8b1.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N46554630A/45/_/1764236040/61ce591d-c9b6-47e8-b896-21bd07f09024.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'kiko-milano'), 3.7, 11334, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('Super Stay Vinyl Ink Longwear Transfer Proof Liquid Matte Lipstick 35 Cheeky', 'super-stay-vinyl-ink-longwear-transfer-proof-liquid-matte-lipstick-35', 'Meet SuperStay Vinyl Ink liquid lipstick for no budge vinyl color that wears for up to 16 hours! This longwear lipstick’s Color Lock vegan* formula defies smudging and transfer and provides an instant shine finish. Available in 7 vinyl shades. *No animal derived ingredients or by-products', 'Meet SuperStay Vinyl Ink liquid lipstick for no budge vinyl color that wears for up to 16 hours! This longwear lipstick’s Color Lock vegan*…', 3.964, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE1904C2A93B9AE1B7DB9Z/45/1765448746/36db8c16-092e-4b00-b0cc-803a5a2957e5.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE1904C2A93B9AE1B7DB9Z/45/1752569268/5a48e196-8abb-4200-8031-e26867761d0c.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE1904C2A93B9AE1B7DB9Z/45/1752569268/e337043b-dcbe-4400-bddf-10266d57f713.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE1904C2A93B9AE1B7DB9Z/45/1752569269/d18f6514-9cd2-4455-9eac-f1488241db0d.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'maybelline-new-york'), 4.4, 6510, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('Luxury Matte Lipstick Set with Professional Lip Liners – 6 Long-Lasting Velvet Shades + 3 Precision Lip Pencils', 'luxury-matte-lipstick-set-with-professional-lip-liners-6-long-lasting', 'Enhance your beauty with this premium lip makeup set, designed to deliver the perfect combination of elegance, comfort, and long-lasting wear. The set includes 6 stunning matte lipstick shades carefully selected to complement every skin tone and occasion, along with 3 professional lip liner pencils for precise definition and a fuller-looking lip appearance. Its smooth, lightweight formula glides effortlessly onto the lips, providing rich color payoff with a soft velvet finish that stays beautiful for hours without feeling heavy or dry. Key Features Includes 6 trendy matte lipstick shades Comes with 3 matching lip liner pencils Long-lasting wear for all-day confidence Soft velvet texture for a smooth finish Rich, highly pigmented colors Easy to apply and comfortable to wear Suitable for daily use and special occasions Elegant packaging, perfect for gifting Package Includes 6 Matte Lipsticks 3 Lip Liner Pencils Premium Storage Case', 'Enhance your beauty with this premium lip makeup set, designed to deliver the perfect combination of elegance, comfort, and long-lasting wea…', 2.45, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z10D6767FF8870BD74975Z/45/_/1780217703/c4809793-7d5d-4d97-83b4-fe5850c11775.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z10D6767FF8870BD74975Z/45/_/1780217817/43813d44-f06d-4cfd-ac38-4191677e8058.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z10D6767FF8870BD74975Z/45/_/1780217947/1990a023-6284-4bbc-bd5e-b1a752960f0e.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z10D6767FF8870BD74975Z/45/_/1780218049/aaf32ab5-0f6e-40b6-80ab-138dc62d5ce2.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'boland-laura'), 4.2, 32, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('6-Piece Up To 24H Matte & Intense Lipstick Multicolour', '6-piece-up-to-24h-matte-intense-lipstick-multicolour', 'Online shopping for ROSE BERRY. Trusted Shipping to Riyadh, Jeddah and all KSA ✓ Great Prices ✓ Secure Shopping ✓ 100% Contactless ✓ Easy Free Returns ✓ Cash on Delivery. Shop Now', 'Online shopping for ROSE BERRY. Trusted Shipping to Riyadh, Jeddah and all KSA ✓ Great Prices ✓ Secure Shopping ✓ 100% Contactless ✓ Easy Fr…', 1.977, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/v1648299004/N52979512A_1.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/v1648025835/N52979512A_2.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/v1648025835/N52979512A_3.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'rose-berry'), 4.1, 1081, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('Rouge Velvet The Lipstick 2.4 g 13 Nohalicious', 'rouge-velvet-the-lipstick-2-4-g-13-nohalicious', 'About the product: Looking to wow with a bold matte lipstick that won&rsquo;t smudge? Meet Bourjois Rouge Velvet The Lipstick, a gorgeous long-wearing lipstick that will never dry out lips! The secret of its exclusive formula is the moisturising complex that combines hydrating waxes with light oils and rich pigments for an irresistible velvety soft finish that pops. When you want a precise lipstick with intense matte colour that lasts long and feels light, just one swipe of Rouge Velvet The Lipstick will give your lips up to 24 hours of full-on glamour. For intense colour in one stroke with a precise and flawless finish, Rouge Edition Velvet The Lipstick is an essential addition to your make-up collection! About the brand: Ready to play with make-up? In Paris, beauty is a game, never a chore. Bourjois makes it easy to create chic looks for eyes, lips, face and nails, all with an effortless Parisian twist. Say Bonjour to beauty with &ldquo;joie de vivre&rdquo;! Ingredients: Isododecane, C9-12 Alkane, Polyethylene, Bis-Carboxydecyl Dimethicone, Phenyl Trimethicone, Ozokerite, Cococaprylate/Caprate, Hdi/Trimethylol Hexyllactone Crosspolymer, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Quaternium-90 Sepiolite, Phenoxyethanol, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Caprylyl Glycol, Undecylenic Acid, Quaternium-90 Montmorillonite, Silica, Parfum/Fragrance, Linalool, Hydroxycitronellal, Hexyl Cinnamal, Bht, May Contain/Peut Contenir/+/-: Mica, D&C Red No. 7 Calcium Lake (Ci 15850), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492, Ci 77499), Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), D&C Red No. 6 Barium Lake (Ci 15850), Fd&C Yellow No. 5 Aluminum Lake (Ci 19140), Fd&C Yellow No. 6 Aluminum Lake (Ci 15985),Fd&C Blue No. 1 Aluminum Lake (Ci 42090). How to use: 1. Apply colour to the centre of the upper and lower lip. 2. Apply colour working from the outer corners to the centre of the upper and lower lip. 3. Optionally, for a finishing touch and more shine, you may apply a lip gloss on top of the lipstick.', 'Looking to wow with a bold matte lipstick that won&rsquo;t smudge? Meet Bourjois Rouge Velvet The Lipstick, a gorgeous long-wearing lipstick…', 4.837, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/v1683102932/N23287333A_1.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/v1683102932/N23287333A_2.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/v1683102932/N23287333A_3.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/v1683102932/N23287333A_4.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'bourjois-paris'), 4.3, 2098, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
