and more shine, you may apply a lip gloss on top of the lipstick.', 'Looking to wow with a bold matte lipstick that won&rsquo;t smudge? Meet Bourjois Rouge Velvet The Lipstick, a gorgeous long-wearing lipstick…', 5.299, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/v1682155182/N23287336A_1.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/v1682155182/N23287336A_2.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/v1682155182/N23287336A_3.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/v1682155182/N23287336A_4.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'bourjois-paris'), 4.3, 2098, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('Super Stay Teddy Tint Plushwear And Transferproof 55 Kneehigh', 'super-stay-teddy-tint-plushwear-and-transferproof-55-kneehigh', 'Teddy. Set. Go. With NEW Super Stay Teddy Tint Plushwear and Transferproof, Maybelline New York’s teddy-soft lip tint that stays. Super Stay Teddy Tint Plushwear and Transferproof delivers up to 12 hours of long-lasting blurred matte lip color. 97% agree this lip tint leaves behind a beautiful, smooth blurring matte effect. This makeup tints lips for a flush of matte color that lasts all day, no transfer. • Experience the comfortable, plush light feel of this lip tint that glides on with ease. • Teddy Tint has tinted pigments for a 12-hour flush of blurred matte color. This soft makeup is transfer-resistant, smudge-proof, kiss-proof, and waterproof. • Teddy fluff technology marshmallow bouncy elastomer tints your lips in teddy-soft blurred matte for a plush, light feel that lasts all day. • Color hugging flexi film: 12-hour longwear that fits and moves with lips. • Teddy Tint has a teddy-soft creamy texture that glides smoothly onto lips for a lightweight wear that lasts all day. • Create the look you want, 4 ways to wear: whether its blurred, bold, gradient or use on cheek. How to use: Teddy: Tint your lips with Teddy. Set: Let tint fully dry for 10 to 15 minutes for best effect. Go! • Teddy Tint with tinted pigments comes in 5 buildable and blendable shades so you can wear it blurred or wear it bold on lips. Ingredients: DIMETHICONE, TRIMETHYLSILOXYSILICATE, NYLON611/DIMETHICONE COPOLYMER, ISODODECANE, DIMETHICONE CROSSPOLYMER, C3045 ALKYLDIMETHYLSILYL POLYPROPYLSILSESQUIOXANE, LAUROYL LYSINE, SILICA SILYLATE, PHENOXYETHANOL, SORBIC ACID, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, DISODIUM STEAROYL GLUTAMATE, ALUMINUM HYDROXIDE, LINALOOL, SILICA, ALPHAISOMETHYL IONONE, TOCOPHEROL, PARFUM / FRAGRANCE, [+/ MAY CONTAIN MICA, CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499 / IRON OXIDES, CI 45410 / RED 28 LAKE, CI 77891 / TITANIUM DIOXIDE, CI 15850 / RED 7, CI 15985 / YELLOW 6 