  ('Super Stay Teddy Tint Plushwear And Transferproof 15 Skinnydip', 'super-stay-teddy-tint-plushwear-and-transferproof-15-skinnydip', 'Teddy. Set. Go. With NEW Super Stay Teddy Tint Plushwear and Transferproof, Maybelline New York’s teddy-soft lip tint that stays. Super Stay Teddy Tint Plushwear and Transferproof delivers up to 12 hours of long-lasting blurred matte lip color. 97% agree this lip tint leaves behind a beautiful, smooth blurring matte effect. This makeup tints lips for a flush of matte color that lasts all day, no transfer. • Experience the comfortable, plush light feel of this lip tint that glides on with ease. • Teddy Tint has tinted pigments for a 12-hour flush of blurred matte color. This soft makeup is transfer-resistant, smudge-proof, kiss-proof, and waterproof. • Teddy fluff technology marshmallow bouncy elastomer tints your lips in teddy-soft blurred matte for a plush, light feel that lasts all day. • Color hugging flexi film: 12-hour longwear that fits and moves with lips. • Teddy Tint has a teddy-soft creamy texture that glides smoothly onto lips for a lightweight wear that lasts all day. • Create the look you want, 4 ways to wear: whether its blurred, bold, gradient or use on cheek. How to use: Teddy: Tint your lips with Teddy. Set: Let tint fully dry for 10 to 15 minutes for best effect. Go! • Teddy Tint with tinted pigments comes in 5 buildable and blendable shades so you can wear it blurred or wear it bold on lips. Ingredients: DIMETHICONE, TRIMETHYLSILOXYSILICATE, NYLON611/DIMETHICONE COPOLYMER, ISODODECANE, DIMETHICONE CROSSPOLYMER, C3045 ALKYLDIMETHYLSILYL POLYPROPYLSILSESQUIOXANE, LAUROYL LYSINE, SILICA SILYLATE, PHENOXYETHANOL, SORBIC ACID, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, DISODIUM STEAROYL GLUTAMATE, ALUMINUM HYDROXIDE, LINALOOL, SILICA, ALPHAISOMETHYL IONONE, TOCOPHEROL, PARFUM / FRAGRANCE, [+/ MAY CONTAIN MICA, CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499 / IRON OXIDES, CI 45410 / RED 28 LAKE, CI 77891 / TITANIUM DIOXIDE, CI 15850 / RED 7, CI 15985 / YELLOW 6 LAKE, CI 45380 / RED 22 LAKE, CI 19140 / YELLOW 5 LAKE, CI 42090 / BLUE 1 LAKE]', 'Teddy. Set. Go. With NEW Super Stay Teddy Tint Plushwear and Transferproof, Maybelline New York’s teddy-soft lip tint that stays.', 2.598, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE981D99C38E105FF98B9Z/45/_/1775709342/496a3ecf-ee0b-488a-bf77-bc417ec2fbd4.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE981D99C38E105FF98B9Z/45/_/1775709343/c17d884c-71b7-4e71-a654-9dc8352c5f64.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE981D99C38E105FF98B9Z/45/_/1775709343/1f08685b-4e00-46db-95d5-c51f34a7c612.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE981D99C38E105FF98B9Z/45/_/1775709343/9e118a1f-3fa9-42b3-929e-a5956a08bc1c.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'maybelline-new-york'), 4.3, 1215, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('Longstay Liquid Matte Lipstick 18 Red', 'longstay-liquid-matte-lipstick-18-red', 'About the product: Perfect Long lasting, full-coverage and non-transfer liquid matte lipstick, lasts for hours on the lips weightless and without the feeling of dryness. Enriched with Vitamin E and Avocado Oil to leave your lips soft, supple and without sticky feeling. About the brand: Golden Rose Cosmetics Pakistan''s is solely owned by Lahore Marketing Network all rights reserved, Lahore Marketing is the legal, certified holder of Golden Rose cosmetics in Pakistan. The latter is one of the most important corporations of the cosmetics sector with the principles of high-quality manufacturing and reasonable prices since its foundation in 1983. Golden Rose is one of the leading companies in the sector with its 19 years of experience; produces colour cosmetics products as foundation cream, compact powder blush, eye shadow, mascara, lipstick, lipgloss and nail lacquer with a %100 Turkish capital. How to use: 1. Easly coats your lips with its creamy, smooth texture and flexible applicator 2. After application keep the lips apart for a few minutes until it sets 3. Easy removal with Two-Phase Make up Remover.', 'Perfect Long lasting, full-coverage and non-transfer liquid matte lipstick, lasts for hours on the lips weightless and without the feeling o…', 1.9, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N13711653A/45/_/1767608074/f298e832-10d7-4227-b4b4-4569d609ecfb.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N13711653A/45/_/1764242359/dcd40432-08a2-4deb-9b9d-69ea5cf5ee50.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N13711653A/45/_/1764242360/a13041bf-e637-4c06-8a74-ac69437c89c9.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'golden-rose'), 4.4, 1781, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('3 Piece Nude Matte Lipstick Set - Velvet Smooth & Moisturizing Long Lasting Lip Crayon, Waterproof Lip Gloss for Women, Natural Nude Lip Stain Makeup', '3-piece-nude-matte-lipstick-set-velvet-smooth-moisturizing-long-lastin', '【3-Piece Nude Matte Lipstick Set】This 3-piece nude matte lipstick set features a versatile range of natural shades, perfect for everyday wear or special occasions. The creamy, velvety texture glides on smoothly for a comfortable, lightweight feel. Ideal for women who love effortless, long-lasting color.. 【Smooth & Moisturizing Formula】Our matte lip crayons are enriched with a moisturizing formula that prevents dryness, leaving lips soft and supple. The lightweight texture ensures a non-sticky, non-caking finish while delivering rich, buildable color with a velvety matte look.. 【Long-Lasting & Waterproof】Designed with a smudge-resistant and waterproof formula, these lipsticks stay vibrant for hours without fading. Whether you''re eating, drinking, or on the go, your lip color remains fresh and flawless.. 【Highly Pigmented & Easy to Apply】The ultra-pigmented crayon tip allows for precise, one-stroke application. The smooth, blendable formula ensures even coverage, giving you a bold yet natural-looking matte finish in seconds.. 【Perfect Gift for Any Occasion】Elegantly packaged, this nude lipstick set makes a great gift for birthdays, holidays, or special events. Compact and travel-friendly, it’s for makeup lovers who appreciate high-quality, wearable shades.', '【3-Piece Nude Matte Lipstick Set】This 3-piece nude matte lipstick set features a versatile range of natural shades, perfect for everyday wea…', 2.995, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z5DAEAB63A6E0F87B0FD8Z/45/1748099952/4642c466-241b-4e2b-ae4d-83a88c491ad7.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z5DAEAB63A6E0F87B0FD8Z/45/1748099967/1f221c7b-dbcb-4604-a8b5-4f61eabc4668.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z5DAEAB63A6E0F87B0FD8Z/45/1748099980/6cd3a81d-1e8e-