  ('Super Stay Vinyl Ink 16h Longwear Transfer Proof Smudge Proof Instant Shine Finish Liquid Lipstick - 15 Peachy', 'super-stay-vinyl-ink-16h-longwear-transfer-proof-smudge-proof-instant', 'Meet SuperStay Vinyl Ink liquid lipstick for no budge vinyl color that wears for up to 16 hours! This longwear lipstick’s Color Lock vegan* formula defies smudging and transfer and provides an instant shine finish. Available in 7 vinyl shades. *No animal derived ingredients or by-products', 'Meet SuperStay Vinyl Ink liquid lipstick for no budge vinyl color that wears for up to 16 hours! This longwear lipstick’s Color Lock vegan*…', 3.964, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z7A0E329BE08893DF90B1Z/45/1752569400/c4deec4f-3635-4c68-9181-06f0b0fff101.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z7A0E329BE08893DF90B1Z/45/1752569400/d31eb5de-8bec-4362-a39d-9a465022cd97.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z7A0E329BE08893DF90B1Z/45/1752569400/f69b0b36-5d7a-49c0-961d-b40631e5d7cd.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z7A0E329BE08893DF90B1Z/45/1752569404/730ab2ba-822e-4b75-9381-db8065fe4e5c.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'maybelline-new-york'), 4.4, 6510, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('Sheer Up Semi-Transparent Shiny Lipstick 013 Gaia', 'sheer-up-semi-transparent-shiny-lipstick-013-gaia', 'Helps maintain moisture balance while coloring the lips with a shiny finish. Gives a shiny appearance and color to the lips while also providing strong moisture support. Moisturizing lipstick spreads easily on the lips with its thin structure and does not settle into lip lines', 'Helps maintain moisture balance while coloring the lips with a shiny finish.', 3.094, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZB10D704A82EEEE19A002Z/45/_/1779873444/48c90134-4c7b-443a-9c7a-54b4de3b2181.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZB10D704A82EEEE19A002Z/45/_/1779873444/3a5e8b66-f6d8-4766-b042-f2ec0d317e27.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'flormar'), 4.6, 176, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('Nude lipstick - 4.3 grams', 'nude-lipstick-4-3-grams-z12a68', 'Pastel Nude Lipstick provides the elegance of natural colors to the lips with its fine, light, and creamy textured formula. It is specially designed for those seeking a charming and subtle look that highlights the natural beauty of the lips. Features and Benefits : Light Creamy Texture: Features a soft and fine formula that provides a comfortable feel without any heaviness. Moisturizing Effect: Effectively hydrates the lips, making it ideal for comfortable, long-lasting daily wear. Rich Coverage: Delivers clear, vivid color and high coverage in just a single stroke. Easy Application: Glides on seamlessly to ensure smooth and even color distribution. Vegan Formula: Contains no animal-derived ingredients. Tested & Certified: Dermatologically Tested to ensure skin safety. Cruelty-Free and Halal Certified. How to Use: Application: Apply the product starting from the center of the upper lip toward the outer edges, then repeat for the lower lip. Pro Tip: For a more precise and professional finish, use a lip liner to define the edges of your lips before applying the lipstick. Shine with a natural look and soft, moisturized lips using Pastel’s charming "Nude" color collection.', 'Pastel Nude Lipstick provides the elegance of natural colors to the lips with its fine, light, and creamy textured formula.', 2.76, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z12A6855C9E92A7509DDDZ/45/1767194575/91f408f3-9ba2-471d-a349-798e3070fb89.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'pastel'), 4.1, 69, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('WakeUp Make Up MATTE LIPSTICK', 'wakeup-make-up-matte-lipstick', '"Creamy matte-finish lipstick. Matte lipstick gives your lips a matte, full and intense color from the first application, thanks to its all-enveloping, fluid texture. The formula, enriched with grape seed oil, is ideal for giving your lips a long-lasting feeling of comfort. The pigment release is instant and intense, for a smooth, uniform, and even application. - Available in 8 shades - Dermatologically tested - Made in Italy"', '"Creamy matte-finish lipstick. Matte lipstick gives your lips a matte, full and intense color from the first application, thanks to its all-…', 1.9, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z021A2BD12EC04332F39DZ/45/_/1651905726/0d288762-2f87-4bdb-bb8a-45acd9c31f12.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z021A2BD12EC04332F39DZ/45/_/1651905726/b1eef085-48ab-47e0-a58b-584bdb9d6e6e.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z021A2BD12EC04332F39DZ/45/_/1651905726/5738b4da-9fa5-4ce3-a389-32a32bf8d3ee.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'wakeup-cosmetics-milano'), 4.7, 15, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('Charlotte Tilbury Matte Revolution Lipstick Pillow Talk Original- Long Lasting, Matte Lipstick With Buildable Color & Lip-Loving Ingredients - Creamy, Easy To Blend Formula - Walk Of No Shame', 'charlotte-tilbury-matte-revolution-lipstick-pillow-talk-original-long', '【Matte Nude Lipstick】Matte nude lipsticks range from classic nudes to vibrant reds, apply like a velvety silky smooth, richly pigmented, one swipe to present a full color lip makeup, giving your lips a more glamorous look.. 【Rich Color】Lipsticks are rich in color, highly pigmented, with a premium matte texture to create a delicate matte finish and a variety of styles of makeup free to control, giving your lips a beautiful, mysterious and fearless appeal.. 【Long Lasting Waterproof】Lipstick is made of natural formula, gentle to use, with moisturizing effect, non-drying, non-fading, non-sticky cup, long-lasting waterproof, different shades of lipstick,to meet a variety of makeup needs.. 【Glamorous Out】Matte lipstick is suitable for various occasions, such as: daily makeup, office, shopping, music festivals, birthday parties etc. Delicate and elegant lipsticks can also be given as holiday gifts to friends and family around you.. 【Exquisite Appearance】Beautiful and exquisite crystal clear tube design, nude matte lipstick, small and exquisite, easy to carry, so you always have a delicate lip makeup.', '【Matte Nude Lipstick】Matte nude lipsticks range from classic nudes to vibrant reds, apply like a velvety silky smooth, richly pigmented, one…', 12.513, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z1B35F4084265079A1DDAZ/45/1767392314/890a8b23-4c6d-43ea-9874-932ac18e3ae9.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z1B35F4084265079A1DDAZ/45/1767392320/e6386b57-c80b-4c3c-a92d-014c8b6d4c27.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z1B35F4084265079A1DDAZ/45/1767392325/a2062fbf-b363-4a7c-9a4b-42dae0652847.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z1B35F4084265079A1DDAZ/45/1767392325/7fbe4e2a-dfd9-4d