  ('LIP GLOSS &LIQUID LIPSTICK &MAGIC LIPSTICK', 'lip-gloss-liquid-lipstick-magic-lipstick', 'Long-lasting two-step liquid lipstick: an extraordinary combination of base colours and lip gloss with an intense and radiant finish. The colour is set onto the lips for a result that lasts up to 12 hours. Smudge proof, with a very quick drying time. The softening action formula gives the lips a bright and radiant finish', 'Long-lasting two-step liquid lipstick: an extraordinary combination of base colours and lip gloss with an intense and radiant finish.', 2.995, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z14B3D46A9642E0AE03F4Z/45/_/1781378291/0524958e-1d9d-4864-8391-0509e4a29982.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'maydream'), 4.5, 99, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('Super Stay Teddy Tint Plushwear And Transferproof 10 Current Mood', 'super-stay-teddy-tint-plushwear-and-transferproof-10-current-mood', 'Teddy. Set. Go. With NEW Super Stay Teddy Tint Plushwear and Transferproof, Maybelline New York’s teddy-soft lip tint that stays. Super Stay Teddy Tint Plushwear and Transferproof delivers up to 12 hours of long-lasting blurred matte lip color. 97% agree this lip tint leaves behind a beautiful, smooth blurring matte effect. This makeup tints lips for a flush of matte color that lasts all day, no transfer. • Experience the comfortable, plush light feel of this lip tint that glides on with ease. • Teddy Tint has tinted pigments for a 12-hour flush of blurred matte color. This soft makeup is transfer-resistant, smudge-proof, kiss-proof, and waterproof. • Teddy fluff technology marshmallow bouncy elastomer tints your lips in teddy-soft blurred matte for a plush, light feel that lasts all day. • Color hugging flexi film: 12-hour longwear that fits and moves with lips. • Teddy Tint has a teddy-soft creamy texture that glides smoothly onto lips for a lightweight wear that lasts all day. • Create the look you want, 4 ways to wear: whether its blurred, bold, gradient or use on cheek. How to use: Teddy: Tint your lips with Teddy. Set: Let tint fully dry for 10 to 15 minutes for best effect. Go! • Teddy Tint with tinted pigments comes in 5 buildable and blendable shades so you can wear it blurred or wear it bold on lips. Ingredients: DIMETHICONE, TRIMETHYLSILOXYSILICATE, NYLON611/DIMETHICONE COPOLYMER, ISODODECANE, DIMETHICONE CROSSPOLYMER, C3045 ALKYLDIMETHYLSILYL POLYPROPYLSILSESQUIOXANE, LAUROYL LYSINE, SILICA SILYLATE, PHENOXYETHANOL, SORBIC ACID, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, DISODIUM STEAROYL GLUTAMATE, ALUMINUM HYDROXIDE, LINALOOL, SILICA, ALPHAISOMETHYL IONONE, TOCOPHEROL, PARFUM / FRAGRANCE, [+/ MAY CONTAIN MICA, CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499 / IRON OXIDES, CI 45410 / RED 28 LAKE, CI 77891 / TITANIUM DIOXIDE, CI 15850 / RED 7, CI 15985 / YELLOW 6 LAKE, CI 45380 / RED 22 LAKE, CI 19140 / YELLOW 5 LAKE, CI 42090 / BLUE 1 LAKE]', 'Teddy. Set. Go. With NEW Super Stay Teddy Tint Plushwear and Transferproof, Maybelline New York’s teddy-soft lip tint that stays.', 2.75, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE15C714A71F1BDAEF8DEZ/45/_/1775709337/475f555d-3cd6-43d3-81ca-c7f5784047cb.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE15C714A71F1BDAEF8DEZ/45/_/1775709337/1d660b45-732f-4096-a74e-21cba926f138.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE15C714A71F1BDAEF8DEZ/45/_/1775709337/5f244154-e34d-4ed9-ac51-e7dd750a6059.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE15C714A71F1BDAEF8DEZ/45/_/1775709337/5e200f2d-427f-4a20-8f28-6c43f48c5c0c.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'maybelline-new-york'), 0, 0, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('10Pcs Matte Liquid Lipstick Set Contains Smooth Lip Lacquer for Women', '10pcs-matte-liquid-lipstick-set-contains-smooth-lip-lacquer-for-women', 'Features: Elegant charming Full-size tubes, non-stick cup. Easy to remove with lip cleansing products. With portable fashion packaging, travel-friendly. With richly-nourishing honey-contained lip plumper to moisture and spice up the lip look.', 'Features: Elegant charming Full-size tubes, non-stick cup. Easy to remove with lip cleansing products.', 4, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z7550F86FEDBB9B8DB6B2Z/45/1747036131/6014d97d-c0d8-493f-a47d-67bdc44ebf7c.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z7550F86FEDBB9B8DB6B2Z/45/1747036131/d20e8963-0647-472e-bae0-685f041389e7.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z7550F86FEDBB9B8DB6B2Z/45/1747036131/50236409-bed4-4497-8fad-d48a63377a2e.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z7550F86FEDBB9B8DB6B2Z/45/1747036131/7c27deaa-7afa-4fdb-9614-b48e0f0ff156.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'cakaila'), 3.9, 21, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('New Sheer Up Lipstick - 13 Gaia', 'new-sheer-up-lipstick-13-gaia', 'A lipstick with special texture enriched with oils to smooth your lips and offer a glossy, colorful finish.', 'A lipstick with special texture enriched with oils to smooth your lips and offer a glossy, colorful finish.', 3.131, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z7B81F569861BB5FBBEA2Z/45/_/1779873467/e6a46584-b7cd-4530-b401-1fec8ae2bc62.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z7B81F569861BB5FBBEA2Z/45/_/1779873467/4f2a92d2-1521-4ed2-8baf-ad6835ee0113.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z7B81F569861BB5FBBEA2Z/45/_/1779873467/e9f11c1f-6ddb-4640-af0c-2fd5468528e6.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z7B81F569861BB5FBBEA2Z/45/_/1779873467/7a9819e5-de61-4852-9989-9fcdcc4b471d.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'flormar'), 4.5, 255, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('3 Piece Nude Matte Lipstick Set - Velvet Smooth & Moisturizing Long Lasting Lip Crayon, Waterproof Lip Gloss for Women, Natural Nude Lip Stain Makeup', '3-piece-nude-matte-lipstick-set-velvet-smooth-moisturizing-long-lastin-za55b2', '【3-Piece Nude Matte Lipstick Set】This 3-piece nude matte lipstick set features a versatile range of natural shades, perfect for everyday wear or special occasions. The creamy, velvety texture glides on smoothly for a comfortable, lightweight feel. Ideal for women who love effortless, long-lasting color.. 【Smooth & Moisturizing Formula】Our matte lip crayons are enriched with a moisturizing formula that prevents dryness, leaving lips soft and supple. The lightweight texture ensures a non-sticky, non-caking finish while delivering rich, buildable color with a velvety matte look.. 【Long-Lasting & Waterproof】Designed with a smudge-resistant and waterproof formula, these lipsticks stay vibrant for hours without fading. Whether you''re eating, drinking, or on the go, your lip color remains fresh and flawless.. 【Highly Pigmented & Easy to Apply】The ultra-pigmented crayon tip allows for precise, one-stroke application. The smooth, blendable formula ensures even coverage, giving you a bold yet natural-looking matte finish in seconds.. 【Perfect Gift for Any Occasion】Elegantly packaged, this nude lipstick set makes a great gift for birthdays, holidays, or special events. Compact and travel-friendly, it’s for makeup lovers who appreciate high-quality, wearable shades.', '【3-Piece Nude Matte Lipstick Set】This 3-piece nude matte lipstick set features a versatile range of natural shades, perfect for everyday wea…', 2.89, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZA55B2E5F3041D8ED7EEEZ/45/1767864662/34c569ba-51e5-4708-8604-ca61674ef026.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZA55B2E5F3041D8ED7EEEZ/45/1767864662/603848d1-bfb7-4e63-a3bb-8bf7811d3bb2.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZA55B2E5F3041D8ED7EEEZ/45/1767864662/668de61f-c1f5-4b59-88b5-3fe78fa3430e.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZA55B2E5F3041D8ED7EEEZ/45/1767864662/d11de86c-ec41-424b-9f04-e8a82024d6d5.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'dragon-ranee'), 4.3, 5, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('Sheer Up Lipstick 012 Intense Love', 'sheer-up-lipstick-012-intense-love', 'If your lips are frequently dry and flaky, you might not be getting the results you''re looking for with the lipsticks you apply. It''s normal to need a lipstick that both moisturizes and adds color to your lips. Flormar has the answer to that! Flormar Sheer Up Semi-Sheer & Shiny Finish Moisturizing Lipstick gives lips a glossy look and color while also providing a powerful moisturizing boost. In short, Flormar Sheer Up shiny lipstick offers both the benefits you''re looking for in one go! Flormar Sheer Up Semi-Transparent & Shiny Finish Moisturizing Lipstick spreads easily onto lips with its thin texture and doesn''t settle into lip lines. This Flormar moisturizing lipstick, with its soft and creamy texture, offers easy application and doesn''t feel heavy on the lips thanks to its lightweight texture. Its semi-transparent texture gives lips a natural yet shinier and more striking look. To moisturize dry lips and boldly highlight them in your makeup routine, you''ll never want to leave Flormar Sheer Up Moisturizing Lipstick without your hand! What is Flormar Sheer Up Semi-Transparent & Shiny Finish Moisturizing Lipstick? Flormar Sheer Up Semi-Transparent & Shiny Finish Moisturizing Lipstick is a stick lipstick that adds shine and moisturizes lips. It has a creamy, soft texture and a glossy finish, providing medium coverage. It''s enriched with natural oils and extracts that have a softening and nourishing effect. What is the use of Flormar Sheer Up Semi-Transparent & Shiny Finish Moisturizing Lipstick? Flormar Sheer Up, a glossy lipstick, highlights lips with its semi-sheer color without creating an artificial look. It also moisturizes lips and helps prevent dryness and cracking. This Flormar semi-sheer lipstick also has a glossy finish, giving lips a more radiant appearance. Flormar Sheer Up glossy stick lipstick, with its thin texture, comfortably hugs the lips and is so lightweight that it''s practically invisible. This makes it ideal for both everyday and special makeup looks. Flormar Sheer Up glossy lipstick is a great choice for moisturizing lips and highlighting them with a natural look, especially in cold and dry weather. This medium-lasting Flormar lipstick is also suitable for special occasions and events like birthdays or proms.', 'If your lips are frequently dry and flaky, you might not be getting the results you''re looking for with the lipsticks you apply.', 2.85, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZFC9FC9F8C495BF136DACZ/45/_/1779873359/5fd531d1-9bff-4f7d-a431-0fcf3cd46609.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'flormar'), 4.6, 45, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('Super Stay Vinyl Ink Longwear Transfer Proof Gloss Lipstick, 40 WITTY', 'super-stay-vinyl-ink-longwear-transfer-proof-gloss-lipstick-40-witty', 'Meet SuperStay Vinyl Ink liquid lipstick for no budge vinyl color that wears for up to 16 hours! This longwear lipstick’s Color Lock vegan* formula defies smudging and transfer and provides an instant shine finish. Available in 7 vinyl shades. *No animal derived ingredients or by-products', 'Meet SuperStay Vinyl Ink liquid lipstick for no budge vinyl color that wears for up to 16 hours! This longwear lipstick’s Color Lock vegan*…', 3.92, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z38EC00BA0BD0074C89A2Z/45/1752569399/aad8038f-7d3a-40d4-a2f4-97bba803c2c3.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z38EC00BA0BD0074C89A2Z/45/1752569398/e252ad70-6b40-4d14-affc-a7b19a2c3001.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z38EC00BA0BD0074C89A2Z/45/1752569399/9c68ece4-8da1-4890-b529-429080fa1de5.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z38EC00BA0BD0074C89A2Z/45/1752569401/d760b6b1-7baa-44a0-a319-bbc099f0c81b.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'maybelline-new-york'), 4.4, 6510, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('Super Stay Vinyl Ink Longwear Transfer Proof Gloss Lipstick, 20 COY', 'super-stay-vinyl-ink-longwear-transfer-proof-gloss-lipstick-20-coy', 'Meet SuperStay Vinyl Ink liquid lipstick for no budge vinyl color that wears for up to 16 hours! This longwear lipstick’s Color Lock vegan* formula defies smudging and transfer and provides an instant shine finish. Available in 7 vinyl shades. *No animal derived ingredients or by-products', 'Meet SuperStay Vinyl Ink liquid lipstick for no budge vinyl color that wears for up to 16 hours! This longwear lipstick’s Color Lock vegan*…', 3.964, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZFB3BA008EAE64C1D3B42Z/45/1752569389/bf2df71f-182c-42b9-b8ec-29ec688d3873.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZFB3BA008EAE64C1D3B42Z/45/1752569390/6f81c35f-ca9c-4534-a7a0-709e68d61db4.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZFB3BA008EAE64C1D3B42Z/45/1752569391/1d65ad9f-1a43-40f0-b126-b7e1c4a6a309.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZFB3BA008EAE64C1D3B42Z/45/1752569391/c5afbdb2-41bf-4ea5-afcd-a12eec551008.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'maybelline-new-york'), 4.4, 6510, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('Long Stay Liquid Matte And Lipliner Lipkit Set Multicolour 1.6g Multicolour', 'long-stay-liquid-matte-and-lipliner-lipkit-set-multicolour-1-6g-multic', 'Consist of Longstay Liquid Matte Lipstick and Dream Lips Lipliner with matching colors Matte Lip Kit has everything you need to create the perfect matte lips', 'Consist of Longstay Liquid Matte Lipstick and Dream Lips Lipliner with matching colors Matte Lip Kit has everything you need to create the p…', 2.518, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N43793523A/45/_/1764242139/8a0356b4-0ff6-4c88-8a87-01a1ce69b873.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N43793523A/45/_/1764242140/265e5ddf-9d55-4b78-8a79-974f8883a6e0.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'golden-rose'), 4.5, 358, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('Maybelline New York Superstay Matte Ink Liquid Lipstick - 70 Amazonian 70 Amazonian', 'maybelline-new-york-superstay-matte-ink-liquid-lipstick-70-amazonian-7', 'Intensely perfect, perfectly intense. Ink your lips in up to 16 hours of saturated matte with Maybelline New York’s Super Stay Matte Ink™ Liquid Lipstick! This highly pigmented liquid matte lipstick features a unique arrow applicator for precise application', 'Intensely perfect, perfectly intense. Ink your lips in up to 16 hours of saturated matte with Maybelline New York’s Super Stay Matte Ink™ Li…', 7.27, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N29782177A/45/_/1764236078/1c6d2be0-5b54-439d-98f4-b6b171b43038.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N29782177A/45/_/1764236057/85fd6ef1-1da0-41fa-9fed-eec6e4800152.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N29782177A/45/_/1764236077/5bcbbdfb-b5b2-4cc9-83b1-86acd8fd2c09.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N29782177A/45/_/1764236076/b0461e55-9baf-46a4-85ec-47fcf3f911be.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'maybelline-new-york'), 4.4, 4300, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('Super Stay Teddy Tint Plushwear And Transferproof 30 Coquettish', 'super-stay-teddy-tint-plushwear-and-transferproof-30-coquettish', 'Teddy. Set. Go. With NEW Super Stay Teddy Tint Plushwear and Transferproof, Maybelline New York’s teddy-soft lip tint that stays. Super Stay Teddy Tint Plushwear and Transferproof delivers up to 12 hours of long-lasting blurred matte lip color. 97% agree this lip tint leaves behind a beautiful, smooth blurring matte effect. This makeup tints lips for a flush of matte color that lasts all day, no transfer. • Experience the comfortable, plush light feel of this lip tint that glides on with ease. • Teddy Tint has tinted pigments for a 12-hour flush of blurred matte color. This soft makeup is transfer-resistant, smudge-proof, kiss-proof, and waterproof. • Teddy fluff technology marshmallow bouncy elastomer tints your lips in teddy-soft blurred matte for a plush, light feel that lasts all day. • Color hugging flexi film: 12-hour longwear that fits and moves with lips. • Teddy Tint has a teddy-soft creamy texture that glides smoothly onto lips for a lightweight wear that lasts all day. • Create the look you want, 4 ways to wear: whether its blurred, bold, gradient or use on cheek. How to use: Teddy: Tint your lips with Teddy. Set: Let tint fully dry for 10 to 15 minutes for best effect. Go! • Teddy Tint with tinted pigments comes in 5 buildable and blendable shades so you can wear it blurred or wear it bold on lips. Ingredients: DIMETHICONE, TRIMETHYLSILOXYSILICATE, NYLON611/DIMETHICONE COPOLYMER, ISODODECANE, DIMETHICONE CROSSPOLYMER, C3045 ALKYLDIMETHYLSILYL POLYPROPYLSILSESQUIOXANE, LAUROYL LYSINE, SILICA SILYLATE, PHENOXYETHANOL, SORBIC ACID, ETHYLHEXYLGLYCERIN, DISODIUM STEAROYL GLUTAMATE, ALUMINUM HYDROXIDE, LINALOOL, SILICA, ALPHAISOMETHYL IONONE, TOCOPHEROL, PARFUM / FRAGRANCE, [+/ MAY CONTAIN MICA, CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499 / IRON OXIDES, CI 45410 / RED 28 LAKE, CI 77891 / TITANIUM DIOXIDE, CI 15850 / RED 7, CI 15985 / YELLOW 6 LAKE, CI 45380 / RED 22 LAKE, CI 19140 / YELLOW 5 LAKE, CI 42090 / BLUE 1 LAKE]', 'Teddy. Set. Go. With NEW Super Stay Teddy Tint Plushwear and Transferproof, Maybelline New York’s teddy-soft lip tint that stays.', 2.75, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z828FFD6F7990C2DD7099Z/45/1765448750/45ca6277-1930-468b-bf14-d1f426215ce2.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z828FFD6F7990C2DD7099Z/45/_/1738219064/8ab44a51-b2ad-4208-aac3-3d8d340c03a4.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z828FFD6F7990C2DD7099Z/45/_/1738219058/93ce58d2-ae2d-40a6-9481-d57f6ac51de2.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z828FFD6F7990C2DD7099Z/45/_/1738219059/90c52f49-a245-4993-a2bb-4f2899cdfb5f.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'maybelline-new-york'), 4.3, 1215, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('Meet Matt(e) Hughes 6 Mini Long-Lasting Liquid Lipsticks Exclusive New Shades', 'meet-matt-e-hughes-6-mini-long-lasting-liquid-lipsticks-exclusive-new', 'theBalm offers women empowering, multi-tasking products that are paraben-free and cruelty-free. The Meet Matt(e) Hughes Mini Kit is a set of six highly-pigmented shades that deliver a lightweight, matte finish and full payoff. Apply using the doe-foot applicator, or with your favorite lip brush, for color that lasts all night.', 'theBalm offers women empowering, multi-tasking products that are paraben-free and cruelty-free.', 4.116, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZB81C1C0C041223A54B7DZ/45/_/1779178939/ea2c1cec-e114-40d8-a8d1-e66907da9cd0.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZB81C1C0C041223A54B7DZ/45/_/1779178939/406b6b5a-9ac0-4e10-94a0-9f750a05a522.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'thebalm'), 4.3, 340, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('Nude lipstick - 4.3 grams', 'nude-lipstick-4-3-grams-zba13e', 'Pastel Nude Lipstick provides the elegance of natural colors to the lips with its fine, light, and creamy textured formula. It is specially designed for those seeking a charming and subtle look that highlights the natural beauty of the lips. Features and Benefits : Light Creamy Texture: Features a soft and fine formula that provides a comfortable feel without any heaviness. Moisturizing Effect: Effectively hydrates the lips, making it ideal for comfortable, long-lasting daily wear. Rich Coverage: Delivers clear, vivid color and high coverage in just a single stroke. Easy Application: Glides on seamlessly to ensure smooth and even color distribution. Vegan Formula: Contains no animal-derived ingredients. Tested & Certified: Dermatologically Tested to ensure skin safety. Cruelty-Free and Halal Certified. How to Use: Application: Apply the product starting from the center of the upper lip toward the outer edges, then repeat for the lower lip. Pro Tip: For a more precise and professional finish, use a lip liner to define the edges of your lips before applying the lipstick. Shine with a natural look and soft, moisturized lips using Pastel’s charming "Nude" color collection.', 'Pastel Nude Lipstick provides the elegance of natural colors to the lips with its fine, light, and creamy textured formula.', 2.97, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBA13EAF60E6520B66CC7Z/45/1767193992/83730439-577c-449e-b9f0-8cbbdd92b591.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBA13EAF60E6520B66CC7Z/45/1767193992/3baf2106-8297-4921-90df-f07bcad503ad.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBA13EAF60E6520B66CC7Z/45/1767193992/2709fb2c-8716-4818-87cf-fddd6205916c.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'lips'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'pastel'), 4.1, 69, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['makeup', 'lips', 'lipstick']::text[]),
  ('345 Relief Cream | Daily Face Moisturizer | Blemish Relief Care | Soothing Recovery & Moisture with Niacinamide, Panthenol | Korean Vegan Skin Care for All Skin Types | 1.69 Fl Oz', '345-relief-cream-daily-face-moisturizer-blemish-relief-care-soothing-r', '3 BLEMISH RELIEF INGREDIENTS: This cream contains a potent blend of Niacinamide and plant extracts to reduce dark spots and blemishes. It also promotes an even skin tone, assisting you in achieving clearer and more radiant skin.. 4 NOURISHING INGREDIENTS : The multi-layered cream structure formulated with Ceramide NP and Hyaluronic acids help restore dull skin while delivering nutrients deeply into the skin to provide continuous care by locking in moisture and nutrients.. 5 SOOTHING INGREDIENTS: Care for sensitive skin and red blemishes caused by external factors with Beta-glucan, Panthenol, and Plant extracts. These calming ingredients can quickly help soothe your skin effectively by providing moisture.. 5 SOOTHING INGREDIENTS: Care for sensitive skin and red blemishes caused by external factors with Beta-glucan, Panthenol, and Plant extracts. These calming ingredients can quickly help soothe your skin effectively by providing moisture.. WHY CHOOSE DR. ALTHEA : Our products are free from artificial coloring, fragrance, and parabens, ensuring it is gentle on the skin. Additionally, it is Vegan-certified to meet ethical and eco-friendly standards.', '3 BLEMISH RELIEF INGREDIENTS: This cream contains a potent blend of Niacinamide and plant extracts to reduce dark spots and blemishes.', 3.77, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z4D0AC109CE1625A51A3EZ/45/1746223784/2c1f8a66-a01b-40c6-8bbf-061c1c434fa9.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z4D0AC109CE1625A51A3EZ/45/1746223784/a18e6184-c566-4d8a-adea-6436dda4cccb.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z4D0AC109CE1625A51A3EZ/45/1746223785/9576bef2-9825-475b-8709-b7eea31e531b.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z4D0AC109CE1625A51A