  ('Vitamin C + Turmeric Body Cream | Anti Aging Skin Care Firming & Brightening Cream Diminishes The Look Of Uneven Skin Tone, Age Spots, & Sun Damaged Dry Skin, 15 Fl Oz', 'vitamin-c-turmeric-body-cream-anti-aging-skin-care-firming-brightening', 'VITAMIN C BODY CREAM – Incorporating this Medix 5.5 Vitamin C body lotion into your daily skincare routine can help to promote a more healthy, radiant, & youthful-looking complexion. Antioxidant rich Vitamin C, help soften the look of dark spots & uneven looking skin.. INGREDIENTS FOR RADIANT LOOKING SKIN– Medix 5.5 Vitamin C Cream Brighten + Firm Body Lotion is formulated with ingredients, including Shea Butter, Aloe Vera, Ferulic Acid, Turmeric, Vitamin E, and Glycerin. Shea Butter helps moisturizes the skin and supports skin hydration. Vitamin E & Aloe Vera helps nourish, calm, & refreshed skin. This blend visibly enhances skin’s radiance & promotes a revitalized appearance.. ILLUMINATED SKIN – This Medix 5.5 Vitamin C Body Cream infused with Turmeric helps soften the look of aging skin and uneven looking skin tone. This rich, velvety formula provides rich hydration, keeping skin visibly smooth, soft, & refreshed without a greasy finish. Skin feels hydrated, nourished and visibly radiant throughout the day. This lightly scented Vitamin C body cream revives the look of uneven skin, the look of dark spots, rough looking skin, crepey skin, wrinkles, & more.. IDEAL FOR SOFTENING THE LOOK OF DARK SPOTS & UNEVEN COMPLEXION – This Non-Greasy Vitamin C Moisturizer is a rich & creamy formula with a velvety smooth finish. Recommended for daily use to revive dull, lackluster skin, improve uneven looking complexion, & hydrate dry, dehydrated areas. NOTE: Medix Vitamin C Cream can fade slightly yellow from white over time due to the Ascorbic Acid. This is natural aging and does not impact the quality of the formula or effectiveness of the ingredients.', 'VITAMIN C BODY CREAM – Incorporating this Medix 5.5 Vitamin C body lotion into your daily skincare routine can help to promote a more health…', 7.5, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZEC4FDC971033DF5939DFZ/45/1767808180/0d7a772c-a7a5-4819-9e82-c39cc0511b0f.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZEC4FDC971033DF5939DFZ/45/1757235837/cdc71656-8cc6-4b74-a61f-9bb42df4e4ef.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZEC4FDC971033DF5939DFZ/45/1757235858/c5c27fc6-6c9c-45ff-8476-2b6b56b832a7.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZEC4FDC971033DF5939DFZ/45/1757235865/f9c968c1-62de-4139-9e9c-a7dbe95a61eb.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'medix-5-5'), 4.4, 51, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Embryolisse Lait Creme Concentre 75ml', 'embryolisse-lait-creme-concentre-75ml', 'Directions: Apply morning and/or evening to clean, dry face.Massage in gently without pressure, and leave on to penetrate.The Concentrated Milk-Cream can also be used to cleanse the skin or remove make-up, as a repairing mask, an after-shave cream, or as a baby care product.', 'Directions: Apply morning and/or evening to clean, dry face.Massage in gently without pressure, and leave on to penetrate.The Concentrated M…', 3.665, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z89D263A3E70E8D1C4F4BZ/45/_/1784023549/4003e6b7-0c96-4a46-ad93-95b31baaec5c.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z89D263A3E70E8D1C4F4BZ/45/_/1740105165/3087e32b-912b-47d5-a93b-20967f5216a2.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z89D263A3E70E8D1C4F4BZ/45/_/1740105166/80158d01-7a36-4950-a9cd-1c3d06911be6.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z89D263A3E70E8D1C4F4BZ/45/_/1740105167/5bff48c7-1653-40d5-bee5-087e16fe37c7.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'embryolisse'), 4.2, 62, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Embryolisse Lait Creme Concentre 75ml', 'embryolisse-lait-creme-concentre-75ml-z499a6', 'INFUSED WITH NATURAL & ECO-FRIENDLY INGREDIENTS: Our exclusive concentrated milk-based face moisturizer cream is infused with natural ingredients such as shea butter & aloe vera, which are extracted from flowers and fruits. It also includes other eco-friendly ingredients like soy proteins and beeswax that help to brighten the skin & decrease redness. ALL-IN-ONE MOISTURIZER: Our natural moisturizing cream for all skin types is a 3 in 1 solution for your face and body. It acts as a make-up base to moisturize and protect; as a beauty mask, BELOVED BY MAKEUP ARTISTS: The Lait-Crème Concentré is unanimously loved by professional makeup artists and models alike because it prepares the skin perfectly for a makeup routine. Our cream nourishes the face and body and moisturizes the skin. It evens and smooths texture, and it unifies and brightens the complexion. BENEFITS ALL SKIN TYPES: All skin types deserve to feel fresh and clean so our gentle facial moisturizing cream is suitable for all skin types from sensitive to oily to dry and even combination skin types. Use this daily moisturizing cream without worrying about your sensitive skin. All Embryolisse products are dermatologically tested.', 'INFUSED WITH NATURAL & ECO-FRIENDLY INGREDIENTS: Our exclusive concentrated milk-based face moisturizer cream is infused with natural ingred…', 3.843, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z499A6517E97FEB9B873FZ/45/1746196711/b7a1ee27-6e33-4202-a9a3-c80b7ee5fa59.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z499A6517E97FEB9B873FZ/45/1746196714/75504bdc-1c9f-4080-89ec-a8166959f773.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z499A6517E97FEB9B873FZ/45/1746196711/e2dfa5e4-4a3e-45e6-ab4c-9122f6fe6a78.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z499A6517E97FEB9B873FZ/45/1746196712/88a9f03b-22db-42c4-9a01-bbd0abdf3893.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'embryolisse'), 4, 137, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Renewal Face Cream 7Day Skin Beauty Regimen Melasma，Freckles Age Spots，Wrinkles Smoother ,Dark Spots Cream, for Melasma and Freckles Treatment for All Skin Types,Anti-wrinkle Face Cream', 'renewal-face-cream-7day-skin-beauty-regimen-melasma-freckles-age-spots', 'Visible results are seen from 1 to 3 weeks of use. Support prevents melasma production, reduces melasma, freckles, age spots, and dark spots. Brightens skin, also tightens pores. Nourish and restore skin from within to help moisturize and make skin smoother. Cleanse skin before applying every night and protect skin from sunlight. Combination of Alpha Arbutin and Kojic Acid, along with many effective ingredients in treating pigmentation', 'Visible results are seen from 1 to 3 weeks of use.', 4.191, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZA867ABFF3B140359BC69Z/45/_/1784519719/1a91432e-6e55-4c68-9550-92bc0c976aeb.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZA867ABFF3B140359BC69Z/45/_/1784527440/aeae2c06-c54e-4c66-820f-43f19d797776.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZA867ABFF3B140359BC69Z/45/_/1784527617/e02ab952-e35c-4d9a-a3eb-b137d25d1876.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZA867ABFF3B140359BC69Z/45/1745048857/d4fc251e-78bc-4e25-be21-2a3a66fc237a.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'laikou'), 4.1, 79, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Sebium Ultra Hydra Compensateur Moisturizing Cream White 40ml', 'sebium-ultra-hydra-compensateur-moisturizing-cream-white-40ml', 'Sebium Hydra counteracts side effects of ultra-drying treatments and provides long lasting skin comfort. This ultra-moisturising care nourishes the skin, soothes and reduces redness thanks to anti-irritant properties. Non-comedogenic. Can be used as make-up base. Packaging disclaimer :- Packaging may vary. Cream is hypo-allergic', 'Sebium Hydra counteracts side effects of ultra-drying treatments and provides long lasting skin comfort.', 4.8, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z8722A0894DF10393EBBDZ/45/_/1779344268/bc131b3c-04a6-4ff1-beb0-ab3074c46774.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z8722A0894DF10393EBBDZ/45/_/1779344269/57b63ad7-2244-4bc1-b493-56f75105f370.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z8722A0894DF10393EBBDZ/45/_/1779344270/cd4513eb-7a7a-4823-a802-55e02e2b8717.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z8722A0894DF10393EBBDZ/45/_/1779344268/ce3566aa-861c-419d-ba4d-5abe3a029dbf.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'bioderma'), 4, 1872, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Original Moisturizing Jelly, 100ml Clear 100ml', 'original-moisturizing-jelly-100ml-clear-100ml', 'Vaseline Jelly is the original skin protectant, it has been used to protect, help heal, and lock in moisture for dry skin since 1870. To this day, it still effectively cares for your skin. Vaseline Petroleum Jelly Original is triple-purified and hypoallergenic, and is the ideal product for a multitude of uses, including being a moisturizer for sensitive skin. Vaseline Petroleum Jelly Original is a product you can trust. Its triple-purification seal guarantees each jar of Vaseline Jelly has been purified not once, but three times to remove impurities. It is dermatologist recommended and has been given the U.S. National Eczema Association Seal of Acceptance as appropriate for use by those with eczema and people with sensitive skin. Vaseline''s white petroleum jelly is fragrance free, hypoallergenic, non-irritating, and non-comedogenic (it won’t clog your pores). Learn about the many Vaseline Petroleum Jelly uses. Petroleum Jelly uses include personal care, baby care, and beauty. By sealing in moisture, it assists the skin’s natural recovery to help dry skin heal. This can rejuvenate visibly dry skin and help reduce the appearance of fine, dry lines. Vaseline Jelly creates a protective barrier that protects skin against environmental factors, such as windburn – and has been used for over 100 years to protect minor cuts, scrapes, and burns. Many of Vaseline’s dry skin lotions contain petroleum jelly, to give your skin the extra care it needs. Explore the range of Vaseline products including Vaseline lotion and enjoy the healing power of Vaseline.', 'Vaseline Jelly is the original skin protectant, it has been used to protect, help heal, and lock in moisture for dry skin since 1870.', 0.65, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N23462122A/45/_/1766380635/8fde2b8b-c340-4c78-9d82-8c6ed5ccbc35.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N23462122A/45/_/1764242084/b07ba2a3-d862-453f-b957-93b09fdeea83.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N23462122A/45/_/1764242084/a7c06556-af9b-47d4-8c5a-28c3cdabdbdd.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N23462122A/45/_/1764242082/07ff92f2-af6b-400f-8987-5bae35a5f2b6.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'vaseline'), 4.5, 1383, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Herbolene Aloe Deep Moisturizing Jelly For Dry And Rough Skin 425+115ml', 'herbolene-aloe-deep-moisturizing-jelly-for-dry-and-rough-skin-425-115m', 'Dabur Herbolene Aloe Petroleum Jelly is a unique herbal-based formula that is fortified with the goodness of aloe vera and is rich in Vitamin E to effectively moisturize extremely dry skin, soothe chapped lips, smoothen knees and elbows, and heal cracked feet. Dabur Herbolene’s natural formula penetrates deep into the skin cells to provide intense nourishment for soft, supple, and hydrated skin. Its regular use nourishes and protects skin from harsh weather conditions and helps heal cuts and cracks. Dabur Herbolene is a safe emollient to use on any part of the body', 'Dabur Herbolene Aloe Petroleum Jelly is a unique herbal-based formula that is fortified with the goodness of aloe vera and is rich in Vitami…', 1.44, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N29811165A/45/_/1711536258/1b23d3b8-2ff0-48af-aa96-fa8c5a051e81.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N29811165A/45/_/1711536259/cb29a6ff-50b7-40a9-99af-b419fc40431d.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N29811165A/45/_/1711536259/9b994f57-042a-43c1-976a-2734adc101cd.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N29811165A/45/_/1711536260/f3027060-9c1f-4aa1-b065-851f93ce9000.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'dabur'), 4.6, 1144, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Petroleum Jelly with Vitamin E -100% Pure - 500+300ml', 'petroleum-jelly-with-vitamin-e-100-pure-500-300ml', 'Experience integrated care and rich hydration with Cosmo 100% Pure Petroleum Jelly with Vitamin E . This effective formula provides your skin with deep nourishment and a healthy, lasting glow. Features and Benefits: Enriched with Vitamin E : Rich in Vitamin E, a powerful antioxidant that helps protect the skin from environmental factors and enhances its healthy, radiant appearance. Intense Hydration and Nourishment : Provides deep moisturizing that reduces dryness and flakiness, giving the skin noticeable softness. Gentle on Sensitive Skin : Free from harsh substances and synthetic fragrances, making it suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin. Lightweight, Non-Greasy Texture : Absorbs quickly without leaving a sticky residue, ensuring a comfortable feeling throughout the day. Effective Protective Barrier : Helps protect and soothe chapped or dry skin and lips, guarding against the effects of wind and cold weather. Multipurpose Use : A practical, versatile product that fits various daily care needs. Uses: Moisturizer for dry and chapped lips. Gentle makeup remover. Softening and hydrating serum for hair ends. Nourishing mask for the face and dry areas of the body. Skin protection against dryness in cold climates. One product that combines hydration, nourishment, and protection for soft, radiant skin. Cosmo Petroleum Jelly with Vitamin E – 500ml + 300ml is your daily choice for comprehensive care.', 'Experience integrated care and rich hydration with Cosmo 100% Pure Petroleum Jelly with Vitamin E .', 1.238, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/5599dadd72bc5283a7d7a41ded6ce9b9|pzsku/Z9E135226A113D21E729DZ/45/1768817298/ebaf6705-9112-45b1-bac7-faefb71cf4b4.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/5599dadd72bc5283a7d7a41ded6ce9b9|pzsku/Z9E135226A113D21E729DZ/45/1768817298/721ec6c0-1a9b-4ce7-922f-3995e41f7233.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'cosmo'), 4.7, 13, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('QV Cream Pump (500g) – 24-Hour Intensive Moisturizer for Extremely Dry & Sensitive Skin, Rich Hydrating Formula with Squalane, Fragrance-Free Non-Greasy Barrier Cream for Eczema Dermatitis & Psoriasis Relief 500grams', 'qv-cream-pump-500g-24-hour-intensive-moisturizer-for-extremely-dry-sen', 'About the product: QV Cream aids in the treatment and relief of dry skin conditions such as dermatitis, eczema, psoriasis, xerosis or ichthyosis. QV Cream relieves the symptoms of dry skin by helping to prevent loss of moisture; its hydrating and emollient properties help to restore normal skin condition. About the brand: QV Skincare is the brainchild of Ego Pharmaceuticals (Ego), which was founded in 1953 by young chemist, Gerald Oppenheim, and his wife, Rae, a nurse. It was in response to a request from the dermatology ward of Melbourne&rsquo;s iconic Queen Victoria Hospital, that Gerald Oppenheim created a specialist skincare product that would later become known as QV Bath Oil. Ingredients: Aqua (Water), Paraffinum Liquidum, Glycerin, Petrolatum, Cetearyl Alcohol, Dimethicone, Squalane, Glyceryl Stearate SE, Ceteareth-20, Stearic Acid, Laureth-3, Glyceryl Stearate, Methylparaben, Dichlorobenzyl Alcohol, Purified Water, Certified Organic Witch Hazel Ext Blend (Hamamelis Virginiana Extract (Witch Hazel*), Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice (Filet Of Aloe Vera*)), Glycerin, Phenoxyethanol, Rosa Centifolia (Rose) Flower Water, Fragrance (Natural Rose), Citric Acid, Citrus Grandis (Grapefruit) Seed Extract. How to use: Apply to affected areas as often as required, particularly after bathing, showering, shaving, exposure to harsh climatic conditions and at night. Apply with a cotton ball or soft pad to cleanse, soften, refresh and moisturize skin. Use anytime throughout the day as a softening refresher. Avoid eyes. For external use only. Store below 30&deg;C.', 'QV Cream aids in the treatment and relief of dry skin conditions such as dermatitis, eczema, psoriasis, xerosis or ichthyosis.', 4.5, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZF8B1994B53A5CE80B89FZ/45/_/1779179025/d553970f-500a-459f-8e82-7579857f68d7.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZF8B1994B53A5CE80B89FZ/45/_/1779179026/694933d0-e798-4874-8db1-e791b5ee097d.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZF8B1994B53A5CE80B89FZ/45/_/1779179026/023091b2-af0e-4922-af8a-ce24e3ff9f84.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZF8B1994B53A5CE80B89FZ/45/_/1779179026/a2f9e5d1-75e6-411f-acb1-be11df776229.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'qv'), 0, 0, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Alpha Plus Cream White 30grams', 'alpha-plus-cream-white-30grams', 'About the product: Alpha Plus Cream is a natural skin brightening cream that reduces the appearance of dark spots and evens out skin tone. A French formula consists of natural ingredients for an effective and safe brightening effect, It consists of two active ingredients from nature; Alpha arbutin 1% (bearberry) & Glabridin 0.5% (licorice roots). The effective, fast & safe skin whitening cream from AVALON Pharma A French formula consists of natural ingredients for effective & fast skin whitening as it contains two active constituents; Alpha Arbutin in the accurate required concentration for more effective skin whitening than any other skin whitening cream, and Glabridin which has skin lightening and also anti-inflammatory effect The synergism between the two active components gives Alpha Plus the ability to produce effective and fast skin whitening action that you can feel from the first week. About the brand: Avalon Pharma, based in Mumbai, has been in the pharmaceutical business for the last 20 years and is committed to supplying genuine and quality products to customers. We have well established pharmaceutical exporters and suppliers of international brand name companies and products. How to use: Use morning and night on clean skin.', 'Alpha Plus Cream is a natural skin brightening cream that reduces the appearance of dark spots and evens out skin tone.', 4.6, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z133D77CD1A35DBB84C92Z/45/_/1779179015/7762cfe7-744e-4a3b-8c38-782a720d38e2.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z133D77CD1A35DBB84C92Z/45/_/1779179015/62fc29a3-d6bd-45cf-b72f-23aa5392d09d.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z133D77CD1A35DBB84C92Z/45/_/1779179015/3471eac2-a516-4ac1-a02a-cb373d9c09e6.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z133D77CD1A35DBB84C92Z/45/_/1779179016/25894d58-26ee-48f8-918d-f34f906a2576.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'avalon-pharma'), 4.3, 1096, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Celimax The Vita-A Retinal Shot Tightening Booster 15ml', 'celimax-the-vita-a-retinal-shot-tightening-booster-15ml', 'RETINAL FORMULA: Advanced Vitamin A derivative that effectively targets signs of aging while promoting skin renewal and cellular turnover. SKIN TIGHTENING: Specialized booster designed to improve skin elasticity and firmness for a more lifted, youthful appearance. TEXTURE IMPROVEMENT: Lightweight, fast-absorbing formula that helps smooth skin texture and minimize the appearance of fine lines. NIGHTLY APPLICATION: Perfect addition to evening skincare routine, working while you sleep to enhance skin renewal. CONCENTRATED BOOSTER: Powerful formula that can be integrated into existing skincare routine to amplify anti-aging benefits', 'RETINAL FORMULA: Advanced Vitamin A derivative that effectively targets signs of aging while promoting skin renewal and cellular turnover.', 3.9, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z77541A21E782B509CF2CZ/45/1751866514/bd0ed713-84d8-4167-a533-53a1ed552713.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z77541A21E782B509CF2CZ/45/1751866515/4fa62c14-769e-4176-977e-0d4a967426f4.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z77541A21E782B509CF2CZ/45/1751866515/d065da6d-2730-4447-a576-1ac5cfeddb85.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z77541A21E782B509CF2CZ/45/1751866515/544a729e-0cff-4479-a484-5e9b0d9cc6c2.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'celimax'), 4.1, 13, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Face Cream Gel Hydro Boost 50ml', 'face-cream-gel-hydro-boost-50ml', 'Forget moisturizing, start thinking hydration! Hydration is the foundation of healthy looking skin. But factors such as lack of sleep, stress and not drinking enough water can lead to dehydrated, dull and tired-looking skin. Neutrogena Hydro Boost Face Gel Cream quenches dry skin and keeps it looking smooth and so supple that your skin bounces back. A lightweight, quick-absorbing formula, Neutrogena Hydro Boost Face Gel Cream delivers long-lasting moisture and hydration from top to toe. It contains hyaluronic acid, which is naturally found in the skin and acts as a sponge, absorbing up to 1,000 times its weight in water. The Neutrogena Hydro Face Body Gel Cream formula creates a reservoir which continuously releases hydration throughout the day. It replenishes skin with a pure boost of hydration, leaving the skin feeling soft, supple and revitalised around the clock. For skin so hydrated and supple that it bounces back, make Neutrogena Hydro Boost Face Gel Cream a part of your hydration regime today. Get intense hydration with Neutrogena Hydro Boost Face Gel Cream! About the brand: Neutrogena is a brand of the Johnson & Johnson Family of Consumer Companies. Recommended by dermatologist worldwide, Neutrogena has brought clinically-proven skin care solutions to consumers for over 60 years. By creating, innovating and rethinking what is possible in skincare, Neutrogena products for the face and body deliver real results without compromises. Its wide range of beauty and skin care lines has some of the world’s most loved products. Today Neutrogena offers more than 650 products worldwide in the face, body, acne, sun protection, makeup, men’s care, and anti-wrinkle categories. How to use: Apply everyday on cleansed face and neck with circular movements. Try a Hydro Boost Water Gel to help lock in hydration. Safety warnings: For external use only. Keep out of reach of children. Ingredients: Aqua, Glycerin, Isopropyl Palmitate, Petrolatum, Cetyl Alcohol, Dimethicone Sodium Hyaluronate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Caprylyl Glycol, Cetearyl Olivate, Sorbitan Olivate, Carbomer, Sodium Polyacrylate, Sodium Hydroxide, Tocopherol, Phenoxyethanol, Parfum, CI 42090.', 'Forget moisturizing, start thinking hydration! Hydration is the foundation of healthy looking skin.', 2.99, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZDDBCBEABD79E5EF5126EZ/45/_/1779344499/f6040937-b28a-4a13-a973-dd82c427ac74.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZDDBCBEABD79E5EF5126EZ/45/_/1779344499/47ba6d74-c4b1-4847-8ce3-ebbcf10527a2.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZDDBCBEABD79E5EF5126EZ/45/_/1779344499/51163227-2745-4742-9f09-6bb3b7ea3c97.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZDDBCBEABD79E5EF5126EZ/45/_/1779344499/616108e2-f744-432a-81ce-979824a681be.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'neutrogena'), 4.1, 1561, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'night', 'cream']::text[]),
  ('Soothing Gel Aloe Vera 99% Pure 250Ml', 'soothing-gel-aloe-vera-99-pure-250ml', 'A product containing aloe vera, which soothes and deeply moisturizes the skin Helps lock in hydration and repair cracks to nourish skin for a healthy glow Aloe Vera helps reddened and dry skin relax', 'A product containing aloe vera, which soothes and deeply moisturizes the skin Helps lock in hydration and repair cracks to nourish skin for…', 0.6, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z2C84DCC1911688EE4505Z/45/_/1706096423/5ca90c4d-a712-45d3-848d-3848d20460c8.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z2C84DCC1911688EE4505Z/45/_/1706096452/41ee28e9-d3e3-4db5-b76e-5fbcb7ac777a.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z2C84DCC1911688EE4505Z/45/_/1706096468/c64170d9-fcd5-4c3a-8dff-85dbd0268663.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'cosmo'), 4.5, 540, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Embryolisse Lait Creme Concentre 75ml', 'embryolisse-lait-creme-concentre-75ml-z6e985', 'INFUSED WITH NATURAL & ECO-FRIENDLY INGREDIENTS: Our exclusive concentrated milk-based face moisturizer cream is infused with natural ingredients such as shea butter & aloe vera, which are extracted from flowers and fruits. It also includes other eco-friendly ingredients like soy proteins and beeswax that help to brighten the skin & decrease redness. ALL-IN-ONE MOISTURIZER: Our natural moisturizing cream for all skin types is a 3 in 1 solution for your face and body. It acts as a make-up base to moisturize and protect; as a beauty mask, BELOVED BY MAKEUP ARTISTS: The Lait-Crème Concentré is unanimously loved by professional makeup artists and models alike because it prepares the skin perfectly for a makeup routine. Our cream nourishes the face and body and moisturizes the skin. It evens and smooths texture, and it unifies and brightens the complexion. BENEFITS ALL SKIN TYPES: All skin types deserve to feel fresh and clean so our gentle facial moisturizing cream is suitable for all skin types from sensitive to oily to dry and even combination skin types. Use this daily moisturizing cream without worrying about your sensitive skin. All Embryolisse products are dermatologically tested.', 'INFUSED WITH NATURAL & ECO-FRIENDLY INGREDIENTS: Our exclusive concentrated milk-based face moisturizer cream is infused with natural ingred…', 3.65, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z6E98544418E8F44B7BA0Z/45/_/1783662026/c1a95a77-e2c0-4202-b692-d16075d897e1.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z6E98544418E8F44B7BA0Z/45/1755046706/57850a11-d1e0-4b2b-b6fe-fe8f3a4ff0f2.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z6E98544418E8F44B7BA0Z/45/1755046706/bc00ee0d-e5d3-4ff4-b433-2468d7ca0206.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z6E98544418E8F44B7BA0Z/45/1755046706/f7ff8ecd-e45c-4c08-9a0c-e6e2930b3296.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where s