  ('Collagen And Elastin Moisturizer 283grams', 'collagen-and-elastin-moisturizer-283grams', 'This face moisturizer helps renew skin for a beautiful, healthy glow. Our moisturizer is dermatologist tested. Our renewing collagen & elastin daily facial moisturizer conditions skin for a youthful glow', 'This face moisturizer helps renew skin for a beautiful, healthy glow. Our moisturizer is dermatologist tested.', 2.54, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N22221658A/45/_/1766380436/a1926e0b-d8c0-49a7-b999-68f76fcf757a.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N22221658A/45/_/1764235578/22718a9c-c200-4add-9ca7-676954dc3ce1.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N22221658A/45/_/1764235579/a4cd8ea6-dfe8-4b2e-98c1-d2eb68870416.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N22221658A/45/_/1764235580/245bdf48-6b5a-4839-834c-ae7e97944f81.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'st-ives'), 0, 0, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Arencia Vitamin C Booster Shot Face and Eye Cream Moisturizer with Glutathione Radiance Boosting 30ml', 'arencia-vitamin-c-booster-shot-face-and-eye-cream-moisturizer-with-glu', '5% Vitamin C Complex + Glutathione – Powerful blend of stable Vitamin C and Glutathione to brighten dull skin, reduce dark spots, and promote a radiant, even tone.. Face and Eye Dual-Use Moisturizer – Lightweight cream formula designed for both face and delicate eye area, delivering hydration while targeting fine lines and tiredness for refreshed look.. Radiance Boosting & Antioxidant Protection – Helps visibly improve skin texture, fade unevenness, and shield against environmental stressors for healthier, glowing complexion.. Niacinamide & Barrier-Supporting Ingredients – Enriched with niacinamide, panthenol, and soothing agents to strengthen skin barrier, minimize irritation, and lock in moisture without stickiness.. 30ml Portable Tube for Daily Use – Convenient, quick-absorbing booster that layers easily under makeup or sunscreen, providing long-lasting brightness and comfort for all skin types.', '5% Vitamin C Complex + Glutathione – Powerful blend of stable Vitamin C and Glutathione to brighten dull skin, reduce dark spots, and promot…', 3.553, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE2C9C56349EFB447B698Z/45/_/1774059144/c385b71a-585c-4452-bb4c-b259e007dc14.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE2C9C56349EFB447B698Z/45/_/1774059144/ee493ca8-13fb-4b52-9664-2071be554e6c.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE2C9C56349EFB447B698Z/45/_/1774059144/a9544e5c-3a07-4dca-8a73-4d74de0a288f.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZE2C9C56349EFB447B698Z/45/_/1774059144/3323cbc2-91cd-4416-a9db-29ddeb56c9d6.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'arencia'), 4.3, 34, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Hydro Boost Water Gel 50ml', 'hydro-boost-water-gel-50ml', 'Welcome to the world of science-backed skincare, where Neutrogena''s mission is to break down the barriers that stand between you and great skin. Neutrogena believes that skin health should come first and is dedicated to helping you understand and care for your skin, no matter its color, type or issues. The brand sets a high standard for safety to ensure you can feel good about having healthy skin. Furthermore, Neutrogena is committed to improving not only your skin but also the world around us by advancing its product standards and social responsibility. The brand relies on scientists, dermatologists, and skin experts to create comprehensive products that meet all unique needs. Through easy-to-understand and accessible education on the science behind skin health, Neutrogena aims to give you the knowledge you need to take the best care of your skin.', 'Welcome to the world of science-backed skincare, where Neutrogena''s mission is to break down the barriers that stand between you and great s…', 2.6, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z6461BDF9801845769DE0Z/45/_/1779345623/92266662-3cb8-46e9-9aec-8a5bf3dbbdfe.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'neutrogena'), 4.1, 219, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Dr.Althea 345 Relief Cream - Soothing Face Moisturizer with Niacinamide & Panthenol | Blemish Care, Hydration & Redness Relief | Vegan Korean Skincare for All Skin Types', 'dr-althea-345-relief-cream-soothing-face-moisturizer-with-niacinamide-z47544', 'Centered on the brand’s signature "Resveratrol 345NA" plus multiple antioxidants, it penetrates deep into the skin to fight free radical damage. It relieves dullness, fine lines, and sagging caused by UV rays, late nights, and pollution. With a higher concentration of active ingredients than regular repair creams, it delivers stronger repair power for "early aging skin" or "damaged skin," restoring firmness and radiance with long-term use.. Each 50ml bottle has a velvety cream texture (non-heavy, non-greasy). Used twice daily (morning and night) with a soybean-sized amount each time, it lasts 2-3 months—more cost-effective than small-capacity repair creams. The sealed bottle opening locks in ingredient activity, preventing oxidation and ensuring optimal repair effects with every use.. Features a three-layer "hydrate + lock moisture + repair" formula: Top layer: Hyaluronic acid and panthenol for instant hydration, relieving dryness and tightness; Middle layer: Ceramides and plant oils (e.g., squalane) form a moisture-locking film to reduce water loss; Bottom layer: Resveratrol 345NA repairs damaged barriers and balances oil-water levels. It keeps dry skin moisturized without caking under makeup, and leaves oily skin fresh without breakouts—adapting to diverse skin needs.. The smooth cream spreads easily, absorbs quickly without greasiness, and doesn’t pill when layered with sunscreen or foundation—ideal as a morning skincare base. Applied thickly at night, it works as a "sleep repair mask," leveraging the skin’s nighttime metabolic peak for deep nourishment and relieving skin fatigue from daily environmental stress. The sleek, premium packaging adds a touch of elegance for home use or travel.. Free of alcohol, fragrances, mineral oil, and harsh preservatives, and dermatologically tested for gentleness (as indicated on select products). Infused with soothing ingredients like Centella asiatica extract and allantoin, it neutralizes potential mild irritation during repair. Suitable for seasonal sensitive skin and post-procedure skin (per doctor’s advice), it nourishes intensively while protecting the skin barrier.', 'Centered on the brand’s signature "Resveratrol 345NA" plus multiple antioxidants, it penetrates deep into the skin to fight free radical dam…', 4.55, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z47544FDBC0A388126985Z/45/_/1783756311/14f1d459-a93e-4391-a7dd-5c4a4d1d7836.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z47544FDBC0A388126985Z/45/_/1783756311/93913a10-9575-4530-ad45-a5e89936e2f9.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z47544FDBC0A388126985Z/45/_/1783756311/b72c470b-9b25-4277-9c8d-462d3bd8f116.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z47544FDBC0A388126985Z/45/_/1783756311/5a9892eb-a365-482a-894c-51c3bbe81b06.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'dr-althea'), 4.1, 81, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('L.aboratoires Embryolisse Lait-Creme Concentre Multi-Fonctions Soin Hydratant Base De Maquillage Masque Hydratant Lait Demaquillant Aloe Vera Karite 75ml', 'l-aboratoires-embryolisse-lait-creme-concentre-multi-fonctions-soin-hy', 'INFUSED WITH NATURAL & ECO-FRIENDLY INGREDIENTS: Our exclusive concentrated milk-based face moisturizer cream is infused with natural ingredients such as shea er & aloe vera, which are extracted from flowers and fruits. It also includes other eco-friendly ingredients like soy proteins and beeswax that help to brighten the skin & decrease redness.ALL-IN-ONE MOISTURIZER: Our natural moisturizing cream for all skin types is a 3 in 1 solution for your face and body. It acts as a make-up base to moisturize and protect; as a beauty mask,BELOVED BY MAKEUP ARTISTS: The Lait-Crème Concentré is unanimously loved by professional makeup artists and models alike because it prepares the skin perfectly for a makeup routine. Our cream nourishes the face and body and moisturizes the skin. It evens and smooths texture, and it unifies and brightens the complexion.BENEFITS ALL SKIN TYPES: All skin types deserve to feel fresh and clean so our gentle facial moisturizing cream is suitable for all skin types from sensitive to oily to dry and even combination skin types. Use this daily moisturizing cream without worrying about your sensitive skin. All products are dermatologically tested.', 'INFUSED WITH NATURAL & ECO-FRIENDLY INGREDIENTS: Our exclusive concentrated milk-based face moisturizer cream is infused with natural ingred…', 3.65, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZCF68C58CF000BA2495D3Z/45/_/1783587447/fc050d50-99a2-497c-9188-5d2603d2e281.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZCF68C58CF000BA2495D3Z/45/_/1725967066/156d6328-c73e-4053-a878-1f9634f9ab23.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZCF68C58CF000BA2495D3Z/45/_/1725967062/a362c16d-7bbf-4229-934b-008a89a31502.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZCF68C58CF000B