  ('SKINTIFIC Moisturizing Cream | Face Moisturizer for All Skin | Facial Creams with Hyaluronic Acid and 5X Ceramides | Hydrating Moisturizer | Fragrance Free Non-Comedogenic', 'skintific-moisturizing-cream-face-moisturizer-for-all-skin-facial-crea', '[ HYALURONIC ACID MOISTURIZER ] With hyaluronic acid, 5X ceramides, Centella Asiatica, Marine Collagen and TTE (Triangle Effect) technology for 24 hour hydration. Rich, velvety texture that leaves skin feeling smooth, it is absorbed quickly for softened skin without greasy, sticky, feel.. [ MOISTURIZER FOR ALL SKIN ] A deficiency of ceramides in skin can often be associated with dry skin, which can feel itchy and look flaky. SKINTIFIC Moisturizing Cream is formulated with five essential ceramides & hyaluronic acid.. [ GENTLE DAILY MOISTURIZER ] For face for all skin relief. No alcohol paraben-free Fragrance free, no mineral oil, no colorants Free Cruelty, allergy-tested, and non-comedogenic.. [ 5 ESSENTIAL CERAMIDES ] Ceramides are found naturally in the skin and make up 50% of the lipids in the skin barrier. All SKINTIFIC products are formulated with five essential ceramides, to help maintain the skin’s natural barrier.. [ DEVELOPED WITH DERMATOLOGISTS ] SKINIFIC Skincare is developed with dermatologists and has products suitable for dry skin, sensitive skin, oily skin, acne-prone, and more.', '[ HYALURONIC ACID MOISTURIZER ] With hyaluronic acid, 5X ceramides, Centella Asiatica, Marine Collagen and TTE (Triangle Effect) technology…', 4.9, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z8093CAC97381BB5678E5Z/45/1764296437/7bd465f5-2858-4c30-a1f0-6a21e87fb263.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z8093CAC97381BB5678E5Z/45/1764296437/4679aaf0-98ce-4dc1-b362-f471f6ec8f13.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z8093CAC97381BB5678E5Z/45/1764296437/78799caf-dfca-4b58-aa9b-881d5c1b4201.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z8093CAC97381BB5678E5Z/45/1764296437/a0bd1a55-4552-4424-a40a-329ec21517bd.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'skintific'), 5, 1, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Aloe Vera Face And Body Moisturizer Gel 300ml', 'aloe-vera-face-and-body-moisturizer-gel-300ml', 'Packaging may vary', 'Packaging may vary', 1.325, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N30194228A/45/_/1766380653/1fc343ea-fdc2-49dc-b470-586478ea28a0.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N30194228A/45/_/1764236052/d264b52e-b0f0-41ae-8da9-3ee186fc37ed.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N30194228A/45/_/1764236025/6bbb5312-17d4-4f23-b57b-036903875144.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N30194228A/45/_/1764236050/caeba109-4a02-4951-a2f5-1b0af76c7de0.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'himalaya'), 4.5, 571, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Multi-Vitamin Face Cream 80 g 80grams', 'multi-vitamin-face-cream-80-g-80grams', 'Gives fairer and even toned skin. Reduces blemishes, marks and dark circles. Triple sunscreens to protect from sun. Anti-oxidant prevents premature aging from free radicals', 'Gives fairer and even toned skin. Reduces blemishes, marks and dark circles. Triple sunscreens to protect from sun.', 1.275, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N26870047A/45/_/1761036462/ccd68fde-ac8f-4210-90c5-88fd67bf03cc.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N26870047A/45/_/1761036347/c644b3af-05bf-40eb-b49d-4eb8deb7a210.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N26870047A/45/_/1761036173/465766b1-d384-42e7-bedd-867c804e0310.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N26870047A/45/_/1761036172/d00949c4-1a09-4991-bcc3-3794c630ba8d.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'fair-lovely'), 4.4, 97, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Day And Night Beauty Cream Oil Free 30grams', 'day-and-night-beauty-cream-oil-free-30grams', 'Online shopping for Goree. Trusted Shipping to Riyadh, Jeddah and all KSA ✓ Great Prices ✓ Secure Shopping ✓ 100% Contactless ✓ Easy Free Returns ✓ Cash on Delivery. Shop Now', 'Online shopping for Goree. Trusted Shipping to Riyadh, Jeddah and all KSA ✓ Great Prices ✓ Secure Shopping ✓ 100% Contactless ✓ Easy Free Re…', 1.13, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N52271314A/45/_/1764235901/21ff9f9b-31dd-449e-b41a-31b71c960dd8.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N52271314A/45/_/1764235902/006a75c2-fd41-4e79-9b77-a180399c936e.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N52271314A/45/_/1764235903/5f1c12e2-d517-4f22-9b53-645cc0fba77a.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'goree'), 4.1, 393, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('3-Piece Clarifying Cream Set 135ml', '3-piece-clarifying-cream-set-135ml', 'Helps reduce the appearance of sagging and improve skin elasticity. Provides instant and long-term effects. Remarkably lifts, tones and plumps up skin. Unveils a softer, smoother, firmer, re-contoured and younger looking face and neck', 'Helps reduce the appearance of sagging and improve skin elasticity. Provides instant and long-term effects.', 2.96, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N24180121A/45/_/1766048529/34746f23-fc77-41fc-bea2-fc1a30926f78.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'creams-moisturizers'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'carotone'), 4.3, 612, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'creams', 'moisturizers', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Hyaluron Filler Epicelline Youth Serum, 30ml', 'hyaluron-filler-epicelline-youth-serum-30ml', 'Fight signs of aging like never before and achieve younger-looking skin in 4 weeks*. As we age, lifestyle and environmental factors deactivate our youth genes, leading to visible signs of skin aging. After 15 years of epigenetic research, Eucerin has discovered a way to reactivate these youth genes through its patented Age Clock Technology. Introducing the Eucerin Hyaluron-Filler Epicelline Serum—a revolutionary anti-aging face serum that reverses 10 signs of aging and makes skin look younger in just 30 days. With the powerful active ingredient Epicelline, the serum helps reactivate the skin’s youth genes at the root, making your skin look younger. The formula also contains micro and macro Hyaluronic Acid, Saponin and Enoxolone, which help plump up wrinkles and stimulate the skin’s own production of hyaluronic acid, collagen and elastin. 10 benefits in One: 1. Firmness 2. Lifting effect 3. Wrinkle reduction 4. Fine line reduction 5. Contours 6. Hydration 7. Radiance 8. Rejuvenation 9. Evenness 10. Smoothness The Epicelline Serum is a fast-absorbing, lightweight formula that doesn’t feel heavy on the skin. It is clinically proven to be effective for all skin types. 98% of users confirmed a reduction in wrinkles** after using the serum.', 'Fight signs of aging like never before and achieve younger-looking skin in 4 weeks*.', 17.818, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z3C502FAD1A973E4D6DDAZ/45/1761202600/a2452ac7-1a2a-41a0-a968-6407e387f7b4.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z3C502FAD1A973E4D6DDAZ/45/1762868064/5fc93e1c-cd9c-486d-934c-39977ebbeb71.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z3C502FAD1A973E4D6DDAZ/45/1762868064/7f91c9f7-5bbe-4d30-bcb3-17a6e0cb173a.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z3C502FAD1A973E4D6DDAZ/45/1762868064/5234d3d5-11e9-4e88-b746-afa053dcdf05.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'treatment-serums'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'eucerin'), 4, 11, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'treatment', 'serums', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Blue Copper Peptide Firming And Rejuvenating Essence Anti-Aging Serum 30ml - Skin Revitalizing Formula with Brightening Essence for Radiant Face Clinically Proven Wrinkle Reduction', 'blue-copper-peptide-firming-and-rejuvenating-essence-anti-aging-serum', '【Collagen-Boosting Elixir】JS Blue Copper Serum utilizes bioengineered peptides that increase collagen production by 210% in clinical studies. The optimized 2:1 copper-peptide ratio ensures cellular-level rejuvenation, visibly reducing sagging and restoring youthful bounce. 【All-Day Plumping Effect】Our moisture-lock technology combines 5 molecular weights of hyaluronic acid with ceramide NPs, providing continuous hydration that adapts to humidity changes. Perfect for dry climates or frequent flyers needing altitude-adjusted skincare. 【Age-Defying Multitasker】Replace 3 products with one serum – acts as primer, essence, and treatment. Minimizes pores while creating smooth canvas for makeup. Tested to enhance foundation adherence by 40% in consumer surveys. 【Sensitive Skin Savior】Formulated with 97% natural origin ingredients, this non-greasy serum soothes redness and strengthens fragile skin. pH 5.5 balance maintains microbiome health – ideal for post-procedure recovery or rosacea management. 【Eco-Conscious Luxury】Ethically sourced copper peptides in recyclable packaging with soy ink labels. Makes perfect Christmas/Valentine’s gifts – bundle with jade roller for enhanced absorption. Includes QR-code accessible skincare journal templates.', '【Collagen-Boosting Elixir】JS Blue Copper Serum utilizes bioengineered peptides that increase collagen production by 210% in clinical studies…', 3.393, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z3D2F5721D4DE64CE25ABZ/45/1757650653/3b0f1d9e-bb42-436f-b552-7b7dccf430b9.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z3D2F5721D4DE64CE25ABZ/45/1757646174/d5e363e7-db41-4730-ab94-f18c8b8e0f1c.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z3D2F5721D4DE64CE25ABZ/45/1757646173/1756cf48-9df4-4317-a871-3cb969de6600.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z3D2F5721D4DE64CE25ABZ/45/1757646175/4bb32f0c-37fe-4f6a-b828-fba69b649313.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'treatment-serums'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'hoygi'), 4.5, 39, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'treatment', 'serums', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Copper Peptide Anti-Aging Serum 30ml Clinically Proven Wrinkle Reduction Brightening Essence for Radiant Skin', 'copper-peptide-anti-aging-serum-30ml-clinically-proven-wrinkle-reducti', 'Powerful Copper Peptide Formula. Clinically Proven Wrinkle Reduction. Brightening Essence For Radiant Skin. Revitalizes And Firms Aging Skin. 30ml Premium Anti-Aging Serum', 'Powerful Copper Peptide Formula. Clinically Proven Wrinkle Reduction. Brightening Essence For Radiant Skin.', 2.49, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/190feae77e3f544eb634bbbd67f1e3b0|pzsku/ZD24F2D1DBD775081D7C7Z/45/1768810170/3a4c5f05-c2f4-4b9c-b3d2-a8c990578706.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZD24F2D1DBD775081D7C7Z/45/1756018784/b5ccfecd-4edc-434d-958c-6bb1a330fb6f.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZD24F2D1DBD775081D7C7Z/45/1756018784/214d52ac-b7b8-4ac1-bfb5-7cfbf017edba.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZD24F2D1DBD775081D7C7Z/45/1756018783/f2033a44-0cb1-449a-9112-2ec89652fa61.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'treatment-serums'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'hoygi'), 4.3, 54, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'treatment', 'serums', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Resurfacing Retinol Serum To Reduce The Appearance Of Post-Acne Marks And Pores With Retinol, Licorice Root Extract & Niacinamide 30ml', 'resurfacing-retinol-serum-to-reduce-the-appearance-of-post-acne-marks', 'Recommended use in the evening only and always follow with SPF protection in the daytime – we suggest CeraVe AM Facial Moisturising Lotion SPF 50. ​Use pump applicator to dispense product onto fingers. We suggest start with a small amount, and by using once a week. Then build up use that is tolerated by your skin. ​Avoid contact with eyes and lips, if contact occurs, rinse thoroughly with water. ​', 'Recommended use in the evening only and always follow with SPF protection in the daytime – we suggest CeraVe AM Facial Moisturising Lotion S…', 6.13, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z6C77D9451A65B1ADA483Z/45/_/1778231404/d78e7bf0-d25c-4821-9019-333d61d8b640.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z6C77D9451A65B1ADA483Z/45/_/1778231404/1c9b7de4-ce3b-496c-8f60-106eda5f18c3.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z6C77D9451A65B1ADA483Z/45/_/1778231404/e64c9614-6842-4d2d-bb9e-16042644eb8b.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z6C77D9451A65B1ADA483Z/45/_/1778231403/047b17fc-bf99-4c07-a9e0-dbdc1b585a2e.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'treatment-serums'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'cerave'), 4.6, 326, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'treatment', 'serums', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Fast Bright Booster Serum 30x Vitamin C+ 30 ml', 'fast-bright-booster-serum-30x-vitamin-c-30-ml', 'Garnier Fast Bright 30x Vitamin C+ Serum is a lightweight, fast-absorbing formula enriched with powerful ingredients like Vitamin C, activating BHA, and Niacinamide. This blend helps visibly brighten the skin and even out skin tone. Clinically proven to reduce the appearance of dark spots by up to 66%, it''s suitable for all skin types—even sensitive skin. With 100x the brightening power of Vitamin C, it''s your go-to solution for radiant, even-toned skin.', 'Garnier Fast Bright 30x Vitamin C+ Serum is a lightweight, fast-absorbing formula enriched with powerful ingredients like Vitamin C, activat…', 2.5, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N45380432A/45/_/1764242506/0d68b628-0d42-443b-bc4f-f2b9e21c3fa4.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N45380432A/45/_/1764242503/160e8461-3e92-4e39-a7a0-9a1b7214e3ba.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N45380432A/45/_/1764242505/676ce17d-c246-4a1e-a509-dc6721286098.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pnsku/N45380432A/45/_/1764242506/5faba1ba-573d-442b-9f16-a25afe549ac3.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'treatment-serums'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'garnier'), 4.3, 3151, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'treatment', 'serums', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence 100ml', 'advanced-snail-96-mucin-power-essence-100ml', 'Loaded with 96% snail mucin extract to replenish and repair damaged skin to its healthiest. Snail is known for its powerful skin transforming and repairing properties. Replenishes nutrients to the skin to prevent and repair damages and fills the skin with elasticity for a healthier, younger looking skin. Contains the ability to repair everything from dry patches, to acne breakouts, lightening hyperpigmentation with regular use', 'Loaded with 96% snail mucin extract to replenish and repair damaged skin to its healthiest.', 3.268, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z04A90C9E84C5292894DCZ/45/_/1780983261/ed35b0d2-6103-4ec2-8080-a438bd5eb760.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z04A90C9E84C5292894DCZ/45/_/1780983262/05fbf1d8-2562-4679-8620-28052c33a829.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z04A90C9E84C5292894DCZ/45/_/1780983261/55078856-a4db-4cc2-9106-0134d1e2b996.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z04A90C9E84C5292894DCZ/45/_/1780983262/a3f4748e-63c1-4d54-9411-08dafce6992e.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'treatment-serums'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'cosrx'), 3, 2879, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'treatment', 'serums', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Hyaluronic Acid 2% + B5 30ml', 'hyaluronic-acid-2-b5-30ml', 'About the product: The molecular size of HA determines its depth of delivery in the skin. This formulation combines low-, medium- and high-molecular weight HA, as well as a next-generation HA crosspolymer at a combined concentration of 2% for multi-depth hydration. This system is supported with the addition of Vitamin B5 which also enhances surface hydration. A more advanced HA formulation with 15 forms of HA, including precursors of HA, is offered by our brand NIOD in Multi-Molecular Hyaluronic Complex. About the brand: The Ordinary is an evolving collection of treatments offering familiar, effective clinical technologies positioned to raise pricing and communication integrity in skincare. The brand was created to celebrate integrity in its most humble and true form. Its offering is pioneering, not in the familiar technologies it uses, but in its honesty and integrity. The Ordinary is born to disallow commodity to be disguised as ingenuity. The Ordinary is "Clinical formulations with integrity". Ingredients: Water, Sodium Hyaluronate, Pentylene Glycol, Propanediol, Sodium Hyaluronate Crosspolymer, Panthenol, Ahnfeltia Concinna Extract, Glycerin, Trisodium Ethylenediamine Disuccinate, Citric Acid, Isoceteth-20, Ethoxydiglycol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Hexylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Phenoxyethanol, Caprylyl Glycol. How to use: Apply a few drops over the entire face in the AM and PM before creams.', 'The molecular size of HA determines its depth of delivery in the skin.', 2.935, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/fb889ec50f784103a85817c4c97eadd1|pzsku/Z228182DE2C527C49E049Z/45/1771237708/5cc3ea15-fb26-4795-a6a7-23ca71784423.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/fb889ec50f784103a85817c4c97eadd1|pzsku/Z228182DE2C527C49E049Z/45/1771237708/ab8beaf2-5dfd-4084-857d-600b26da8697.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/fb889ec50f784103a85817c4c97eadd1|pzsku/Z228182DE2C527C49E049Z/45/1771237708/b71481b8-47a