  ('Advanced Snail 96 Mucin Repair Essence 100 ml, Facial Moisturizing Serum with Snail Secretion Filter, for Dark Spots and Fine Lines, Not Tested on Animals, Paraben Free', 'advanced-snail-96-mucin-repair-essence-100-ml-facial-moisturizing-seru', 'Features Formulated with 96% snail filtrate (Mucin), this serum protects skin from moisture loss while keeping skin texture smooth and healthy. This serum is made from nutritious, low irritation filtered snail mucin to keep your skin moisturized and rejuvenated throughout the day. Filtered snail mucus replenishes and restores nutrients for healthy skin. Suitable for all skin types. Specification Name: Facial Essence Ingredients: Snail Secretion Filter, Sodium Hyaluronate, etc. Effects: Repair, moisturize, soothe, dark spots and fine lines, snail mucus Package Contains 1x Facial Essence How to Use After cleansing and toning, apply a small amount to the entire face. Gently pat with fingertips to aid absorption, then apply moisturizer. Caution Before applying to the face, perform a patch test on the skin. If there is no allergic reaction 24 hours after the patch test, continue to apply to the face.', 'Features Formulated with 96% snail filtrate (Mucin), this serum protects skin from moisture loss while keeping skin texture smooth and healt…', 3.9, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z494400CA068D212A93CDZ/45/_/1776127749/40f56309-6a86-454e-aca9-db71cfeed95b.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z494400CA068D212A93CDZ/45/_/1776127749/133f917c-6406-4502-96d4-b338e51c892c.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z494400CA068D212A93CDZ/45/_/1776127749/94fba1d9-ad13-4004-9231-e367c290a527.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z494400CA068D212A93CDZ/45/_/1776127749/96b70479-dc47-414b-bec3-396559a1ed82.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'treatment-serums'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'univer-tang'), 4.5, 36, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'treatment', 'serums', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Snail Truecica Miracle Repair Serum 50ml', 'snail-truecica-miracle-repair-serum-50ml', 'Ingredients- Water, Butylene Glycol, Niacinamide, 1,2-Hexanediol, Snail Secretion Filtrate, C12-14 Pareth-12, C12-14 Pareth-7, Carbomer, Tromethamine, Dioscorea Japonica Root Extract, Trehalose, Ethylhexylglycerin, Beta-Glucan, Hydrolyzed Corn Starch, Citrus Aurantium Bergamia (Bergamot) Fruit Oil, Allantoin, Adenosine, Disodium Edta, Sucrose, Melaleuca Alternifolia (Tea Tree) Leaf Extract, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Agrimonia Eupatoria Extract, Salvia Officinalis (Sage) Oil, Centella Asiatica Extract, Salvia Officinalis (Sage) Leaf Extract, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Chamaecyparis Obtusa Leaf Extract, Silybum Marianum Seed Extract, Perilla Frutescens Leaf Extract, Sodium Chondroitin Sulfate, Broussonetia Kazinoki Root Extract, Propolis Extract, Artemisia Capillaris Extract, Cimicifuga Dahurica Root Extract, Salix Alba (Willow) Bark Extract, Pentylene Glycol, Madecassoside, Oenothera Biennis (Evening Primrose) Flower Extract, Asiaticoside, Asiatic Acid, Madecassic Acid, Phenoxyethanol', 'Ingredients- Water, Butylene Glycol, Niacinamide, 1,2-Hexanediol, Snail Secretion Filtrate, C12-14 Pareth-12, C12-14 Pareth-7, Carbomer, Tro…', 11.9, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZD1B1BDEEB4845854821BZ/45/_/1778231157/928afad2-bcf5-4103-81c1-98f096738bba.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZD1B1BDEEB4845854821BZ/45/_/1778231157/55c50076-9506-4a10-87a2-500b3efaa7e3.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZD1B1BDEEB4845854821BZ/45/_/1778231156/0144d024-9b7d-4beb-9331-fa0587304ef2.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZD1B1BDEEB4845854821BZ/45/_/1778231157/87a2bcad-f35c-400b-8ed5-d3f21d64f672.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'treatment-serums'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'some-by-mi'), 4.4, 91, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'treatment', 'serums', 'face']::text[