  ('EELHOE Dark Spot Correcting Glow Serum 176 fl. oz. | Brightening, Dark Spot Treatment, Anti-Aging, Acne Scars, Fine Lines, Hyperpigmentation, and Dark Circles', 'eelhoe-dark-spot-correcting-glow-serum-176-fl-oz-brightening-dark-spot', 'Corrects pigmentation and improves uneven skin tone. With the help of plant-derived Squalane, this serum retains moisture to keep your skin glowing and healthy wherever you go.. The first serum specially made for hot, humid weather. -brightens spots.. -reduces pigmentation problems and moisturizes.. Acne,Dark Cirlce,Brightening,Moisturizing,Wrinkles,Anti-aging,Uneven Pigment', 'Corrects pigmentation and improves uneven skin tone.', 2.332, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z868848BA5DDDC9DA6D98Z/45/_/1783397473/fd14bdd4-ee9e-41ee-9df2-f304c5d7df14.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z868848BA5DDDC9DA6D98Z/45/1751513350/183f1673-49e2-4caf-ac18-b4f0c5647211.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z868848BA5DDDC9DA6D98Z/45/1746426653/49b1b5ef-d28c-406c-b66f-96b8489d3d12.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z868848BA5DDDC9DA6D98Z/45/1751680853/8cba07bb-6d88-4068-b81d-eb0505869c41.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'treatment-serums'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'eelhoe'), 3.9, 786, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'treatment', 'serums', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Peach 70% Niacinamide Serum brightening hydrating face serum hyperpigmentation treatment reducing melanine daily clean beauty, 30ml pink', 'peach-70-niacinamide-serum-brightening-hydrating-face-serum-hyperpigme', 'Anua Peach 70% Niacinamide Serum is a facial serum to deliver glass skin instantly and over time. This peach serum helps brighten our dull skin with soft texture care. How To Use: Use after cleansing & toning, up to twice daily. Always finish with sunscreen for daytime use. Smooth 2-3 drops over face & neck and avoid eyes. A little goes a long way.', 'Anua Peach 70% Niacinamide Serum is a facial serum to deliver glass skin instantly and over time.', 4.2, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBE2AB6DEB4AACB0B0A62Z/45/_/1779791564/5c074e60-e620-40fa-b3c6-3e34bcf2d1c0.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBE2AB6DEB4AACB0B0A62Z/45/_/1779791564/6e63f160-818a-4cab-ae3b-3dccaf06691a.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBE2AB6DEB4AACB0B0A62Z/45/_/1779791564/b4ebfd5d-e0fd-4f7b-9f31-044e1498748d.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/ZBE2AB6DEB4AACB0B0A62Z/45/_/1779791565/f0e73027-a902-4fd1-9275-4614b9905786.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'treatment-serums'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'anua'), 4.3, 82, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'treatment', 'serums', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Blue Copper Peptide Serum 30ml, Skin Revitalizing Formula with Brightening Essence, Moisturizing and Brightening Skin Serum, Anti Aging Essence, Reduce Fine Lines, Tighten Pores', 'blue-copper-peptide-serum-30ml-skin-revitalizing-formula-with-brighten', 'Our Blue Copper Peptide Face Serums are infused with powerful antioxidants that help rebuild collagen, effectively reducing fine lines and wrinkles while enhancing skin elasticity for a youthful appearance.', 'Our Blue Copper Peptide Face Serums are infused with powerful antioxidants that help rebuild collagen, effectively reducing fine lines and w…', 9.9, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z0E7666C7343B40746B06Z/45/1754463156/998f5d3e-528a-4147-94aa-692e1e9c20a8.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z0E7666C7343B40746B06Z/45/1754463156/b06b7d84-b4ea-4d23-ae11-94277a335ddb.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z0E7666C7343B40746B06Z/45/1754463156/99a7f8cd-d8ba-495e-9529-7017fa82139a.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z0E7666C7343B40746B06Z/45/1754463156/a7a64874-168f-498c-afcb-347fef91eec3.jpg?width=1200"]'::jsonb, (select id from public.categories where slug = 'treatment-serums'), (select id from public.brands where slug = 'hoygi'), 5, 4, 0, true, false, true, ARRAY['skin', 'care', 'treatment', 'serums', 'face']::text[]),
  ('Triple Collagen Serum Nourish dull skin with Triple Collagen Complex - A lightweight serum with Niacinamide and Hyaluronic Acid - Korean Skincare', 'triple-collagen-serum-nourish-dull-skin-with-triple-collagen-complex-a', 'medicube Triple Collagen Serum is a powerful serum that helps to boost skin elasticity and nourish dull skin with the envious glass glow. The Triple Collagen Complex with Hydrolyzed collagen, atelo collagen, and soluble collagen penetrate faster and deeper into the skin barrier, providing even the deepest skin layer with the essential nutrients for plump and healthy-looking skin. This lightweight serum is suitable for all skin types and provides long-lasting skin suppleness and glow. It is particularly beneficial for matured skin and those who want to achieve a healthy glow. The key ingredients in this serum are Enantia Chlorantha Bark Extract and Olive Leaf Extract. Enantia Chlorantha Bark Extract is a patented ingredient for pore care, while Olive Leaf Extract is a patented ingredient for blemish and freckle care. Apply a small amount of the serum onto the face and neck, avoiding the eye area. Gently massage in circular motions until fully absorbed. Use daily in the morning and at night for best results. Everyone has skin concerns. But not everyone finds the right solution. By working with dermatologists, we research the most effective formula and develop using the best ingredients.', 'medicube Triple Collagen Serum is a powerful serum that helps to boost skin elasticity and nourish dull skin with the envious glass glow.', 4.485, NULL, 'BHD', '["https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z67E651B61313453AD5D3Z/45/1749025673/fef2eb9e-19dc-4ac2-b4d1-9d14a0667b24.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z67E651B61313453AD5D3Z/45/1750600680/c90f77f2-0ab3-4fb9-b119-891e0c3ade23.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z67E651B61313453AD5D3Z/45/1750600683/cb2d72bd-8476-462b-a513-7f6224a066e1.jpg?width=1200","https://f.nooncdn.com/p/pzsku/Z67E651B61